<!doctype html><html lang="zh-CN" data-site-prefix="../" data-page-kind="topic"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Group 与自研子程序的数据边界 · 架构逆向与实现对照文档</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="../公共资源/样式/542ae2d5e2de76f7a482e81bed7afe56395d5076e55bb540bec24f2862bef6e9.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="../公共资源/样式/2d6f64a41592ecc5580f5c9af7df50312d13003a44b11a009e97a399d0f450fe.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="../公共资源/样式/0406149be904073c2ce7f9c463de30c838a7e631d14c8d5bb6a37504503d377b.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="../公共资源/样式/803029919eed32de8e6b562de1110670aa54f8c208a24d221e5d9aec09164500.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="../公共资源/样式/d5fece9265f8ae702d5f7a43c7726a744c7ed184259f0e2cb8a9cfd1cef19b94.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="../公共资源/样式/2da1f7cfd40bdcb9d85e54468d109c375ebeade01cfe9c94372762f7bb9200ed.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="../公共资源/样式/e0aa4d2e552f0df112cd943bd3ba39229da3836f54211ecabd618e977dfa3702.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="../公共资源/site.css"></head><body><a class="site-skip" href="#main-content">跳到正文</a><header class="site-header"><nav aria-label="主导航"><a href="../index.html">首页／界面入口</a><a href="../主题/主界面入口.html">主界面</a><a href="../工具/index.html">工具窗口</a><a href="../数据/index.html">数据与 Owner</a><a href="../主题/执行与状态.html">执行与结果</a><a href="../清单/交付与兼容.html">范围／兼容</a></nav><p class="breadcrumb">架构逆向与实现对照文档 / Group 与自研子程序的数据边界</p><h1>Group 与自研子程序的数据边界</h1><p class="muted">原版事实、当前独立实现、拟议设计与未知分别保留。导航示意属于文档组织，不代表原程序的控件树或完整运行验证。</p><p id="route-message" role="status" hidden></p></header><main id="main-content" class="site-main"><p class="site-notice">本页正文与分类来自拆分前页面。长原文已迁移到内容寻址证据页，原始 SHA 和返回路径仍保留。</p><div class="source-content"><section id="group-data-pipeline"><h3>Group逐轮数据：输入、索引、累积与退出</h3><p>按同一个数据问题并排研究，不建立两套对象的一一映射，也不把局部成员顺序当成同一运行实例的全链。</p><section data-group-capabilities="true"><style>[data-group-capability-columns]{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:12px}[data-group-capability-columns]&gt;article{min-width:0;overflow-wrap:anywhere}[data-group-capability-columns] pre{overflow:auto;max-width:100%}@media(max-width:1000px){[data-group-capability-columns]{grid-template-columns:1fr}}</style><h3>Group ↔ 自研子程序：八项完整能力对照</h3><p>“对应子程序”是能力对照，不是对象、调度、类型或释放协议等价。先辨认程序，再读每条关系。SunEye栏的source-confirmed仅指该项目采集版本源码，绝不作为原版VM证据。</p><p>中断时点：原VM所选DoWork与REA当前都在本轮前判断；SunEye所选SubroutineTool在本轮执行并累计之后判断。</p><p>循环索引：VM发布Start/End/LoopIndex；REA GroupLoopIndex与普通子调用输入分开；SunEye CurrentIteration属性尚不能据此认定内部节点已有可订阅LoopIndex。</p><p>图像累积：REA当前GrayImage勾累积仍保留末帧；SunEye所选Image累积配置直接抛错；VM图像/复合全类型及最终载荷另留未知。</p><p>拥有关系：REA用GroupOwner校验独占body；SunEye通过SubroutineId关联普通Workflow并标IsSubroutine，其更广的共享/删除约束仍按具体证据核查。</p><details data-group-capability="create"><summary>创建与身份</summary><p>它是普通流程调用，还是一个节点独占的内部子程序？</p><div data-group-capability-columns="true"><article data-group-capability-side="original"><h4>原版VM · Group</h4><p>见逐关系分类</p><p>原工具箱普通IMVSGroup有宿主层级门，通用工厂通过Cs类型/参数构造；已载入模块按Name+ID去重并更新集合。</p><details data-group-capability-relation="GEO01"><summary>GEO01 · DecoratorBase.DropItemsCommandExecute工具箱分支 → 运行门 / GroupTools载入 / 普通IMVSGroup深度门和历史捕获</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>逐object[]读decorator、Point及可选前驱；DecorateSource为IToolBoxData时先CheckRunning(当前宿主as IVMRun)，它仅检查IsRunning并提示拒绝，没有null门。DirPath.Contains(GroupTools)走路径拼装和VmSolution.LoadGroup，成功后建装饰器并写Position；此支路在下面普通工具try/catch之外。普通工具中Info精确IMVSGroup且宿主IVMGroup时，GetLevel&gt;=2提示并break；然后按方案/其它注册不同RootOperation，再AddNewItem。不能把普通分支深度门外推到GroupTools路径。</p><p>仅按保留的类型/成员/资源和逐关系源码解释，不把节点相邻补成同一运行对象。</p><p>此正式关系未单列完整缓存合同；不能据入口/配置存在推断结果保留策略。</p><p>此正式关系未单列所有退出/异常资源释放；按原record的unknowns保留边界。</p><p>待核：GroupTools载入/密码/导入callback另见已有链，不据LoadGroup名称证明native模块和UI集合均到位；失败后源状态与所有历史所有者未知。</p><details><summary>VMControls.WPF.DataForUI.DecoratorBase::DropItemsCommandExecute</summary><p></p><p>99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="73ab07637905b8356c513fdd7e03f26776261bb61f25f68bf72255c191aee11e" href="../../证据/73ab07637905b8356c513fdd7e03f26776261bb61f25f68bf72255c191aee11e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>73ab07637905</small></a></details><details><summary>VMControls.WPF.DataForUI.DecoratorBase::CheckRunning</summary><p></p><p>99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="6fa593cc1ff801653704f0b0b897abed8293eb9c11a9cf7eac630ad839f19a94" href="../../证据/6fa593cc1ff801653704f0b0b897abed8293eb9c11a9cf7eac630ad839f19a94.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>6fa593cc1ff8</small></a></details><details><summary>toolbox running/group/depth/history gates</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="793efbbb34c879e5aa9b0b2d53ed7cd068d4cb174c20fcba85f4abc64482083a" href="../../证据/793efbbb34c879e5aa9b0b2d53ed7cd068d4cb174c20fcba85f4abc64482083a.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>793efbbb34c8</small></a></details><details><summary>running predicate and nullable caller boundary</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="6efbc7f61a5647e0f7f4540a128cd883da961c114ecaa883404314146a74739a" href="../../证据/6efbc7f61a5647e0f7f4540a128cd883da961c114ecaa883404314146a74739a.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>6efbc7f61a56</small></a></details></details><details data-group-capability-relation="GEO02"><summary>GEO02 · ToolBoxItemData.AddNewItem → 自定义构造 / Cs 首个 IVmModule 类型</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>自定义完整类型名时传 param、Name；否则加载 InfoCs、Librarys.Config 中存在的库及可选 Control DLL，取首个可赋给 IVmModule 的类型并传 param 构造。与存量模块缺 Cs 的 fallback 不是同一条链。</p><p>仅按保留的类型/成员/资源和逐关系源码解释，不把节点相邻补成同一运行对象。</p><p>此正式关系未单列完整缓存合同；不能据入口/配置存在推断结果保留策略。</p><p>此正式关系未单列所有退出/异常资源释放；按原record的unknowns保留边界。</p><p>待核：构造器进入 native 身份/IO 的完整链未在本页取齐。</p><details><summary>ToolBoxItemData.AddNewItem</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="89bdf9d338564f8391fcb708b45bd8908797b9e2bac790838265eec7140af8ac" href="../../证据/89bdf9d338564f8391fcb708b45bd8908797b9e2bac790838265eec7140af8ac.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>89bdf9d33856</small></a></details></details><details data-group-capability-relation="GEO03"><summary>GEO03 · VmModuleSet.AddModuleByInfo → 构造 → Name+ID 去重 → Modules 替换</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>先 CreatModuleByInfo，再查 Name+ID；重复时返回旧实例，否则加新实例；最后替换 VmModuleCollection。Modules setter 发 Modules 和 Children 通知。</p><p>仅按保留的类型/成员/资源和逐关系源码解释，不把节点相邻补成同一运行对象。</p><p>此正式关系未单列完整缓存合同；不能据入口/配置存在推断结果保留策略。</p><p>此正式关系未单列所有退出/异常资源释放；按原record的unknowns保留边界。</p><details><summary>VmModuleSet.AddModuleByInfo</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="38641f17c8c4d7291d154b36dd067a7f199c31812d1f0bc315669c45d1631b07" href="../../证据/38641f17c8c4d7291d154b36dd067a7f199c31812d1f0bc315669c45d1631b07.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>38641f17c8c4</small></a></details><details><summary>VmModuleSet.Modules setter</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="da5f608f516c71b61e5351f49cfea4bc24c3a2299635158ab4e05f61a615fa78" href="../../证据/da5f608f516c71b61e5351f49cfea4bc24c3a2299635158ab4e05f61a615fa78.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>da5f608f516c</small></a></details></details><details data-group-capability-relation="GEO31"><summary>GEO31 · IMVSGroup(object) → VmModuleSet(object,typeName) → VmModule(object,typeName) → 按宿主类型构造SyncAddOneModule描述并登记模型</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>现有VM.Core反编译体显示IMVSGroup(object param)把param和IMVSGroup类型名交base，VmModuleSet继续交VmModule。VmModule构造中VmProcedure宿主用SetNodeType=1及procedure.ID，IMVSGroup宿主用20及group.ID，VmSolution用1及10999；之后CreateToModuleSet构造同步添加描述，UTF8固定64字节模块名、256字节本地化显示名、WaitTime=5000，交mModuleManager.SyncAddOneModule，返回信息交Init(...,vmModuleSet)。构造末尾AllModules.AddOrUpdate并发ModuleAdded事件。只连接这些已见托管成员，不由通用反射工厂断言它实际选中了某个Cs派生构造。</p><p>父宿主对象、native请求父类型/ID、返回的module信息与AllModules注册是分开的阶段。</p><p>native ID来自SyncAddOneModule返回后Init使用，不是当前Guid；本切片没有取得该SDK/native接收体。</p><p>创建失败完整回滚/临时对象释放未由此保证；构造没有在所选代码段建立所有异常清理合同。</p><p>待核：下一明确接收成员是VM.PlatformSDKCS.ModuleManager.SyncAddOneModule及其PInvoke/native callee；本次不新取native体。</p><p>待核：VM.Core原bytes已按既有identity重新SHA校验，成员文本使用已有反编译源，未新做CIL逐指令绑定。</p><details><summary>IMVSGroup(object)</summary><p></p><p>retained VM.Core SHA256 936763f6c8a1bf9fcf59f22acebca8feb09b5f3d5701ae77c82bdc81e626190d / MVID 290025bc-e040-4cd5-94dd-cd49b9af9c99; original bytes rehashed, no fresh member CIL capture in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="cd804fcbac1a8f694b58ca7cdb3287ce72e3aaf2547007b38f63711bafbb56a4" href="../../证据/cd804fcbac1a8f694b58ca7cdb3287ce72e3aaf2547007b38f63711bafbb56a4.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>cd804fcbac1a</small></a></details><details><summary>VmModuleSet(object,string)</summary><p></p><p>retained VM.Core SHA256 936763f6c8a1bf9fcf59f22acebca8feb09b5f3d5701ae77c82bdc81e626190d / MVID 290025bc-e040-4cd5-94dd-cd49b9af9c99; original bytes rehashed, no fresh member CIL capture in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0d6fc24e7fd882f9dd6515f3ae0f10f700cc3bd8e751d454c3ed0956c3b62123" href="../../证据/0d6fc24e7fd882f9dd6515f3ae0f10f700cc3bd8e751d454c3ed0956c3b62123.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0d6fc24e7fd8</small></a></details><details><summary>VmModule(object,string)</summary><p></p><p>retained VM.Core SHA256 936763f6c8a1bf9fcf59f22acebca8feb09b5f3d5701ae77c82bdc81e626190d / MVID 290025bc-e040-4cd5-94dd-cd49b9af9c99; original bytes rehashed, no fresh member CIL capture in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="1f43fecdc18c5b4052faad529aea253fbebde54049f5f553949b3f64f68b0f39" href="../../证据/1f43fecdc18c5b4052faad529aea253fbebde54049f5f553949b3f64f68b0f39.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>1f43fecdc18c</small></a></details><details><summary>VmModule.CreateToModuleSet</summary><p></p><p>retained VM.Core SHA256 936763f6c8a1bf9fcf59f22acebca8feb09b5f3d5701ae77c82bdc81e626190d / MVID 290025bc-e040-4cd5-94dd-cd49b9af9c99; original bytes rehashed, no fresh member CIL capture in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="69e14303c33be9d688a116e85cfc83e33c6779c8a6784677c6b02a4e97107d9f" href="../../证据/69e14303c33be9d688a116e85cfc83e33c6779c8a6784677c6b02a4e97107d9f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>69e14303c33b</small></a></details></details><p>待核：普通工厂的首IVmModule选择不证明实际具体Cs派生目标；托管构造请求已补到SyncAddOneModule，但native模块ID生产/失败回滚仍缺对应接收体。</p></article><article data-group-capability-side="current"><h4>REA当前恢复 · owned Group</h4><p>independent-implementation</p><p>当前新建Group节点与独占body一起进入事务；历史跨流程引用保留另一条路径。</p><details data-group-capability-relation="GEC01"><summary>GEC01 · GraphEditorDocument.AddOwnedGroup / EnterOwnedGroup → 新node、独立body Guid及GroupOwnership</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>AddOwnedGroup在EditProcedure草稿中先AddNode(workflow.subprogram)再EnterOwnedGroup。EnterOwnedGroup拒绝非Group模块或Disabled；已配置body必须严格等于(CurrentProcedureId,nodeId)所有者，否则拒绝旧跨流程调用。首次创建独立Guid的ProcedureDocument、GroupOwner和父节点Call；直接EnterOwnedGroup通过Edit的selectedProcedure选择body。AddOwnedGroup把这一步放在EditProcedure草稿中，外层EditProcedure提交不切换可见CurrentProcedureId，不能把两条入口混成都会自动进入body。CanAddOwnedGroup与EnterOwnedGroup分别核祖先深度，最大三层。OwnedGroups.Validate额外要求body只被一个节点引用且父节点确实指回。</p><p>当前owned Group body是独立ProcedureDocument，由(parent procedure ID,node ID)定位；不是只靠Name或显示文字。</p><p>名称同步在Edit流水线中按父node名称更新；稳定身份仍是ID。</p><p>创建与选中不创建独立solution scope，生命周期跟随当前solution及编辑模型。</p><p>待核：此为当前独立所有权模型，不冒充原版IMVSGroup/VmModuleSet对象布局。</p><details><summary>AddOwnedGroup</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="5662065bd7b3e945bc2ccf2cc55c227b480e1b274508a4916d805e50f8a3bde2" href="../../证据/5662065bd7b3e945bc2ccf2cc55c227b480e1b274508a4916d805e50f8a3bde2.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>5662065bd7b3</small></a></details><details><summary>CanAddOwnedGroup</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="5dc8672bd5832eff510ef1675efbd50fcfe3f7f3ada0ba6edbec4972d4f5b763" href="../../证据/5dc8672bd5832eff510ef1675efbd50fcfe3f7f3ada0ba6edbec4972d4f5b763.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>5dc8672bd583</small></a></details><details><summary>EnterOwnedGroup</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="42b53e62c7eed4d219a9de34af73825438e3763a6fe9d69fb21636472932d117" href="../../证据/42b53e62c7eed4d219a9de34af73825438e3763a6fe9d69fb21636472932d117.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>42b53e62c7ee</small></a></details><details><summary>OwnedGroups.Validate</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="22e50d3b028b5520d3a9a3c296327ec0dabe383c37d35aa8553b56cc43120be9" href="../../证据/22e50d3b028b5520d3a9a3c296327ec0dabe383c37d35aa8553b56cc43120be9.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>22e50d3b028b</small></a></details></details><p>待核：本矩阵只读源码，无新创建/拖入的WPF运行验收。</p></article><article data-group-capability-side="self"><h4>SunEyeVision_V2 · 自研Subroutine</h4><p>source-confirmed</p><p>SunEye子程序是Tool id=Subroutine的工具节点，使用SubroutineId指向另一个Workflow；首次打开会创建并登记这个工作流。</p><p>SubroutineTool实现IToolPlugin&lt;SubroutineParameters,SubroutineResults&gt;。OpenOrNavigateToSubroutine读取node.SubroutineId；为空时CreateNewSubroutineWorkflow生成Guid、GetOrCreate工作流、设置IsSubroutine=true、把ID写回节点并SyncWorkflowToSolution，还补默认Image输入in_1。这里的节点关联与当前REA的GroupOwnership合同分开。</p><p>SubroutineTool元数据(id=Subroutine) → SubroutineParameters.SubroutineId</p><p>MainWindowViewModel.OpenOrNavigateToSubroutine → CreateNewSubroutineWorkflow → 工作流定义登记/节点关联/方案同步</p><details><summary>SubroutineTool declaration</summary><p>SunEyeVision_V2</p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><p>采集来源：D:/MyWork/SunEyeVision_V2/tools/SunEyeVision.Tool.Subroutine/SubroutineTool.cs:27–38 · SHA256 d466151c621cd2eeed17278a04b2d612f4508540a4535edc73e41afe631221c9</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e2919bd0529bd21852a632ea2a99db7c735e01110ae2bd2c406d715475c2b305" href="../../证据/e2919bd0529bd21852a632ea2a99db7c735e01110ae2bd2c406d715475c2b305.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e2919bd0529b</small></a></details><details><summary>SubroutineParameters configuration identity</summary><p>SunEyeVision_V2</p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><p>采集来源：D:/MyWork/SunEyeVision_V2/src/Plugin.SDK/Execution/Parameters/SubroutineParameters.cs:14–31 · SHA256 16886788c678530a973f1410303ff360aa65d8b59a04836186582e0487bd7e2c</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c5c5e479c16b44fca8127b33ba529d646943483f09d1001512e519e3d4527695" href="../../证据/c5c5e479c16b44fca8127b33ba529d646943483f09d1001512e519e3d4527695.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c5c5e479c16b</small></a></details><details><summary>CreateNewSubroutineWorkflow</summary><p>SunEyeVision_V2</p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><p>采集来源：D:/MyWork/SunEyeVision_V2/src/UI/Shell/Windows/MainWindowViewModel.cs:2909–2935 · SHA256 cca7efe4016cf5def050413689d3c246a5e94e5162687dafe3dd314348530dc5</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e9eb2a13a81aba26af4247f251d5692768ae5f559961851791626c18ce2f120a" href="../../证据/e9eb2a13a81aba26af4247f251d5692768ae5f559961851791626c18ce2f120a.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e9eb2a13a81a</small></a></details><p>待核：这段创建体未建立与REA GroupOwner相同的独占所有权合同；跨父节点复用/递归环/删除子工作流的全部门未在本切片追完。</p><p>待核：SyncWorkflowToSolution更深持久化调用者与实际主机状态未运行验证。</p></article></div></details><details data-group-capability="enter-return"><summary>进入与返回</summary><p>双击、返回上层和切换Tab分别改变什么？</p><div data-group-capability-columns="true"><article data-group-capability-side="original"><h4>原版VM · Group</h4><p>见逐关系分类</p><p>原GROUP专用双击绑定OpenGroupCommand，受禁用/加载失败/密码守卫；DisplayModuleSet决定画布及配置目标，Up根据Parent返回。</p><details data-group-capability-relation="GEO04"><summary>GEO04 · GROUP 模板 MouseDoubleClick → SubSource.OpenGroupCommand</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>GROUP 专用触发器绑定双击、命令及当前 decorator 参数；DiagramArea 的 SubSource 绑定所属 Tab。普通节点的 ItemDoubleClick 参数窗处理不能替代这条绑定。</p><p>仅按保留的类型/成员/资源和逐关系源码解释，不把节点相邻补成同一运行对象。</p><p>此正式关系未单列完整缓存合同；不能据入口/配置存在推断结果保留策略。</p><p>此正式关系未单列所有退出/异常资源释放；按原record的unknowns保留边界。</p><details><summary>DiagramItem GROUP trigger</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f7ffd40c49a2f1a1c31594333fa4b5417fb66757f878fb114cde80f5f1e95162" href="../../证据/f7ffd40c49a2f1a1c31594333fa4b5417fb66757f878fb114cde80f5f1e95162.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f7ffd40c49a2</small></a></details><details><summary>ProcedureConfigControl DiagramArea binding</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="33a92db073252b6fada5b5fa42f2572ff8f08ddba771ac9a4c905ece0ed902ae" href="../../证据/33a92db073252b6fada5b5fa42f2572ff8f08ddba771ac9a4c905ece0ed902ae.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>33a92db07325</small></a></details><details><summary>VmProcedureDecorator.OpenGroupCommand</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c4258293a67de75655f346fc8e3932a35a1f41e302846e1a1a1dab0dc8571318" href="../../证据/c4258293a67de75655f346fc8e3932a35a1f41e302846e1a1a1dab0dc8571318.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c4258293a67d</small></a></details></details><details data-group-capability-relation="GEO05"><summary>GEO05 · OpenGroupCommandExecute → DisplayModuleSet setter</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>禁用或 IsLoadFailed==true 时拒绝；Group 有密码时仅 IsPasswordOK 才设置；无密码/非 Group 直接设置。DisplayModuleSet setter 先令 IsSelected=true，变化时发三项通知。</p><p>仅按保留的类型/成员/资源和逐关系源码解释，不把节点相邻补成同一运行对象。</p><p>此正式关系未单列完整缓存合同；不能据入口/配置存在推断结果保留策略。</p><p>此正式关系未单列所有退出/异常资源释放；按原record的unknowns保留边界。</p><details><summary>VmProcedureDecorator.OpenGroupCommandExecute</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ab7ae499396a01660d58e55bb8e152cd9b7d8c7be682aba74250a604910a47f1" href="../../证据/ab7ae499396a01660d58e55bb8e152cd9b7d8c7be682aba74250a604910a47f1.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ab7ae499396a</small></a></details><details><summary>VmProcedureDecorator.DisplayModuleSet</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ef12b77b1f8a45d24db48cbc45a2111488278833afe076ef13fe31be5a16ba18" href="../../证据/ef12b77b1f8a45d24db48cbc45a2111488278833afe076ef13fe31be5a16ba18.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ef12b77b1f8a</small></a></details></details><details data-group-capability-relation="GEO06"><summary>GEO06 · Tab Up 按钮 → UpCommandExecute → 父为根 Tab 则 this，否则新 VmGroupDecorator</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>btnUp 绑定 UpCommand；取显示模块 Parent，若等于本 Tab DecorateSource 则回 this，否则构造父 Group decorator。</p><p>仅按保留的类型/成员/资源和逐关系源码解释，不把节点相邻补成同一运行对象。</p><p>此正式关系未单列完整缓存合同；不能据入口/配置存在推断结果保留策略。</p><p>此正式关系未单列所有退出/异常资源释放；按原record的unknowns保留边界。</p><p>待核：UpCommand 属性/可执行条件与所有输入路由仍需进一步展开。</p><details><summary>ProcedureConfigControl btnUp</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="fd6b4e63469a6b628fe98834b4916a7aa34a772c841d63271fbb17e92fa50594" href="../../证据/fd6b4e63469a6b628fe98834b4916a7aa34a772c841d63271fbb17e92fa50594.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>fd6b4e63469a</small></a></details><details><summary>VmProcedureDecorator.UpCommandExecute</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c3539b9b3c3d4b0b90527c3a0b3b47cfc312f11fa105e4a269af121de3a5b626" href="../../证据/c3539b9b3c3d4b0b90527c3a0b3b47cfc312f11fa105e4a269af121de3a5b626.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c3539b9b3c3d</small></a></details></details><details data-group-capability-relation="GEO07"><summary>GEO07 · DisplayModuleSet → 画布与配置目标</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>DiagramArea 的 Procedure 和 ItemsSource 均取显示集合；配置按钮把 DisplayModuleSet 传给 ConfigParamsCommand。导航不是改变所属根流程执行对象。</p><p>仅按保留的类型/成员/资源和逐关系源码解释，不把节点相邻补成同一运行对象。</p><p>此正式关系未单列完整缓存合同；不能据入口/配置存在推断结果保留策略。</p><p>此正式关系未单列所有退出/异常资源释放；按原record的unknowns保留边界。</p><p>待核：配置命令内部、模型替换/释放与模板投影将在配置视图中单独展开。</p><details><summary>ProcedureConfigControl DiagramArea</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="33a92db073252b6fada5b5fa42f2572ff8f08ddba771ac9a4c905ece0ed902ae" href="../../证据/33a92db073252b6fada5b5fa42f2572ff8f08ddba771ac9a4c905ece0ed902ae.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>33a92db07325</small></a></details><details><summary>ProcedureConfigControl ConfigButton</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a6289c6640c123e67897d7f6e5f8c8a8ab5a9a0bbd591e5987603a1274ca5b20" href="../../证据/a6289c6640c123e67897d7f6e5f8c8a8ab5a9a0bbd591e5987603a1274ca5b20.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a6289c6640c1</small></a></details></details><p>待核：原搜索跳转、树导航和密码事件全部副作用仍见N05缺口；不把当前ID映射视为原decorator对象一一对应。</p></article><article data-group-capability-side="current"><h4>REA当前恢复 · owned Group</h4><p>independent-implementation</p><p>当前显式区分root Tab与owned body显示位置，返回父图不结束子程序运行资源所有权。</p><details data-group-capability-relation="GEC02"><summary>GEC02 · MainWindow.EnterSubprogram / ReturnFromGroup → 守卫、选择body/父图及每根Tab显示位置</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>真实WPF EnterSubprogram先拒绝Disabled/isLocked/activeRun；无Call或目标为owned body时EnterOwnedGroup，历史普通Call则SelectWorkflow。ReturnFromGroup在非Group、参数窗开着或activeRun时不动作；清手势/ghost/popup/选中节点与线，再doc.LeaveGroup按GroupOwner.ProcedureId返回父图。SelectWorkflow先RememberDisplayedWorkflow，再按根ID恢复显示body；不是把owned body另建顶层执行Tab。</p><p>CurrentProcedureId控制当前编辑图；displayedWorkflowContainers按root procedure ID保存当前显示容器ID。</p><p>Remember会删已失效root/body，Resolve复核body仍属于该root，失败移除并回root。</p><p>LeaveGroup只切当前ID并触发Changed，不销毁body、不Dispose其执行state。</p><p>待核：进入返回不是像素/缩放/搜索/树导航全部等价证明；运行模式界面继续保留待分析。</p><details><summary>EnterSubprogram</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="074ad8c68e4b4d3931d0ef3ac62097cfbf58881b4be7fa8b17a8b65257bca248" href="../../证据/074ad8c68e4b4d3931d0ef3ac62097cfbf58881b4be7fa8b17a8b65257bca248.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>074ad8c68e4b</small></a></details><details><summary>ReturnFromGroup</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ec1b9ba78729e462fcbdd6c99eaa796214381f412e34841237351b655ac2a6e1" href="../../证据/ec1b9ba78729e462fcbdd6c99eaa796214381f412e34841237351b655ac2a6e1.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ec1b9ba78729</small></a></details><details><summary>RememberDisplayedWorkflow / ResolveDisplayedWorkflow</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c9663a75e103b61afb91322acb004c1736abffe4594a521dcc4a5bb2468cf8cb" href="../../证据/c9663a75e103b61afb91322acb004c1736abffe4594a521dcc4a5bb2468cf8cb.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c9663a75e103</small></a></details><details><summary>SelectWorkflow</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="8b5eae1ae5ae86f187d35527fbda7e5ebbad127fc395c8d3f3db56869962eea0" href="../../证据/8b5eae1ae5ae86f187d35527fbda7e5ebbad127fc395c8d3f3db56869962eea0.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>8b5eae1ae5ae</small></a></details><details><summary>LeaveGroup</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="bcddbb1e52d6de8c83a9ebcf05b56ef9c55bde59721b2439d3ffb6dc8fd91b0c" href="../../证据/bcddbb1e52d6de8c83a9ebcf05b56ef9c55bde59721b2439d3ffb6dc8fd91b0c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>bcddbb1e52d6</small></a></details><details><summary>SelectProcedure</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="aba33ef980f50abe2527276c954197d6882a92d5f5ab0ae972fabbe7da57af8c" href="../../证据/aba33ef980f50abe2527276c954197d6882a92d5f5ab0ae972fabbe7da57af8c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>aba33ef980f5</small></a></details></details><p>待核：当前tab记忆是session内ID映射，不据此推持久化原版DisplayModuleSet所有视图状态。</p></article><article data-group-capability-side="self"><h4>SunEyeVision_V2 · 自研Subroutine</h4><p>source-confirmed</p><p>双击控制流打开事件进入同一Tab，保存父工作流ID到导航栈；返回弹栈，再切换对应画布集合。</p><p>MainWindowViewModel注册OnControlFlowNodeOpen回调，匹配当前Tab的UI节点后调用OpenOrNavigateToSubroutine；后者调用NavigateToSubroutine并加载子工作流画布。WorkflowTabViewModel把_currentWorkflowId压栈，再改当前ID/名称/图标并通知IsInSubroutine、EffectiveDisplayName、CurrentWorkflowId。NavigateBack弹栈并通知；画布加载使用引擎工作流的Nodes/Connections集合，非另建子程序Tab。</p><p>NodeOpenDecisionChain.OnControlFlowNodeOpen → MainWindowViewModel.OnControlFlowNodeOpen → OpenOrNavigateToSubroutine</p><p>WorkflowTabViewModel.NavigateToSubroutine / NavigateBack → 当前工作流ID与属性通知</p><p>MainWindowViewModel.NavigateToWorkflowCanvas → selectedTab.SetNodes / SetConnections</p><details><summary>Control-flow open event registration</summary><p>SunEyeVision_V2</p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><p>采集来源：D:/MyWork/SunEyeVision_V2/src/UI/Shell/Windows/MainWindowViewModel.cs:914–914 · SHA256 cca7efe4016cf5def050413689d3c246a5e94e5162687dafe3dd314348530dc5</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="aa65b2ebb25b6e3a8a8c31bcf293344b9e666f19df47e1c0572d0dccf031448b" href="../../证据/aa65b2ebb25b6e3a8a8c31bcf293344b9e666f19df47e1c0572d0dccf031448b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>aa65b2ebb25b</small></a></details><details><summary>OnControlFlowNodeOpen</summary><p>SunEyeVision_V2</p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><p>采集来源：D:/MyWork/SunEyeVision_V2/src/UI/Shell/Windows/MainWindowViewModel.cs:2832–2843 · SHA256 cca7efe4016cf5def050413689d3c246a5e94e5162687dafe3dd314348530dc5</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b194666b9b0b3ef78ea9c53c8fd23932e878a205ad81ef97ffc46b7194bd8d56" href="../../证据/b194666b9b0b3ef78ea9c53c8fd23932e878a205ad81ef97ffc46b7194bd8d56.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b194666b9b0b</small></a></details><details><summary>OpenOrNavigateToSubroutine canvas route</summary><p>SunEyeVision_V2</p><p>not revalidated in this 