c9cfb47f3b738c87fdff1412bb1565ef5af452fb0e8a36e9da48ad19af9.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>66e75c9cfb47</small></a></details><details><summary>Apps.XmlParser.ParamTab.ParamConfigDataBase::CheckParam</summary><p></p><p>38832b22fd4224f73d12488c5d749aa11f3bba2d5a31e6b4d46a603aeb0fa322 / MVID c96ba3ba-ca59-4fc6-b45d-cbfc6299e036</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="fdf0735bffe8c969af81494c405f6f37488e653707aa310bc8be709000eaf888" href="../../证据/fdf0735bffe8c969af81494c405f6f37488e653707aa310bc8be709000eaf888.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>fdf0735bffe8</small></a></details><details><summary>lazy cache and selection backfill</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="113f2ada3c5867a4cadc0ccbbe275c0db72078539a12eead2bd8833b988509fd" href="../../证据/113f2ada3c5867a4cadc0ccbbe275c0db72078539a12eead2bd8833b988509fd.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>113f2ada3c58</small></a></details><details><summary>path comparison and delete side effect</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="1551586af53cc8d97c5d7282f3888e2e7c983dc53771ca0c1f2b4e31b2e1c584" href="../../证据/1551586af53cc8d97c5d7282f3888e2e7c983dc53771ca0c1f2b4e31b2e1c584.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>1551586af53c</small></a></details></details><details data-group-capability-relation="GEO11"><summary>GEO11 · VmModule.Subscribe / UnSubscribe → 类型检查、叶订阅 SDK 或对子项递归</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>先 IsSuitable；双方叶节点使用 GetSubInfo(source)、GetPubInfo(target,source.RelateIndex)，交 SubscribeResult/UnSubscribeResult。组合 Subscribe 要求子项数量相同，逐项赋 RelateIO，否则抛不对齐异常。变量名 source 在此是订阅方，不应按英语词义反转生产/消费方向。</p><p>仅按保留的类型/成员/资源和逐关系源码解释，不把节点相邻补成同一运行对象。</p><p>此正式关系未单列完整缓存合同；不能据入口/配置存在推断结果保留策略。</p><p>此正式关系未单列所有退出/异常资源释放；按原record的unknowns保留边界。</p><details><summary>VmModule.Subscribe</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="aa7a8f65b03716f02d40a828f42c3bc227b2e3bebe5d5ae5c854b67969fa6d7c" href="../../证据/aa7a8f65b03716f02d40a828f42c3bc227b2e3bebe5d5ae5c854b67969fa6d7c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>aa7a8f65b037</small></a></details><details><summary>VmModule.UnSubscribe</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="91f619d69ee2ed13c4f2077549978d03e0860bf382895bb565b1e3af1a1c857e" href="../../证据/91f619d69ee2ed13c4f2077549978d03e0860bf382895bb565b1e3af1a1c857e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>91f619d69ee2</small></a></details></details><details data-group-capability-relation="OG01"><summary>OG01 · 原DoWork进入循环前 → 一次准备输入与输出描述列表</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>DoWork先调用a4a00，再调用a74c0(this,this+0x180,&amp;本次输出列表)，二者位于逐轮循环之前。a4a00构造原字符串input并交a4a90(this,this+0x170,input)；后者按类型分派输入准备helper。a74c0逐个读取配置描述，向12e200传递上下文、类型与名称，只有其返回0才复制名称/模式到临时描述并把描述加入本次列表，失败分支记录日志后继续其它条目。输入配置、临时输出描述和每轮结果不是同一对象。</p><p>this+0x170输入描述容器、this+0x180输出配置容器、DoWork局部链表分别持有；12e200真实第5参数是目标描述指针，a74c0汇编在栈+0x20设置，不能照四参伪码漏掉它。</p><p>所选正常路径显示输入/输出描述在循环前准备一次；不能由此声称每轮所有输入值深快照或冻结。</p><p>a74c0每轮配置准备末尾清临时描述，DoWork退出另退役本次列表；具体共享载荷见OG07边界。</p><p>待核：输入typed准备helper10450/10ab0/117a0等未在本切片逐体恢复，输入数据复制/共享不以方法名推定。</p><p>待核：12e200交12dcb0建立typed目标的具体动态绑定尚未补体；第5参数已核，但不把其载荷与其它专题的活实例直接合并。</p><details><summary>1800a0930</summary><p></p><p>SHA256 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="05c2ce9ee473013aad18c546ab00428fa95f389e39ca41cdcf711401c693d066" href="../../证据/05c2ce9ee473013aad18c546ab00428fa95f389e39ca41cdcf711401c693d066.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>05c2ce9ee473</small></a></details><details><summary>1800a0930</summary><p></p><p>SHA256 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a81b6ffafa5dc5c57c67a32e4638f3d8385410d4f9e6a04752c364a5a9b72986" href="../../证据/a81b6ffafa5dc5c57c67a32e4638f3d8385410d4f9e6a04752c364a5a9b72986.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a81b6ffafa5d</small></a></details><details><summary>1800a4a00</summary><p></p><p>SHA256 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d7a5047fa729c7267e02861d56f3a9ace7eb6357e75f24f47a5148c84c9ce500" href="../../证据/d7a5047fa729c7267e02861d56f3a9ace7eb6357e75f24f47a5148c84c9ce500.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d7a5047fa729</small></a></details><details><summary>1800a4a90</summary><p></p><p>SHA256 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9c488566ab24129257fd52777780a2e54beb126a3c5c71861e7399722b8a2b85" href="../../证据/9c488566ab24129257fd52777780a2e54beb126a3c5c71861e7399722b8a2b85.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9c488566ab24</small></a></details><details><summary>1800a74c0</summary><p></p><p>SHA256 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0d7e4aa0c09399da1129bc099a53b83dc25287adcf440df0a895d80ee9a760b0" href="../../证据/0d7e4aa0c09399da1129bc099a53b83dc25287adcf440df0a895d80ee9a760b0.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0d7e4aa0c093</small></a></details><details><summary>1800a74c0</summary><p></p><p>SHA256 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="76f8a9f90bf7c4d743f884b1218c14741b6ff6b4df1c1026c7e722c02ab62de3" href="../../证据/76f8a9f90bf7c4d743f884b1218c14741b6ff6b4df1c1026c7e722c02ab62de3.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>76f8a9f90bf7</small></a></details><details><summary>18012e200</summary><p></p><p>SHA256 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9ebc06fca1b8caadcd70299497dd3bb5114e0173327c1e14c136e92b63187ce7" href="../../证据/9ebc06fca1b8caadcd70299497dd3bb5114e0173327c1e14c136e92b63187ce7.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9ebc06fca1b8</small></a></details><details><summary>Original PE selected data strings</summary><p></p><p>SHA256 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="509a294aed2e9245b36110f851cda4ce44ec1710a05f6234e5b418adf1f3fd91" href="../../证据/509a294aed2e9245b36110f851cda4ce44ec1710a05f6234e5b418adf1f3fd91.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>509a294aed2e</small></a></details></details><details data-group-capability-relation="OG05"><summary>OG05 · 三类标量输出helper的正常来源分支 → 按索引读取一个值，追加进目标；文本另有复制</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>13450/139f0/13fa0先检查目标typed指针。来源分类字段+0x98为1或2时使用描述中的字面值；为3时验证来源typed对象，再处理选择模式。普通索引分支先调用132e0取得索引，检查来源payload/count，从int/float各4字节元素或string指针数组取一个值，分别交fc50/fd30/100f0追加目标。string先经006470形成临时文本，再复制交100f0；不是把来源指针数组直接作为目标结果。模式+0x170==1另交fcb0/fe00/101a0处理，不能与单元素分支混称已证完整数组拷贝。</p><p>int来源payload+0x68/count和+0x70/base，float为+0x40/+0x48；string为+0x30/count和+0x38/指针表。目标对象指针位于描述+0x28/+0x38/+0x48；汇编明确float值走XMM1、目标走RCX，string目标走RCX、临时文本地址走RDX，不能按整数寄存器签名吞掉浮点参数。</p><p>目标追加与mode==1前置虚槽共同决定保留/替换，源值按所见分支读取，不能泛称全数组深快照。</p><p>临时string的堆块在对应路径delete；来源shared对象、目标结果与调用临时文本的释放责任分开。</p><p>待核：132e0完整索引表达式求值、全数组helper与目标append的底层分配/最后读者未在Group专题闭合。</p><p>待核：空来源、越界、不同失败后的先前累积值与原厂运行结果未做差分。</p><details><summary>180013450</summary><p></p><p>SHA256 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="1e0b3b045b3f0a462d4268ccfbf81fd63add7337f387d4f7f5558341cd60653c" href="../../证据/1e0b3b045b3f0a462d4268ccfbf81fd63add7337f387d4f7f5558341cd60653c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>1e0b3b045b3f</small></a></details><details><summary>180013450</summary><p></p><p>SHA256 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="6fb107001ffe852030869a7c18b07d6571a48324b7a3a7fa4686d67cbc8b825b" href="../../证据/6fb107001ffe852030869a7c18b07d6571a48324b7a3a7fa4686d67cbc8b825b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>6fb107001ffe</small></a></details><details><summary>1800139f0</summary><p></p><p>SHA256 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d2ad5138afecc7caee92743e1c1eb956419953e84481c6bb4ac41451cda48e0c" href="../../证据/d2ad5138afecc7caee92743e1c1eb956419953e84481c6bb4ac41451cda48e0c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d2ad5138afec</small></a></details><details><summary>180013fa0</summary><p></p><p>SHA256 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ceb1d8d13f8ea28552ded1e2c424710e9ae882840da692bd554dc29a57b4584f" href="../../证据/ceb1d8d13f8ea28552ded1e2c424710e9ae882840da692bd554dc29a57b4584f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ceb1d8d13f8e</small></a></details><details><summary>1800139f0</summary><p></p><p>SHA256 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="82a345a4bd4025efc29db6690f1d6cd4b44282b98f442daefcfe94efd38db65b" href="../../证据/82a345a4bd4025efc29db6690f1d6cd4b44282b98f442daefcfe94efd38db65b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>82a345a4bd40</small></a></details><details><summary>180013fa0</summary><p></p><p>SHA256 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="227c1d9a1b9948f926197ec614358b1fa9843b266445bd6a04eae4ce4980e9f5" href="../../证据/227c1d9a1b9948f926197ec614358b1fa9843b266445bd6a04eae4ce4980e9f5.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>227c1d9a1b99</small></a></details></details><p>待核：原输入输出接口创建/删除/改型的完整native动态绑定与持久化需要具体接收体，不能从选源列表推断全闭合。</p></article><article data-group-capability-side="current"><h4>REA当前恢复 · owned Group</h4><p>independent-implementation</p><p>当前接口稳定ID驱动多层传播，运行时输入字典复制但PortValue引用保留；每轮上下文独立。</p><details data-group-capability-relation="GEC03"><summary>GEC03 · ConfigureOwnedGroupInputs / PropagateGroupInterface → 稳定接口ID、父订阅与多层签名传播</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>ConfigureOwnedGroupInputs先核owner，按父来源推Cardinality并核Kind；删掉body内指向已删除input ID的订阅。事务中移除被重绑名称的父Connections与非参数Subscriptions，再PropagateGroupInterface，重建指定绑定并验证类型/顺序/环。Propagation按旧/新稳定接口ID映射名称，含Compound derived leaves；同步父Call签名、Connections、Subscriptions、Inputs/Outputs/Displays、变量、代理和break来源，向更外层递归，新增不兼容错误拒绝提交。</p><p>接口用Id/Name/Kind/Cardinality/NodeId/Port；父调用签名是WorkflowCalls.From生成副本。可累计owned输出在调用签名上标Array。</p><p>不是仅改UI文字；被删除来源会移除/解绑对应映射，保留明确的验证失败。</p><p>事务成功才替换document；EditProcedure草稿中的多字段变更未成功不提交。</p><p>待核：尚未对全部复合类型、多层接口变更和真实WPF来源选择做本轮runtime验收；原订阅/native storage不是当前ID结构。</p><details><summary>ConfigureOwnedGroupInputs</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="1378761f742e57d4c46ba405ecdac47d8b02f7d459e1acb6d6313626bcd40220" href="../../证据/1378761f742e57d4c46ba405ecdac47d8b02f7d459e1acb6d6313626bcd40220.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>1378761f742e</small></a></details><details><summary>PropagateGroupInterface</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d9f3754290b8674071d7b0d8a70f8621fc8d78587982dd9f8f1d57643ba3b93e" href="../../证据/d9f3754290b8674071d7b0d8a70f8621fc8d78587982dd9f8f1d57643ba3b93e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d9f3754290b8</small></a></details><details><summary>WorkflowCalls.From</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="7cfb1e123edd3358900b0ad622aa51dfe3d4cce4f6713b4160d5d7c4edb35abb" href="../../证据/7cfb1e123edd3358900b0ad622aa51dfe3d4cce4f6713b4160d5d7c4edb35abb.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>7cfb1e123edd</small></a></details><details><summary>EditProcedure</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0f860126b6887e6f055f5096f4d646bdba3003d20ea55597a06e89da28825afb" href="../../证据/0f860126b6887e6f055f5096f4d646bdba3003d20ea55597a06e89da28825afb.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0f860126b688</small></a></details></details><details data-group-capability-relation="GEC04"><summary>GEC04 · 每轮GraphExecutor → WorkflowRunContext → 独立records/variables与浅输入字典副本</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>每次GraphExecutor.RunAsync先scope.Enter，再建本轮records/calls/descriptors和WorkflowRunContext。context把inputs字典ToDictionary，保留原PortValue；校验输入名/Kind/Cardinality并初始化无SourceNode变量。本轮Record先写records再workflow.Update：绑定该节点的变量先Remove，只有Node成功或NoMatch且含端口时重置引用，源不可用则保持缺值，不沿用前轮变量。Complete另建WorkflowInputs/Outputs/LocalVariables字典，输出仍指向当前本轮PortValue，显示每项新一元素数组包装。</p><p>每轮新容器；PortValue transport是共享引用。GroupLoopIndex解析产生当前索引Integer PortValue。</p><p>没有把前轮WorkflowRunContext.variables复制到下一轮；有状态工具可经solution scope继续持有state，这是另一个生命周期。</p><p>context本身没有Dispose；session字典使成功导出的值继续可达，模块实例Dispose不清session。</p><p>待核：这不是“所有缓存每轮清空”：root scope的node state/参数缓存跨轮仍存；具体工具payload内部可变性与释放依具体实现另证。</p><details><summary>GraphExecutor.RunAsync scope and context</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="df6f151d39e51aa6d6f32b212788e557bcdea22ae22f29a9cbf3d6e3dd49fccf" href="../../证据/df6f151d39e51aa6d6f32b212788e557bcdea22ae22f29a9cbf3d6e3dd49fccf.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>df6f151d39e5</small></a></details><details><summary>WorkflowRunContext constructor</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="316a3233d6fcf8fa56be9d8f98f5d86bb3aa6b9509f20486631de89f3eb0a162" href="../../证据/316a3233d6fcf8fa56be9d8f98f5d86bb3aa6b9509f20486631de89f3eb0a162.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>316a3233d6fc</small></a></details><details><summary>WorkflowRunContext.Update</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c6b99b1401ab65a141d35a5f4efeef9c2b31660de3c0b51826c5d29e624c0fc6" href="../../证据/c6b99b1401ab65a141d35a5f4efeef9c2b31660de3c0b51826c5d29e624c0fc6.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c6b99b1401ab</small></a></details><details><summary>WorkflowRunContext.Complete</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="772e85c92974f644bb8d4c4048475f0a0d1e88deff0f70c80058fd10ab457160" href="../../证据/772e85c92974f644bb8d4c4048475f0a0d1e88deff0f70c80058fd10ab457160.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>772e85c92974</small></a></details><details><summary>WorkflowRunContext.GroupLoopIndex</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="00f2bee89312032306e8a170048d98989d5ec9192247ff06adab9649ec4f2e08" href="../../证据/00f2bee89312032306e8a170048d98989d5ec9192247ff06adab9649ec4f2e08.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>00f2bee89312</small></a></details></details><p>待核：当前只支持声明/实现中的类型，不能从显示同名端口推原生全类型支持。</p></article><article data-group-capability-side="self"><h4>SunEyeVision_V2 · 自研Subroutine</h4><p>source-confirmed</p><p>配置用可观察端口列表，运行时解析父结果并注入子上下文；输出值与内部节点结果保存在不同字典。</p><p>SubroutineParameters持有Inputs、Outputs、DisplayConfigs、LoopConfig；输入FieldId与BindingKey、输出FieldId/TypeName/IsAccumulated分别定义身份与类型。ResolveInputs按完整绑定路径只切首个点，ParameterResolver返回值写入Dictionary&lt;string,object&gt;；未绑定Image输入可直接使用ResolvedInputImage。同一值进入子上下文变量与GenericToolResults，并以__SubroutineInputs__及父节点ID登记为合成结果。SubroutineResults分别持有NodeOutputs、ResolvedOutputValues、OutputConfigs；GetDisplayImages只从ResolvedOutputValues挑选非空IVisionImage。</p><p>SubroutineParameters.Inputs → ResolveInputs → contextVariables[bindingKey]</p><p>WorkflowExecutionEngine子上下文 → variables / __SubroutineInputs__ / 父节点ID合成结果</p><p>SubroutineTool.Run / ResolveOutputsOnce → SubroutineResults.ResolvedOutputValues → GetDisplayImages</p><details><summary>Input stable identity and binding key</summary><p>SunEyeVision_V2</p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><p>采集来源：D:/MyWork/SunEyeVision_V2/src/Plugin.SDK/Models/SubroutineInputConfig.cs:10–28 · SHA256 680d916baed41474e683657324c6ca60bb253c9cc4f97e6b9a8979f42361a06c</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e453d592554f72c25b12a943209470647df74a2526cf647d7651f6c76676d74c" href="../../证据/e453d592554f72c25b12a943209470647df74a2526cf647d7651f6c76676d74c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e453d592554f</small></a></details><details><summary>Configured port collections</summary><p>SunEyeVision_V2</p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><p>采集来源：D:/MyWork/SunEyeVision_V2/src/Plugin.SDK/Execution/Parameters/SubroutineParameters.cs:22–27 · SHA256 16886788c678530a973f1410303ff360aa65d8b59a04836186582e0487bd7e2c</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b7a638089fbc4f7fdbff4bda9868c24d7a63b471c7397a85e302893fae580d7b" href="../../证据/b7a638089fbc4f7fdbff4bda9868c24d7a63b471c7397a85e302893fae580d7b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b7a638089fbc</small></a></details><details><summary>ResolveInputs binding value transfer</summary><p>SunEyeVision_V2</p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><p>采集来源：D:/MyWork/SunEyeVision_V2/tools/SunEyeVision.Tool.Subroutine/SubroutineTool.cs:300–302 · SHA256 d466151c621cd2eeed17278a04b2d612f4508540a4535edc73e41afe631221c9</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f0fb1f10713f89faf2ac3b36ab240717cdc1ed4e257d939faecfe58fc9432782" href="../../证据/f0fb1f10713f89faf2ac3b36ab240717cdc1ed4e257d939faecfe58fc9432782.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f0fb1f10713f</small></a></details><details><summary>Default image input</summary><p>SunEyeVision_V2</p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><p>采集来源：D:/MyWork/SunEyeVision_V2/tools/SunEyeVision.Tool.Subroutine/SubroutineTool.cs:321–323 · SHA256 d466151c621cd2eeed17278a04b2d612f4508540a4535edc73e41afe631221c9</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2ef0ecff52e4e459423a5a91e22ac79ae05426678f669f0a65cccc078b27da7e" href="../../证据/2ef0ecff52e4e459423a5a91e22ac79ae05426678f669f0a65cccc078b27da7e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2ef0ecff52e4</small></a></details><details><summary>Synthetic input result injection</summary><p>SunEyeVision_V2</p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><p>采集来源：D:/MyWork/SunEyeVision_V2/src/Workflow/WorkflowExecutionEngine.cs:662–692 · SHA256 4afdc12717c26f142cdc325d4ebac68a4d32f7cf31f1e5d137552c32419b07db</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e9b7fa8a0975166ed0705cd1fccf2151b514f27664f8e4e5f4715f93fb847951" href="../../证据/e9b7fa8a0975166ed0705cd1fccf2151b514f27664f8e4e5f4715f93fb847951.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e9b7fa8a0975</small></a></details><details><summary>Subroutine result holders</summary><p>SunEyeVision_V2</p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><p>采集来源：D:/MyWork/SunEyeVision_V2/src/Plugin.SDK/Execution/Results/SubroutineResults.cs:13–24 · SHA256 d47bfd82203b63b13fdb876ad78c5c0313b10c96c8490b6ab989bfae7cd757a9</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a5a5c154fcc7cf5a7e2a8e8e55042768c409b5bd40ca5f0caf0bedd6a4ade8ec" href="../../证据/a5a5c154fcc7cf5a7e2a8e8e55042768c409b5bd40ca5f0caf0bedd6a4ade8ec.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a5a5c154fcc7</small></a></details><details><summary>GetDisplayImages from declared resolved outputs</summary><p>SunEyeVision_V2</p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><p>采集来源：D:/MyWork/SunEyeVision_V2/src/Plugin.SDK/Execution/Results/SubroutineResults.cs:30–38 · SHA256 d47bfd82203b63b13fdb876ad78c5c0313b10c96c8490b6ab989bfae7cd757a9</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e6e8b1b3e00a0c724ae183b627826e07460b529ae8c7a536e5526214865b4006" href="../../证据/e6e8b1b3e00a0c724ae183b627826e07460b529ae8c7a536e5526214865b4006.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e6e8b1b3e00a</small></a></details><p>待核：这些字典赋值没有深复制图像/任意对象；不能从新建字典推导像素所有权已转移。ParameterResolver和IVisionImage实现内的克隆/租约需另追。</p><p>待核：SDK对象类型、FieldId与当前REA PortValue/WorkflowInterfaceItem不是相同二进制或序列化合同，不声明自动兼容。</p></article></div></details><details data-group-capability="internal-edit"><summary>内部编辑与参数配置</summary><p>进入内部后，编辑的到底是哪份图和哪一个Group？</p><div data-group-capability-columns="true"><article data-group-capability-side="original"><h4>原版VM · Group</h4><p>见逐关系分类</p><p>原显示集合同时绑定画布与配置目标；专用Group参数窗ShowDialog与返回后的缓存/通知处理已见；粘贴交ProcedurePaste，native复制接收者另列。</p><details data-group-capability-relation="GEO12"><summary>GEO12 · DisplayModuleSet → 画布与配置目标</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>DiagramArea 的 Procedure 和 ItemsSource 均取显示集合；配置按钮把 DisplayModuleSet 传给 ConfigParamsCommand。导航不是改变所属根流程执行对象。</p><p>仅按保留的类型/成员/资源和逐关系源码解释，不把节点相邻补成同一运行对象。</p><p>此正式关系未单列完整缓存合同；不能据入口/配置存在推断结果保留策略。</p><p>此正式关系未单列所有退出/异常资源释放；按原record的unknowns保留边界。</p><p>待核：配置命令内部、模型替换/释放与模板投影将在配置视图中单独展开。</p><details><summary>ProcedureConfigControl DiagramArea</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="33a92db073252b6fada5b5fa42f2572ff8f08ddba771ac9a4c905ece0ed902ae" href="../../证据/33a92db073252b6fada5b5fa42f2572ff8f08ddba771ac9a4c905ece0ed902ae.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>33a92db07325</small></a></details><details><summary>ProcedureConfigControl ConfigButton</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a6289c6640c123e67897d7f6e5f8c8a8ab5a9a0bbd591e5987603a1274ca5b20" href="../../证据/a6289c6640c123e67897d7f6e5f8c8a8ab5a9a0bbd591e5987603a1274ca5b20.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a6289c6640c1</small></a></details></details><details data-group-capability-relation="GEO13"><summary>GEO13 · data → modal</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>回调new专用窗口、设Owner和数据，Group数据时设RelateControl并启动加载，再ShowDialog。</p><p>仅按保留的类型/成员/资源和逐关系源码解释，不把节点相邻补成同一运行对象。</p><p>此正式关系未单列完整缓存合同；不能据入口/配置存在推断结果保留策略。</p><p>此正式关系未单列所有退出/异常资源释放；按原record的unknowns保留边界。</p><details><summary>DynamicObjectConfigControl.DynamicRunParamConfigControl::get_EditRunParamMethod</summary><p></p><p>38832b22fd4224f73d12488c5d749aa11f3bba2d5a31e6b4d46a603aeb0fa322 / MVID c96ba3ba-ca59-4fc6-b45d-cbfc6299e036</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a101b04909b86a3c7ec18d5658e7dd7f79a22142a62cd01aac00a5a66a51f9ef" href="../../证据/a101b04909b86a3c7ec18d5658e7dd7f79a22142a62cd01aac00a5a66a51f9ef.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a101b04909b8</small></a></details><details><summary>DynamicObjectConfigControl.DynamicRunParamConfigControl::EditRunParam</summary><p></p><p>38832b22fd4224f73d12488c5d749aa11f3bba2d5a31e6b4d46a603aeb0fa322 / MVI