t">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>cda94a5cea05</small></a></details></details><details data-group-capability-relation="GEO14"><summary>GEO14 · return → refresh</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>Group参数入口直接pop结果；随后恢复历史、清缓存/通知/GetParamUnit，没有finally保障异常后恢复。</p><p>仅按保留的类型/成员/资源和逐关系源码解释，不把节点相邻补成同一运行对象。</p><p>此正式关系未单列完整缓存合同；不能据入口/配置存在推断结果保留策略。</p><p>此正式关系未单列所有退出/异常资源释放；按原record的unknowns保留边界。</p><details><summary>Apps.XmlParser.ParamTab.GroupRunParam::get_ConfigCommand</summary><p></p><p>38832b22fd4224f73d12488c5d749aa11f3bba2d5a31e6b4d46a603aeb0fa322 / MVID c96ba3ba-ca59-4fc6-b45d-cbfc6299e036</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d0c13723a7cba848bf00bdf14261ce29f112729b5ee8a225dcb0a33523857e5a" href="../../证据/d0c13723a7cba848bf00bdf14261ce29f112729b5ee8a225dcb0a33523857e5a.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d0c13723a7cb</small></a></details><details><summary>Apps.XmlParser.ParamTab.GroupRunParam::ConfigCommandExecute</summary><p></p><p>38832b22fd4224f73d12488c5d749aa11f3bba2d5a31e6b4d46a603aeb0fa322 / MVID c96ba3ba-ca59-4fc6-b45d-cbfc6299e036</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="6ffdb80ccb16c5ce2de70adb8e383e627de268e193504f0bf9f45f691415d388" href="../../证据/6ffdb80ccb16c5ce2de70adb8e383e627de268e193504f0bf9f45f691415d388.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>6ffdb80ccb16</small></a></details><details><summary>Apps.XmlParser.ParamTab.GroupRunParam::GetParamUnit</summary><p></p><p>38832b22fd4224f73d12488c5d749aa11f3bba2d5a31e6b4d46a603aeb0fa322 / MVID c96ba3ba-ca59-4fc6-b45d-cbfc6299e036</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="45d18cd31b04017c5ad4160f0c7fd8c465345b739568154edc9df6780886366c" href="../../证据/45d18cd31b04017c5ad4160f0c7fd8c465345b739568154edc9df6780886366c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>45d18cd31b04</small></a></details><details><summary>callback return ignored and refresh</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="7a987a8c38254bbe8ff185525e2a507f68cd9d5a9a7f8ee48ddea34431e73563" href="../../证据/7a987a8c38254bbe8ff185525e2a507f68cd9d5a9a7f8ee48ddea34431e73563.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>7a987a8c3825</small></a></details></details><details data-group-capability-relation="GEO15"><summary>GEO15 · DoPaste / OnPasteItems → PasteItemsCommand</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>DoPaste 产生 DiagramEventArgs.Point 并发事件，XAML 将该事件交 PasteItemsCommand；命令先 CheckRunning、登记 CopyModule RootOperation，再 ProcedurePaste。</p><p>仅按保留的类型/成员/资源和逐关系源码解释，不把节点相邻补成同一运行对象。</p><p>此正式关系未单列完整缓存合同；不能据入口/配置存在推断结果保留策略。</p><p>此正式关系未单列所有退出/异常资源释放；按原record的unknowns保留边界。</p><details><summary>ItemsPage.DoPaste</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="6ffb71979148020abf437348e14403067b0b5dbf1a4284d0e44ab73f72da4a21" href="../../证据/6ffb71979148020abf437348e14403067b0b5dbf1a4284d0e44ab73f72da4a21.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>6ffb71979148</small></a></details><details><summary>DiagramPage paste binding</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="966252cac1bee6f62a0ae6caf8e72e4ac852cef1d1d9f792ed7e69ef4f816a51" href="../../证据/966252cac1bee6f62a0ae6caf8e72e4ac852cef1d1d9f792ed7e69ef4f816a51.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>966252cac1be</small></a></details><details><summary>VmModuleBaseDecorator.PasteItemsCommandExecute</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="243cf2590142b46d9209060a0f9ba1c55fcb598585044b30220b39bc714a5cb5" href="../../证据/243cf2590142b46d9209060a0f9ba1c55fcb598585044b30220b39bc714a5cb5.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>243cf2590142</small></a></details></details><p>待核：原内部剪贴板、Undo、所有节点编辑/专用模板的实际分派未在这8行证明全覆盖。</p></article><article data-group-capability-side="current"><h4>REA当前恢复 · owned Group</h4><p>independent-implementation</p><p>当前内部画布与bound配置窗各有owner守卫；编辑草稿事务提交，不靠先切界面再回切。</p><details data-group-capability-relation="GEC05"><summary>GEC05 · 当前图编辑命令与bound Group window → 内部节点/连接编辑、隔离草稿和配置会话守卫</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>GraphEditorDocument.MoveNodes/DeleteNodes只改CurrentProcedure，对删节点同时清配置引用、数据边与执行边；ChangeProcedure进入统一Edit，再CloneOwnedCopies/PruneOwnedGroups/SynchronizeGroupNames及ValidateStructure，最后记录history、替换document并发Changed。CreateBoundGroupWindow固定flow/node并捕获solution+execution owner，Guard拒绝失效会话、关窗、锁定、运行或不相关当前图；OwnerEdit通过EditProcedure(flow)草稿而非临时切可见画布。OpenDisplayedConfiguration对当前owned body找到owner节点并复用非模态绑定配置窗。</p><p>画布当前Procedure与配置窗owner是分开的稳定身份，参数更新通过克隆字典/模型事务。</p><p>配置窗Closed从集合/显示窗字段清理；不把Show与ShowDialog混成同一路径。</p><p>关闭配置窗只清配置会话字段；内部图和solution state仍可继续存在。</p><p>待核：不由通用图命令推断每个原工具内部编辑能力；复杂参数/ROI/显示专属控件仍按各具体工具合同。</p><details><summary>MoveNodes/DeleteNodes</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="93b639095dae077a7363390e694c5e404fdaec6b4c53824c51262f3849f0e494" href="../../证据/93b639095dae077a7363390e694c5e404fdaec6b4c53824c51262f3849f0e494.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>93b639095dae</small></a></details><details><summary>Edit transaction</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="059ded87442e7e2aa5c329ed57e3cb3b11c20e1953d024c5581f2286d9dd5849" href="../../证据/059ded87442e7e2aa5c329ed57e3cb3b11c20e1953d024c5581f2286d9dd5849.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>059ded87442e</small></a></details><details><summary>CreateBoundGroupWindow/Guard</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="97ce29d898da1d43b2aa8fa0a855efeb153bd0f0956801d3c9e3fb06d421910f" href="../../证据/97ce29d898da1d43b2aa8fa0a855efeb153bd0f0956801d3c9e3fb06d421910f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>97ce29d898da</small></a></details><details><summary>OpenDisplayedConfiguration</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="8fa0c0375dfb2410c0bc2b55d109db62f0a7d7ec6dce4f6c119555afd3e6bda2" href="../../证据/8fa0c0375dfb2410c0bc2b55d109db62f0a7d7ec6dce4f6c119555afd3e6bda2.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>8fa0c0375dfb</small></a></details></details><p>待核：当前源UI合同尚未本轮逐控件WPF运行；不把事务模型通过当作像素或全部手势验收。</p></article><article data-group-capability-side="self"><h4>SunEyeVision_V2 · 自研Subroutine</h4><p>source-confirmed</p><p>内部画布直接切换到子工作流集合，设置按钮打开专用控件；输入、输出、显示和循环设置是四个配置页。</p><p>ShellWorkspaceControl的设置入口要求当前Tab处于子程序；统一调试窗口入口分别创建父工作流输入查询与子工作流内部查询，再传parameters对象和输出增量回调给专用服务。SubroutineDebugControl创建SubroutineParameterDialogViewModel并设DataContext；ViewModel保存传入参数对象、建立增删命令、订阅Outputs变更并至少补齐一输入一输出。XAML的四页绑定输入/输出/显示/LoopConfig。AddInput与AddOutput直接向配置集合加入对象；Outputs增删及Name/TypeName/Group变化调用增量回调。</p><p>ShellWorkspaceControl.SubroutineSettings_Click → OpenSubroutineParameterDialog / OpenSubroutineDebugWindowCore</p><p>SubroutineDebugControl → SubroutineParameterDialogViewModel(parameters) → AddInput/AddOutput</p><p>Outputs.CollectionChanged / PropertyChanged → SubroutineOutputChange → 主窗口增量更新回调</p><details><summary>Subroutine settings click</summary><p>SunEyeVision_V2</p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><p>采集来源：D:/MyWork/SunEyeVision_V2/src/UI/Shell/Controls/Shell/ShellWorkspaceControl.xaml.cs:637–647 · SHA256 d08aa3e23138d441149ffc3a66701d538ef3cb03ed87088ad3c6184ee6c78b3a</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="5f71d1c5743b32403521aca9c6d02750c4178d9f9c9c902382d72c4d816005e9" href="../../证据/5f71d1c5743b32403521aca9c6d02750c4178d9f9c9c902382d72c4d816005e9.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>5f71d1c5743b</small></a></details><details><summary>Parent/child query and output notification</summary><p>SunEyeVision_V2</p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><p>采集来源：D:/MyWork/SunEyeVision_V2/src/UI/Shell/Controls/Shell/ShellWorkspaceControl.xaml.cs:667–681 · SHA256 d08aa3e23138d441149ffc3a66701d538ef3cb03ed87088ad3c6184ee6c78b3a</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d963888b00b6a3762c619c59c99d6d23b48c7193372d3cb7cc18fa436d159361" href="../../证据/d963888b00b6a3762c619c59c99d6d23b48c7193372d3cb7cc18fa436d159361.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d963888b00b6</small></a></details><details><summary>ViewModel and DataContext setup</summary><p>SunEyeVision_V2</p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><p>采集来源：D:/MyWork/SunEyeVision_V2/tools/SunEyeVision.Tool.Subroutine/Views/SubroutineDebugControl.xaml.cs:31–38 · SHA256 5f356512fe720973711120886de7ae5c4ae1b2da63100fc1b2f01f6eb8a0a7fe</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="8e4e03ee0024a38097879555bcb43d5d8f2632a7b61d7e2561969dd8e8f045c5" href="../../证据/8e4e03ee0024a38097879555bcb43d5d8f2632a7b61d7e2561969dd8e8f045c5.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>8e4e03ee0024</small></a></details><details><summary>Configured collection commands and subscriptions</summary><p>SunEyeVision_V2</p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><p>采集来源：D:/MyWork/SunEyeVision_V2/tools/SunEyeVision.Tool.Subroutine/ViewModels/SubroutineParameterDialogViewModel.cs:89–115 · SHA256 6377ffc87d505ff93ddde99de7fd224afdccae7f52c8faee31e45e517217c16e</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="bde763d84701d902b7c172763a83bcd5ae96a6dc4263aa1664545bbcdf99211e" href="../../证据/bde763d84701d902b7c172763a83bcd5ae96a6dc4263aa1664545bbcdf99211e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>bde763d84701</small></a></details><details><summary>AddInput / AddOutput</summary><p>SunEyeVision_V2</p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><p>采集来源：D:/MyWork/SunEyeVision_V2/tools/SunEyeVision.Tool.Subroutine/ViewModels/SubroutineParameterDialogViewModel.cs:180–200 · SHA256 6377ffc87d505ff93ddde99de7fd224afdccae7f52c8faee31e45e517217c16e</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="daefd19845180a921824b9f47ec976c0fdb9a857f9f79b1a77ce61a05d6256f1" href="../../证据/daefd19845180a921824b9f47ec976c0fdb9a857f9f79b1a77ce61a05d6256f1.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>daefd1984518</small></a></details><details><summary>Inputs page declaration</summary><p>SunEyeVision_V2</p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><p>采集来源：D:/MyWork/SunEyeVision_V2/tools/SunEyeVision.Tool.Subroutine/Views/SubroutineDebugControl.