47c3af</small></a></details><details><summary>Output structural notifications</summary><p>SunEyeVision_V2</p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><p>采集来源：D:/MyWork/SunEyeVision_V2/tools/SunEyeVision.Tool.Subroutine/ViewModels/SubroutineParameterDialogViewModel.cs:266–294 · SHA256 6377ffc87d505ff93ddde99de7fd224afdccae7f52c8faee31e45e517217c16e</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="63dcb6f85403b6c83266f9f491a130c2f88467fb03aff7ceaa3a9fa7aef9b49c" href="../../证据/63dcb6f85403b6c83266f9f491a130c2f88467fb03aff7ceaa3a9fa7aef9b49c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>63dcb6f85403</small></a></details><p>待核：这里证到配置编辑与通知调用，没有执行UI，也未沿ApplySubroutineOutputChange逐个核显示树/图像下拉消费者。</p><p>待核：撤销、取消窗口是否恢复编辑前值及全部画布编辑命令未穷举；不得用“参数框存在”冒称这些行为已实现或已验收。</p></article></div></details><details data-group-capability="call-nesting"><summary>调用返回与嵌套</summary><p>拥有型Group与普通子程序调用怎样区分，返回哪些结果？</p><div data-group-capability-columns="true"><article data-group-capability-side="original"><h4>原版VM · Group</h4><p>见逐关系分类</p><p>原GroupTool.Run明确交SyncSelfRun；原native DoWork虚执行/状态门只保留已恢复实参，具体动态调度对象仍有缺口，结果查询另有getter。</p><details data-group-capability-relation="GEO16"><summary>GEO16 · IMVSGroupTool.Run → mModuleManager.SyncSelfRun(ID,bIsRespondToUI)</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>Group 专用工具 Run 默认响应 UI=true，直交 SyncSelfRun；不是主工具栏的全局脚本运行，也不能把此包装当完整内部节点调度体。</p><p>仅按保留的类型/成员/资源和逐关系源码解释，不把节点相邻补成同一运行对象。</p><p>此正式关系未单列完整缓存合同；不能据入口/配置存在推断结果保留策略。</p><p>此正式关系未单列所有退出/异常资源释放；按原record的unknowns保留边界。</p><details><summary>IMVSGroupTool.Run</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="5cb2486d7afa7022db7e31a4c3ab9147ab925e5d4c653e45ebea37529e26cfb5" href="../../证据/5cb2486d7afa7022db7e31a4c3ab9147ab925e5d4c653e45ebea37529e26cfb5.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>5cb2486d7afa</small></a></details></details><details data-group-capability-relation="GEO17"><summary>GEO17 · 本轮执行对象与ProcessGroupOutputV44 → 执行后分型处理并按描述模式调用目标虚槽</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>通过break门后DoWork调用局部执行对象的虚表+8；随后不把相邻指令解释为未知线程池合同，而是保存实际关系：RCX=this、RDX=&amp;本次输出列表、R8=&amp;本轮状态字传入a7830，返回EAX被保存并检查。a7830逐描述按type分派：int/float/string仅mode字段==1时先调用相应目标虚表+8，再调用13450/139f0/13fa0；image及其它所见类型有无条件先调用+8的独立分支。不能把这些类型都画成相同的累积策略。</p><p>输出描述持typed目标、来源状态和模式；执行对象虚调用、输出目标虚调用、typed复制helper是三种不同边。</p><p>mode!=1的三种标量描述不经此处+8前置调用；本轮输出可能保留前轮结果，细节由各typed helper决定。</p><p>本体仅证明虚槽调用条件；12dcb0动态绑定未闭合，不能直接把Group这里+8同一实例等同于VP专题已定位的逻辑清空对象。</p><p>待核：虚执行对象的具体调度与全部子节点状态传播未在本切片恢复。</p><p>待核：图像/复合类型累积、载荷租约与虚槽接收者需分别恢复，不从int路径外推。</p><details><summary>1800a0930</summary><p></p><p>SHA256 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="90120cb27f00ecd76068f70c31bba9865fa4fec7e8c6894610674996992d0487" href="../../证据/90120cb27f00ecd76068f70c31bba9865fa4fec7e8c6894610674996992d0487.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>90120cb27f00</small></a></details><details><summary>1800a0930</summary><p></p><p>SHA256 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="fe3de2232fa9a2c42fab8d0c86edd410682db6da0ea000b4a62fe8d1019d22ef" href="../../证据/fe3de2232fa9a2c42fab8d0c86edd410682db6da0ea000b4a62fe8d1019d22ef.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>fe3de2232fa9</small></a></details><details><summary>1800a7830</summary><p></p><p>SHA256 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="17bd7d7654acc40f0317eff7f44a18ccaf18af5a551133f1a9fcd89c95f9625f" href="../../证据/17bd7d7654acc40f0317eff7f44a18ccaf18af5a551133f1a9fcd89c95f9625f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>17bd7d7654ac</small></a></details><details><summary>1800a7830</summary><p></p><p>SHA256 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b0a0a0dfbab09bedcadc087f0d6f7b9dcd51092a5d6ff75b4ffd0df3172da295" href="../../证据/b0a0a0dfbab09bedcadc087f0d6f7b9dcd51092a5d6ff75b4ffd0df3172da295.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b0a0a0dfbab0</small></a></details></details><details data-group-capability-relation="GEO18"><summary>GEO18 · IMVSGroupTool.ModuResult / GroupResult → 查询结果 / DynamicOutput getter</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>ModuResult 每次新建 GroupResult(ID,this) 并 QueryModuleOneResult；GroupResult 指定模块对象时创建 DynamicOutput，整型 getter 有对象才委托，否则返回 default。不要把动态 getter 与实际累积算法混为一体。</p><p>仅按保留的类型/成员/资源和逐关系源码解释，不把节点相邻补成同一运行对象。</p><p>此正式关系未单列完整缓存合同；不能据入口/配置存在推断结果保留策略。</p><p>此正式关系未单列所有退出/异常资源释放；按原record的unknowns保留边界。</p><details><summary>IMVSGroupTool.ModuResult</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d785f61198b476ca003c337726d96ad51c75f9eb68b9646befcc17b0c348efac" href="../../证据/d785f61198b476ca003c337726d96ad51c75f9eb68b9646befcc17b0c348efac.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d785f61198b4</small></a></details><details><summary>GroupResult dynamic output construction</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="6e5e747d0f589e39fd3c8ca527e62f704b8d4bf41140777608203f211d666c7a" href="../../证据/6e5e747d0f589e39fd3c8ca527e62f704b8d4bf41140777608203f211d666c7a.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>6e5e747d0f58</small></a></details><details><summary>GroupResult.GetOutputInt</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="557946754877c072650db27a6310edb66ae4a7657cfefb2569f9bf8fc49cac66" href="../../证据/557946754877c072650db27a6310edb66ae4a7657cfefb2569f9bf8fc49cac66.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>557946754877</small></a></details></details><details data-group-capability-relation="OG04"><summary>OG04 · 本轮执行对象与ProcessGroupOutputV44 → 执行后分型处理并按描述模式调用目标虚槽</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>通过break门后DoWork调用局部执行对象的虚表+8；随后不把相邻指令解释为未知线程池合同，而是保存实际关系：RCX=this、RDX=&amp;本次输出列表、R8=&amp;本轮状态字传入a7830，返回EAX被保存并检查。a7830逐描述按type分派：int/float/string仅mode字段==1时先调用相应目标虚表+8，再调用13450/139f0/13fa0；image及其它所见类型有无条件先调用+8的独立分支。不能把这些类型都画成相同的累积策略。</p><p>输出描述持typed目标、来源状态和模式；执行对象虚调用、输出目标虚调用、typed复制helper是三种不同边。</p><p>mode!=1的三种标量描述不经此处+8前置调用；本轮输出可能保留前轮结果，细节由各typed helper决定。</p><p>本体仅证明虚槽调用条件；12dcb0动态绑定未闭合，不能直接把Group这里+8同一实例等同于VP专题已定位的逻辑清空对象。</p><p>待核：虚执行对象的具体调度与全部子节点状态传播未在本切片恢复。</p><p>待核：图像/复合类型累积、载荷租约与虚槽接收者需分别恢复，不从int路径外推。</p><details><summary>1800a0930</summary><p></p><p>SHA256 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="90120cb27f00ecd76068f70c31bba9865fa4fec7e8c6894610674996992d0487" href="../../证据/90120cb27f00ecd76068f70c31bba9865fa4fec7e8c6894610674996992d0487.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>90120cb27f00</small></a></details><details><summary>1800a0930</summary><p></p><p>SHA256 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="fe3de2232fa9a2c42fab8d0c86edd410682db6da0ea000b4a62fe8d1019d22ef" href="../../证据/fe3de2232fa9a2c42fab8d0c86edd410682db6da0ea000b4a62fe8d1019d22ef.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>fe3de2232fa9</small></a></details><details><summary>1800a7830</summary><p></p><p>SHA256 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="17bd7d7654acc40f0317eff7f44a18ccaf18af5a551133f1a9fcd89c95f9625f" href="../../证据/17bd7d7654acc40f0317eff7f44a18ccaf18af5a551133f1a9fcd89c95f9625f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>17bd7d7654ac</small></a></details><details><summary>1800a7830</summary><p></p><p>SHA256 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b0a0a0dfbab09bedcadc087f0d6f7b9dcd51092a5d6ff75b4ffd0df3172da295" href="../../证据/b0a0a0dfbab09bedcadc087f0d6f7b9dcd51092a5d6ff75b4ffd0df3172da295.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b0a0a0dfbab0</small></a></details></details><details data-group-capability-relation="OG06"><summary>OG06 · 输出处理失败与DoWork收尾 → 分开保存处理错误码、状态码和ModuStatus布尔值</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>a7830继续遍历描述；在尚未捕获错误时，来源状态分类为3且来源记录存在、其工作状态不在0x75掩码允许集合时，复制该来源错误码与工作状态到本次错误/状态输出。汇编最终MOV EAX,R13D返回累计错误。DoWork收尾以其最终错误寄存器是否0写ModuStatus(index0)，把错误码写this+0x7c、另一个状态码写this+0x84，清this+0x1b8执行中标记，并另发布ModuRunTime。成功布尔、错误码与状态枚举不是一个字段。</p><p>本次局部错误、本次局部状态、this工作字段及模块输出值分开；返回0不构成所有来源/消费者都成功的证明。</p><p>失败体未见统一回滚前面已追加输出，不能以最终ModuStatus=false画成累积数据全部撤销。</p><p>收尾状态写入不等于结果仓销毁；本次描述节点退役见OG07。</p><p>待核：所有上游失败映射、mask中每个状态的名称、异常与取消的全路径未枚举；不由数值猜业务枚举语义。</p><details><summary>1800a7830</summary><p></p><p>SHA256 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="6372780e77ce08ee9a8f506ebbaaf99566fa1bbcb91be8a447368eb63516edc9" href="../../证据/6372780e77ce08ee9a8f506ebbaaf99566fa1bbcb91be8a447368eb63516edc9.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>6372780e77ce</small></a></details><details><summary>1800a7830</summary><p></p><p>SHA256 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b0a0a0dfbab09bedcadc087f0d6f7b9dcd51092a5d6ff75b4ffd0df3172da295" href="../../证据/b0a0a0dfbab09bedcadc087f0d6f7b9dcd51092a5d6ff75b4ffd0df3172da295.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b0a0a0dfbab0</small></a></details><details><summary>1800a0930</summary><p></p><p>SHA256 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="dcd9644ff3996782ec690cfd8e72cfb68a5f7415dcb6221d73836005e4adba39" href="../../证据/dcd9644ff3996782ec690cfd8e72cfb68a5f7415dcb6221d73836005e4adba39.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>dcd9644ff399</small></a></details><details><summary>1800a0930</summary><p></p><p>SHA256 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="55346ec12ae49ac0763ac1a0eade9e080f5952331c56f14342b6d1d8f55ca9ad" href="../../证据/55346ec12ae49ac0763ac1a0eade9e080f5952331c56f14342b6d1d8f55ca9ad.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>55346ec12ae4</small></a></details><details><summary>Original PE selected data strings</summary><p></p><p>SHA256 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="509a294aed2e9245b36110f851cda4ce44ec1710a05f6234e5b418adf1f3fd91" href="../../证据/509a294aed2e9245b36110f851cda4ce44ec1710a05f6234e5b418adf1f3fd91.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>509a294aed2e</small></a></details></details><p>待核：原动态执行callee身份、所有嵌套调度/异常返回和跨程序集同实例关联未闭合。</p></article><article data-group-capability-side="current"><h4>REA当前恢复 · owned Group</h4><p>independent-implementation</p><p>当前同一workflow.subprogram模型包含普通Call与owned Group两支，签名/所有权校验不同；失败输出对父级门控。</p><details data-group-capability-relation="GEC06"><summary>GEC06 · WorkflowCalls.Validate与SolutionExecutor.Call → 普通Call单次执行，owned body循环执行与回传</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>WorkflowCalls.Validate用active集合拒递归，核ProcedureId存在、当前签名等于保存Call接口；一般调用深度/展开有32/10000独立门，owned所有权另有三层限制。SolutionExecutor遇body.GroupOwner==null直接Execute一次；有owner才调用Group循环。父Graph把child保留到Calls，只有child.Success将WorkflowOutputs作为节点输出；失败回SubprogramFailed且节点输出Empty。嵌套helper仍可从Group输入显式收到LoopIndex，而不会自动成为另一个owned轮索引上下文。</p><p>Call metadata、owned parent身份、普通helper runtime session分开；返回是ExecutionSessionResult树及端口字典。</p><p>保留last session树与累计输出片段不同；Calls记录不等于保存每轮所有历史session。</p><p>调用返回不关闭整个solution scope；普通模块实例已在各Graph finally退役。</p><p>待核：普通helper中LoopIndex来源仅本矩阵源码可证明路径；实际3场景probe另在Group数据专题，不由此扩到所有调度分支。</p><details><summary>WorkflowCalls.Validate</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="7c9c6810609057aeb25c05faa228f472f1a3d0f6a8b62e3ed23140abf515e967" href="../../证据/7c9c6810609057aeb25c05faa228f472f1a3d0f6a8b62e3ed23140abf515e967.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>7c9c68106090</small></a></details><details><summary>SolutionExecutor.Execute.Call</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="40db97dc345c9c29fff84c213348b7effd59f7c167956ff4e5f0ac2c59071543" href="../../证据/40db97dc345c9c29fff84c213348b7effd59f7c167956ff4e5f0ac2c59071543.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>40db97dc345c</small></a></details><details><summary>GraphExecutor call result</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="fcb77d6ac70b6f6f83a83ef135a134788993d3a10ddf574c27b0170b05da5084" href="../../证据/fcb77d6ac70b6f6f83a83ef135a134788993d3a10ddf574c27b0170b05da5084.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>fcb77d6ac70b</small></a></details></details><details data-group-capability-relation="GEC07"><summary>GEC07 · Group正常结束/中断/失败/取消 → 末轮session改写聚合，父调用保留Calls但门控输出</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>正常loop出口返回last或新Success空session，再with覆盖CompletedGroupIterations/GroupBroke/GroupBreakIndex/diagnostics/累积outputs与displays。零轮时last为null，Finish对可累积项产生空typed数组；成功break保留前轮节点记录。body返回非Success后先completed++再break，未Add该轮；返回状态仍取last，非累计输出可来自该last。父Graph收到child先存calls[id]，仅child.Success把WorkflowOutputs作为模块结果，否则输出Empty并SubprogramFailed。轮前Throw或Interval Delay抛取消会绕过Group最终聚合return，由父Graph catch/取消/超时门分类，不能宣称任何取消都保留部分累计结果。</p><p>最终Group session只保留last的Nodes/Calls等未被with覆盖字段；并不保存每轮完整session历史。</p><p>累积片段可包含此前Success轮，失败轮不加；但父调用失败时不向正常节点输出发布这些child值，Calls仍可持child诊断。</p><p>Graph finally对普通module先IAsyncDisposable后IDisposable；Dispose错误留error，之后才Record。scope租约与节点module实例是两种退出动作。</p><p>待核：超时/外部取消/Scope.Stopping涉及不同token，不能从一个分支推出所有race结果；本切片仅静态核顺序，没有新运行探针。</p><details><summary>SolutionExecutor.Call completion</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="5883e6ad67d9cb0e9f72214fa075907c29858d2a8ad09e9c5af16c2121f7d2c9" href="../../证据/5883e6ad67d9cb0e9f72214fa075907c29858d2a8ad09e9c5af16c2121f7d2c9.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>5883e6ad67d9</small></a></details><details><summary>SolutionExecutor.Execute timeout mapping</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="6ab9cf57084e3328196e1215c6c2b7482877f494e105d201ac788a2503d498cf" href="../../证据/6ab9cf57084e3328196e1215c6c2b7482877f494e105d201ac788a2503d498cf.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>6ab9cf57084e</small></a></details><details><summary>GraphExecutor child result and module finally</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b39407b4603eede34442390d7b3e3931124a94ddf7e37a834a73ab006de4011d" href="../../证据/b39407b4603eede34442390d7b3e3931124a94ddf7e37a834a73ab006de4011d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b39407b4603e</small></a></details><details><summary>GraphExecutor final cancellation status</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="128258bdd08e71606479c98dfb0fc9268c035ee86c4e9f7bcfc2faabc361e2eb" href="../../证据/128258bdd08e71606479c98dfb0fc9268c035ee86c4e9f7bcfc2faabc361e2eb.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>128258bdd08e</small></a></details></details><p>待核：当前深度/资源保护是独立限制，不与原版最大嵌套或栈布局视为等价。</p></article><article data-group-capability-side="self"><h4>SunEyeVision_V2 · 自研Subroutine</h4><p>source-confirmed</p><p>宿主把委托注入执行参数，工具通过该委托重入同一引擎；子调用共用根会话取消信号，但有独立运行作用域和上下文。</p><p>WorkflowExecutionEngine给ISubWorkflowExecutor同步node.SubroutineId并注入ExecuteSubWorkflowAsync。委托浅复制ctx字典、加入父节点ID，session.CreateChildScope后调用ExecuteWorkflowCore(isSubworkflow:true)。SubroutineTool单次调用用Task.Run等待这个委托。Core查目标定义、校验、BuildExecutionPlan，再创建subContext绑定session.CancellationToken、记录scope.Context并执行子计划；子结果NodeResults还被逐项写入RootContext用于下钻显示。工具Run把结果节点对象放入NodeOutputs、解析输出并构建Display。</p><p>WorkflowExecutionEngine执行参数注入 → ExecuteSubWorkflowAsync closure → CreateChildScope → ExecuteWorkflowCore</p><p>SubroutineTool.ExecuteSubWorkflowOnce → 注入委托 → 子执行计划/WorkflowContext</p><p>子NodeResults → SubroutineResults.NodeOutputs 与 session.RootContext</p><details><summary>Subroutine execution delegate injection</summary><p>SunEyeVision_V2</p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><p>采集来源：D:/MyWork/SunEyeVision_V2/src/Workflow/WorkflowExecutionEngine.cs:893–919 · SHA256 4afdc12717c26f142cdc325d4ebac68a4d32f7cf31f1e5d137552c32419b07db</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f4f8b24126aab505747c760dfc2fd4cbef7d6c3d0de25be66391ea55b252945d" href="../../证据/f4f8b24126aab505747c760dfc2fd4cbef7d6c3d0de25be66391ea55b252945d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f4f8b24126aa</small></a></details><details><summary>ExecuteSubWorkflowOnce</summary><p>SunEyeVision_V2</p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><p>采集来源：D:/MyWork/SunEyeVision_V2/tools/SunEyeVision.Tool.Subroutine/SubroutineTool.cs:236–246 · SHA256 d466151c621cd2eeed17278a04b2d612f4508540a4535edc73e41afe631221c9</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="5667eeed46e76643fa4ff628f50eb47a4f5be9d9dee6d89b987561ff0fa01045" href="../../证据/5667eeed46e76643fa4ff628f50eb47a4f5be9d9dee6d89b987561ff0fa01045.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>5667eeed46e7</small></a></details><details><summary>Validated child plan entry</summary><p>SunEyeVision_V2</p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><p>采集来源：D:/MyWork/SunEyeVision_V2/src/Workflow/WorkflowExecutionEngine.cs:590–626 · SHA256 4afdc12717c26f142cdc325d4ebac68a4d32f7cf31f1e5d137552c32419b07db</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e179545c59558336448aca2526c66cd572b5fff29aff9b5ad08aeb03d686054a" href="../../证据/e179545c59558336448aca2526c66cd572b5fff29aff9b5ad08aeb03d686054a.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e179545c5955</small></a></details><details><summary>Child cancellation and context</summary><p>SunEyeVision_V2</p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><p>采集来源：D:/MyWork/SunEyeVision_V2/src/Workflow/WorkflowExecutionEngine.cs:642–649 · SHA256 4afdc12717c26f142cdc325d4ebac68a4d32f7cf31f1e5d137552c32419b07db</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9f3114a45783200791b457e862e81c2868b3765c40873f5ffa965072fb042a9a" href="../../证据/9f3114a45783200791b457e862e81c2868b3765c40873f5ffa965072fb042a9a.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9f3114a45783</small></a></details><details><summary>CreateChildScope and consumer identity</summary><p>SunEyeVision_V2</p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><p>采集来源：D:/MyWork/SunEyeVision_V2/src/Workflow/WorkflowRunSession.cs:64–77 · SHA256 81a4538d84dd800b91f6380ffbb8bc8fee2b59d0284e5f1c2194a2c97f4587c0</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c119b5a5a732df1e62a40c9e9739fd4408863565a4a8901df79e25c93159387f" href="../../证据/c119b5a5a732df1e62a40c9e9739fd4408863565a4a8901df79e25c93159387f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c119b5a5a732</small></a></details><details><summary>Child results forwarded to root context</summary><p>SunEyeVision_V2</p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><p>采集来源：D:/MyWork/SunEyeVision_V2/src/Workflow/WorkflowExecutionEngine.cs:709–716 · SHA256 4afdc12717c26f142cdc325d4ebac68a4d32f7cf31f1e5d137552c32419b07db</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="53c8ed62642fbfd645ae7f781b754d727b7d6439deb225d01be77d5f3729e624" href="../../证据/53c8ed62642fbfd645ae7f781b754d727b7d6439deb225d01be77d5f3729e624.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>53c8ed62642f</small></a></details><details><summary>Internal results retained in SubroutineResults</summary><p>SunEyeVision_V2</p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><p>采集来源：D:/MyWork/SunEyeVision_V2/tools/SunEyeVision.Tool.Subroutine/SubroutineTool.cs:112–119 · SHA256 d466151c621cd2eeed17278a04b2d612f4508540a4535edc73e41afe631221c9</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="80fb759d98ebfb53d0a2b0594c4f9a6abb23f52a2e285d6bf7d8b9b0a1df9337" href="../../证据/80fb759d98ebfb53d0a2b0594c4f9a6abb23f52a2e285d6bf7d8b9b0a1df9337.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>80fb759d98eb</small></a></details><p>待核：只证普通嵌套调用合同与共享取消来源；最大深度、递归环、并行嵌套及所有取消/错误传播尚未完整追踪或运行。</p><p>待核：ctx字典复制不复制其中IVisionImage/任意对象；不据此声称每层图像深复制或独占所有权。</p></article></div></details><details data-group-capability="loop-break"><summary>循环、中断与逐轮结果</summary><p>中断发生在执行前还是后，前轮值和累计值怎么用？</p><div data-group-capability-columns="true"><article data-group-capability-side="original"><h4>原版VM · Group</h4><p>见逐关系分类</p><p>原资源声明循环/来源/中断类型，已恢复native每轮具名索引写入及break门；类型读取、整数组与溢出/异常边界按OG保留。 