ed持有和临时字符串；覆盖第0项不证明旧结果消费者已释放。</p><p>待核：负步长、start&gt;=end、int32溢出以及所有错误分支未运行差分；不从C有符号算式推出语言层未定义行为结果。</p><details><summary>1800a0930</summary><p></p><p>SHA256 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="6440f459f7dfef6c9fa31a03d8ee506d71f7505f642a3214e140ad94145c08f6" href="../../证据/6440f459f7dfef6c9fa31a03d8ee506d71f7505f642a3214e140ad94145c08f6.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>6440f459f7df</small></a></details><details><summary>1800a0930</summary><p></p><p>SHA256 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="8a7e152402050936bb2dd1da5cb0e939ecd3ff780c5b34221ad2a10cc22354e9" href="../../证据/8a7e152402050936bb2dd1da5cb0e939ecd3ff780c5b34221ad2a10cc22354e9.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>8a7e15240205</small></a></details><details><summary>1800a0930</summary><p></p><p>SHA256 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="37271664e38fb4d2ef533a5b65553042e3607cabac84f6350e23877a21a9c1d3" href="../../证据/37271664e38fb4d2ef533a5b65553042e3607cabac84f6350e23877a21a9c1d3.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>37271664e38f</small></a></details><details><summary>1800a7190</summary><p></p><p>SHA256 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="871e81b93aefc2e28d640a8e5152b12d4b838943dc2ec88a59d1b6fdb2729f5b" href="../../证据/871e81b93aefc2e28d640a8e5152b12d4b838943dc2ec88a59d1b6fdb2729f5b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>871e81b93aef</small></a></details><details><summary>1800f3ee0</summary><p></p><p>SHA256 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="dcbfd8b7f1f1d51a963e7698472c4e5e7770bd5ad32611d7d64fa81eb7e31eff" href="../../证据/dcbfd8b7f1f1d51a963e7698472c4e5e7770bd5ad32611d7d64fa81eb7e31eff.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>dcbfd8b7f1f1</small></a></details><details><summary>Original PE selected data strings</summary><p></p><p>SHA256 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="509a294aed2e9245b36110f851cda4ce44ec1710a05f6234e5b418adf1f3fd91" href="../../证据/509a294aed2e9245b36110f851cda4ce44ec1710a05f6234e5b418adf1f3fd91.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>509a294aed2e</small></a></details></details><details data-group-capability-relation="GEO23"><summary>GEO23 · 本轮索引发布后、执行前 → IsBreakLoop布尔门与首轮特殊准入</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>DoWork在a7190之后调用a55b0，汇编立即TEST AL并在非零时跳过本轮执行/输出段。a55b0原字符串为CGroupNode::IsBreakLoop；体先检查EnableBreak相关字节this+0x250，再检查this+0x22c==0和a6730返回的首轮保护门，随后才按this+0x248类型与+0x24c比较符处理。DoWork只在通过break门后增加this+0x22c，所以检测与已执行轮计数不可混用。</p><p>本轮索引、已通过break门的计数、比较源/目标与布尔结果分开；原byte返回不能因新伪码写void而忽略。</p><p>首轮门可能阻止读取本轮尚未生产的比较数据；本切片仅保留实际门，不泛称所有订阅可用。</p><p>break使本轮执行/输出不发生，不等于清空此前累积输出；比较临时文本在对应分支退役。</p><p>待核：a6730完整类型/作用域分支、比较source getter以及float容差/NaN/字符串全部比较合同不在本轮闭合；不以资源枚举代替各操作汇编。</p><p>待核：新伪码把a55b0显示void且部分返回值丢失；本事实用调用侧AL与所选返回汇编限定，不重写原行为。</p><details><summary>1800a0930</summary><p></p><p>SHA256 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="eb15e39df95081c949d4079b1406455fd25e7b21412c045028d4d8223550f290" href="../../证据/eb15e39df95081c949d4079b1406455fd25e7b21412c045028d4d8223550f290.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>eb15e39df950</small></a></details><details><summary>1800a0930</summary><p></p><p>SHA256 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="bb811a711da404ac05846063c186238e0f4b0dc5b244b5544c4edbe362b47c9c" href="../../证据/bb811a711da404ac05846063c186238e0f4b0dc5b244b5544c4edbe362b47c9c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>bb811a711da4</small></a></details><details><summary>1800a55b0</summary><p></p><p>SHA256 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a cla