字符串；覆盖第0项不证明旧结果消费者已释放。</p><p>待核：负步长、start&gt;=end、int32溢出以及所有错误分支未运行差分；不从C有符号算式推出语言层未定义行为结果。</p><details><summary>1800a0930</summary><p></p><p>SHA256 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="6440f459f7dfef6c9fa31a03d8ee506d71f7505f642a3214e140ad94145c08f6" href="../../证据/6440f459f7dfef6c9fa31a03d8ee506d71f7505f642a3214e140ad94145c08f6.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>6440f459f7df</small></a></details><details><summary>1800a0930</summary><p></p><p>SHA256 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="8a7e152402050936bb2dd1da5cb0e939ecd3ff780c5b34221ad2a10cc22354e9" href="../../证据/8a7e152402050936bb2dd1da5cb0e939ecd3ff780c5b34221ad2a10cc22354e9.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>8a7e15240205</small></a></details><details><summary>1800a0930</summary><p></p><p>SHA256 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="37271664e38fb4d2ef533a5b65553042e3607cabac84f6350e23877a21a9c1d3" href="../../证据/37271664e38fb4d2ef533a5b65553042e3607cabac84f6350e23877a21a9c1d3.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>37271664e38f</small></a></details><details><summary>1800a7190</summary><p></p><p>SHA256 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="871e81b93aefc2e28d640a8e5152b12d4b838943dc2ec88a59d1b6fdb2729f5b" href="../../证据/871e81b93aefc2e28d640a8e5152b12d4b838943dc2ec88a59d1b6fdb2729f5b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>871e81b93aef</small></a></details><details><summary>1800f3ee0</summary><p></p><p>SHA256 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="dcbfd8b7f1f1d51a963e7698472c4e5e7770bd5ad32611d7d64fa81eb7e31eff" href="../../证据/dcbfd8b7f1f1d51a963e7698472c4e5e7770bd5ad32611d7d64fa81eb7e31eff.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>dcbfd8b7f1f1</small></a></details><details><summary>Original PE selected data strings</summary><p></p><p>SHA256 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="509a294aed2e9245b36110f851cda4ce44ec1710a05f6234e5b418adf1f3fd91" href="../../证据/509a294aed2e9245b36110f851cda4ce44ec1710a05f6234e5b418adf1f3fd91.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>509a294aed2e</small></a></details></details><details data-group-capability-relation="OG03"><summary>OG03 · 本轮索引发布后、执行前 → IsBreakLoop布尔门与首轮特殊准入</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>DoWork在a7190之后调用a55b0，汇编立即TEST AL并在非零时跳过本轮执行/输出段。a55b0原字符串为CGroupNode::IsBreakLoop；体先检查EnableBreak相关字节this+0x250，再检查this+0x22c==0和a6730返回的首轮保护门，随后才按this+0x248类型与+0x24c比较符处理。DoWork只在通过break门后增加this+0x22c，所以检测与已执行轮计数不可混用。</p><p>本轮索引、已通过break门的计数、比较源/目标与布尔结果分开；原byte返回不能因新伪码写void而忽略。</p><p>首轮门可能阻止读取本轮尚未生产的比较数据；本切片仅保留实际门，不泛称所有订阅可用。</p><p>break使本轮执行/输出不发生，不等于清空此前累积输出；比较临时文本在对应分支退役。</p><p>待核：a6730完整类型/作用域分支、比较source getter以及float容差/NaN/字符串全部比较合同不在本轮闭合；不以资源枚举代替各操作汇编。</p><p>待核：新伪码把a55b0显示void且部分返回值丢失；本事实用调用侧AL与所选返回汇编限定，不重写原行为。</p><details><summary>1800a0930</summary><p></p><p>SHA256 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="eb15e39df95081c949d4079b1406455fd25e7b21412c045028d4d8223550f290" href="../../证据/eb15e39df95081c949d4079b1406455fd25e7b21412c045028d4d8223550f290.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>eb15e39df950</small></a></details><details><summary>1800a0930</summary><p></p><p>SHA256 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="bb811a711da404ac05846063c186238e0f4b0dc5b244b5544c4edbe362b47c9c" href="../../证据/bb811a711da404ac05846063c186238e0f4b0dc5b244b5544c4edbe362b47c9c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>bb811a711da4</small></a></details><details><summary>1800a55b0</summary><p></p><p>SHA256 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="199969dc83391b93ea040612b9d1188b90b1cb8938a9da910bdff2fe752ed4a7" href="../../证据/199969dc83391b93ea040612b9d1188b90b1cb8938a9da910bdff2fe752ed4a7.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>199969dc8339</small></a></details><details><summary>1800a55b0</summary><p></p><p>SHA256 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4f4ef68f426819cc516cbad2c91a43799f3e0e630472218366672bf2798f6fd8" href="../../证据/4f4ef68f426819cc516cbad2c91a43799f3e0e630472218366672bf2798f6fd8.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4f4ef68f4268</small></a></details><details><summary>1800a6730</summary><p></p><p>SHA256 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="425e1a0e151ac89cd7a1de4eb844bbf939a48ba7aec3f7a9844432fabd401496" href="../../证据/425e1a0e151ac89cd7a1de4eb844bbf939a48ba7aec3f7a9844432fabd401496.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>425e1a0e151a</small></a></details><details><summary>Original PE selected data strings</summary><p></p><p>SHA256 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="509a294aed2e9245b36110f851cda4ce44ec1710a05f6234e5b418adf1f3fd91" href="../../证据/509a294aed2e9245b36110f851cda4ce44ec1710a05f6234e5b418adf1f3fd91.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>509a294aed2e</small></a></details></details><p>待核：不能从LoopStep/LoopIndex名字补所有负步长、溢出或原native数组复制语义。</p></article><article data-group-capability-side="current"><h4>REA当前恢复 · owned Group</h4><p>independent-implementation</p><p>当前先轮前检查break，再Execute；外部值冻结、内部前轮/self分开读；仅成功轮累积，结束JoinArray才新建数组。</p><details data-group-capability-relation="GEC08"><summary>GEC08 · GroupLoop.Read与SolutionExecutor循环 → 每轮索引、独立context与等待控制</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>Read强制LoopTimeGap在0..10000、LoopStep非0；EnableLoop=false时固定Start=0/End=1/Step=1。实际for条件始终index&lt;End，Increment为Start&lt;End?Step:-Step，不把它改述为完整双向区间循环。每轮先childToken.ThrowIfCancellationRequested，再int32范围与10000已完成轮独立资源门，再Evaluate break；通过后await Execute(body.Id,同values,...,index)，completed++，仅Success累积，非Success退出，Success且IntervalMs&gt;0才Delay。</p><p>index是long循环变量，入body的GroupLoopIndex是已核范围后的int；不是全局变量或上轮输出。</p><p>每个Execute新建procedure WaitTime CancellationTokenSource与linked token，新GraphExecutor；内部Graph按ExecutionOrder串行await。</p><p>每次Execute结束其using wait/linked退役；Interval取消抛出而非自动返回已聚合session。</p><p>待核：负步长、Start&gt;=End等组合只按现有代码表达；本切片没有运行差分验证，也不称与原生范围语义等价。</p><details><summary>GroupLoop.Increment</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="dee249a0599528e5feaeb5b27eab66f30c1366868618e2901584dde33194fb78" href="../../证据/dee249a0599528e5feaeb5b27eab66f30c1366868618e2901584dde33194fb78.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>dee249a05995</small></a></details><details><summary>GroupLoop.Read</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="566be9627a5a2338fdfb64074d728471495e59a3b25b1cfff8b87416a5bf24b6" href="../../证据/566be9627a5a2338fdfb64074d728471495e59a3b25b1cfff8b87416a5bf24b6.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>566be9627a5a</small></a></details><details><summary>SolutionExecutor.Execute iteration</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="74e3340ed1af08cce59ea313c625b5560e3345f861a0028f8dc93ffe3f40dbb8" href="../../证据/74e3340ed1af08cce59ea313c625b5560e3345f861a0028f8dc93ffe3f40dbb8.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>74e3340ed1af</small></a></details><details><summary>SolutionExecutor.Execute timeout ownership</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="dd1dd91267603b1aa83ed65328dd7e9bbe33162104ca8de1626dc661402d00ca" href="../../证据/dd1dd91267603b1aa83ed65328dd7e9bbe33162104ca8de1626dc661402d00ca.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>dd1dd9126760</small></a></details></details><details data-group-capability-relation="GEC09"><summary>GEC09 · 父GraphExecutor.GroupBreak.Capture → 外部操作数与动态下标先冻结，内部/self保留引用描述</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>Capture先解析IndexSource，要求Integer+Scalar且0..int.MaxValue，写入Index并清IndexSource；外部非Self有Source的操作数立即从父workflow.Resolve取Element，再序列化为Constant JsonElement新记录。Inside/Self则保留源描述，供轮前求值。InvalidDataException转成PreparationError记录，并非在Capture处直接终止父节点。Snapshot对原Constant另Clone；Validate约束Self必须指向当前Group节点输出且非Inside、外部索引必须来自前置scalar int。</p><p>外部值冻结为JSON常量；内部数据引用是ID/端口/索引，而非原生指针或同一可变字典。</p><p>一个Group调用期间外部冻结常量不随body轮次更新；PreparationError随该调用传给Evaluate。</p><p>这些记录无显式Dispose；源PortValue只在读取/序列化时短暂持有，未建立外部对象所有权转移。</p><p>待核：未从此声称Capture是所有类型的通用序列化；Group break当前只支持Integer/Number/Text。</p><details><summary>GroupBreakBindings.Snapshot</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9a6dace411310cfabf8ca77d5a849dbc7facac475f4bc43e91585b43a9396d67" href="../../证据/9a6dace411310cfabf8ca77d5a849dbc7facac475f4bc43e91585b43a9396d67.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9a6dace41131</small></a></details><details><summary>GroupBreak.Validate</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="cef5ebf4c489b2b240db107ac6da454f0039c2984cd57ca6b2d2980172a58a2c" href="../../证据/cef5ebf4c489b2b240db107ac6da454f0039c2984cd57ca6b2d2980172a58a2c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>cef5ebf4c489</small></a></details><details><summary>GroupBreak.Capture</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9f420d186d7effa569b9559bcc568585398902cc525d1539bd46d93c8c908590" href="../../证据/9f420d186d7effa569b9559bcc568585398902cc525d1539bd46d93c8c908590.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9f420d186d7e</small></a></details></details><details data-group-capability-relation="GEC10"><summary>GEC10 · GroupBreak.Evaluate与Resolve → 本轮索引/输入、前轮内部值与累计self分开读取</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>break在本轮Execute前求值。previous=null且操作数为Self或Inside的生产者源时直接false，跳过首次内部比较；其他Inside LoopIndex取即将执行的index，WorkflowInput优先本次values，未绑定局部变量读声明初始值。绑定内部NodeOutput/LocalVariable在previous session读取，只允许相应可用源；Self由accumulator.ReadSelfElement读累计片段或last输出。Resolve失败记录最多32条去重diagnostics并返回false，继续执行，而非把缺值当0或自动break。break=true时记录broke/index，不再执行该轮也不增加completed。</p><p>previous=最后已返回body session；它不是新的WorkflowRunContext内部records。Self累计与普通上一轮输出有两个读取域。</p><p>accumulator对可累积输出按elementCounts和片段查找Element；不先JoinArray，避免每次比较都重建全数组。</p><p>替换last会去除上一轮session的这个局部引用，但累积片段/显示/模块state可能另持有同payload；不能直接认定上轮已释放。</p><p>待核：运行时不支持/不可用数据仅按具体异常门处理；不从false推断用户配置有效或原版也是同策略。</p><details><summary>GroupBreak.Resolve</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="8f9364f870b59cae612cb531b58885c003f58e51c88e60a5f92922d915aa37a7" href="../../证据/8f9364f870b59cae612cb531b58885c003f58e51c88e60a5f92922d915aa37a7.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>8f9364f870b5</small></a></details><details><summary>GroupBreak.Evaluate</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0a95ed90ff3b865d8059c61c60866662257663cab57a09e9a834a55d7fbb4665" href="../../证据/0a95ed90ff3b865d8059c61c60866662257663cab57a09e9a834a55d7fbb4665.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0a95ed90ff3b</small></a></details><details><summary>GroupOutputAccumulator.ReadSelfElement</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a1e946caea21bf2aa105cf8ed1a6610b571cefc1e8a10ba613aff955cbe3c691" href="../../证据/a1e946caea21bf2aa105cf8ed1a6610b571cefc1e8a10ba613aff955cbe3c691.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a1e946caea21</small></a></details><details><summary>SolutionExecutor loop break ordering</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="5b3f1fa572b5e79d749acc6e9a56dd64f78fdf8e91931003a6244d5f9142f2a8" href="../../证据/5b3f1fa572b5e79d749acc6e9a56dd64f78fdf8e91931003a6244d5f9142f2a8.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>5b3f1fa572b5</small></a></details></details><details data-group-capability-relation="GEC11"><summary>GEC11 · 成功轮GroupOutputAccumulator.Add → 保留PortValue片段 → Finish时新JoinArray容器</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>仅last.Status==Success时Add。对body输出中Accumulate且Accumulatable(Integer/Number/Text/Circle/Point/Fixture)的项，按ElementCount计数、百万元素独立资源门，再list.Add(value)保留原PortValue引用，不立即复制元素。Finish先复制last.WorkflowOutputs字典；每个可累计输出即使未有片段也JoinArray(kind,values)，覆盖该名。JoinArray把Elements扁平ToArray，随后typed工厂再ToArray出新底层容器；string元素仍为原string引用，结构类型按值取出。</p><p>累计阶段持有List&lt;PortValue&gt;片段；完成阶段生成typed数组PortValue。Scalar Element(0)返回原对象，Array Element生成scalar包装。</p><p>未累积输出保留last输出引用，累计输出是所有已成功轮片段的拼接；FinishDisplays和Finish分别创建结果容器。</p><p>accumulator没有Dispose，不遍历free元素；返回后片段列表可离开作用域，新session数组仍持有元素/引用，不保证GC时间或native退役。</p><p>待核：Struct元素内部若含引用不等于递归深拷贝；这里没有验证所有复合工具类型或原native累积所有权。</p><details><summary>GroupOutputAccumulator.Add</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f029fb378ddd618fdf1918483b4a5c322cdc2a1e374b300e28b26c80aba4d8d8" href="../../证据/f029fb378ddd618fdf1918483b4a5c322cdc2a1e374b300e28b26c80aba4d8d8.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f029fb378ddd</small></a></details><details><summary>GroupOutputAccumulator.Finish</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="69e52b1fb9b61b6944e5f3e790465b642f3314956f11ca9408c7e01edef68ca1" href="../../证据/69e52b1fb9b61b6944e5f3e790465b642f3314956f11ca9408c7e01edef68ca1.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>69e52b1fb9b6</small></a></details><details><summary>GroupBreak.Accumulatable</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="689f30a035277ef0445d8996ff91051de9ea35a584e7c55f038d269899446ca5" href="../../证据/689f30a035277ef0445d8996ff91051de9ea35a584e7c55f038d269899446ca5.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>689f30a03527</small></a></details><details><summary>PortValue.Element</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4df84651837891c8010c3cae8460f7e4020a9a7107ee6c827f50a019b5818f0d" href="../../证据/4df84651837891c8010c3cae8460f7e4020a9a7107ee6c827f50a019b5818f0d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4df846518378</small></a></details><details><summary>PortValue.JoinArray and typed array copies</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="462bc67a08cf0628590499bb2cac01d8d3d86cf68101109130873308d2188a3a" href="../../证据/462bc67a08cf0628590499bb2cac01d8d3d86cf68101109130873308d2188a3a.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>462bc67a08cf</small></a></details></details><details data-group-capability-relation="GEC12"><summary>GEC12 · Group显示累积与GroupDisplayLinks → GrayImage每轮替换及返回只读列表容器</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>Add显示先找本轮WorkflowDisplays同名值，list不存在则创建；!spec.Accumulate或spec.Kind==GrayImage时先从displayCount减去旧元素数并frames.Clear，再执行百万元素资源门与AddRange(values)。条件仅精确GrayImage，不能泛称所有Image kind。Clear移除旧PortValue引用而不Dispose payload。FinishDisplays用每个frames.ToArray+Array.AsReadOnly并新字典。自动输出显示只支持GrayImage，LinkedOutputId对应输出稳定ID，同步NodeId/Port/Kind/Cardinality。</p><p>显示列表持有PortValue引用；容器复制不复制图像像素。稳定LinkedOutputId是当前独立身份合同。</p><p>只在成功轮Add；body失败轮的显示未加入该accumulator。返回Group WorkflowDisplays来自累积器，不等于执行了WPF绘制。</p><p>旧帧Clear仅减少此列表持有；last、NodeRunRecord、工具scope state或宿主显示可能仍持有同图像，不能当作像素释放完成。</p><p>待核：本slice没有运行UI，未证明Group图像帧与宿主renderer同次刷新、最后读者或灰度以外图像Kind的预期语义。</p><details><summary>GroupOutputAccumulator.Add displays</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f029fb378ddd618fdf1918483b4a5c322cdc2a1e374b300e28b26c80aba4d8d8" href="../../证据/f029fb378ddd618fdf1918483b4a5c322cdc2a1e374b300e28b26c80aba4d8d8.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f029fb378ddd</small></a></details><details><summary>GroupOutputAccumulator.FinishDisplays</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="718c5e1e9f5805f2fc3d739026cbf4d149283bc7312763c76a1d8501d5b47cc5" href="../../证据/718c5e1e9f5805f2fc3d739026cbf4d149283bc7312763c76a1d8501d5b47cc5.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>718c5e1e9f58</small></a></details><details><summary>GroupDisplayLinks.Synchronize</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="3f288944cbbe4e68a9af4af43e567277afe998fdb70b6f4a51ad295d97864de0" href="../../证据/3f288944cbbe4e68a9af4af43e567277afe998fdb70b6f4a51ad295d97864de0.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>3f288944cbbe</small></a></details></details><p>待核：当前for条件始终index&lt;End，不包装成理想双向循环；取消可能绕过最终汇总，具体分支见CG。</p></article><article data-group-capability-side="self"><h4>SunEyeVision_V2 · 自研Subroutine</h4><p>source-confirmed</p><p>此自研循环先执行并收集本轮，再比较是否中断；它与当前REA在下一轮进入前比较的时间点不同。</p><p>ExecuteWithLoop从父NodeResults绑定解析start/end，再for(int i=start;i&lt;end;i++)：写CurrentIteration、执行子工作流、Merge结果；失败则停止。成功轮解析输出/构建累积显示/AccumulateIteration后才EvaluateBreakCondition。源比较取本轮内部结果，目标比较取父nodeResults，二者转double后按运算符比较；缺绑定/无法转数值不触发中断。非累积输出保存最后对象；累积输出把Array逐项append再重建类型数组；Image勾累积直接抛异常。显示累积另按配置构建图形并Merge。</p><p>父结果绑定start/end → CurrentIteration=i → ExecuteSubWorkflowOnce → Merge</p><p>成功轮输出/显示累积 → EvaluateBreakCondition(本轮内部源,父结果目标) → break / Delay</p><p>AccumulateIteration → Array拍平/标量追加 → BuildFlattenedArray；Image累积明确拒绝</p><details><summary>Loop start/end resolved from bindings</summary><p>SunEyeVision_V2</p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><p>采集来源：D:/MyWork/SunEyeVision_V2/tools/SunEyeVision.Tool.Subroutine/SubroutineTool.cs:344–346 · SHA256 d466151c621cd2eeed17278a04b2d612f4508540a4535edc73e41afe631221c9</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="64a5d2ffb088720619dbf58f7dd7a3c154b83e9a79c59fba28dd9c33f3d8a348" href="../../证据/64a5d2ffb088720619dbf58f7dd7a3c154b83e9a79c59fba28dd9c33f3d8a348.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>64a5d2ffb088</small></a></details><details><summary>Loop bounds and post-iteration break ordering</summary><p>SunEyeVision_V2</p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><p>采集来源：D:/MyWork/SunEyeVision_V2/tools/SunEyeVision.Tool.Subroutine/SubroutineTool.cs:358–407 · SHA256 d466151c621cd2eeed17278a04b2d612f4508540a4535edc73e41afe631221c9</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="cea4790cb25905074223e043831c88407371482f72b1bf7e60ae0fd28e5c83ea" href="../../证据/cea4790cb25905074223e043831c88407371482f72b1bf7e60ae0fd28e5c83ea.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>cea4790cb259</small></a></details><details><summary>Loop bound binding is mandatory</summary><p>SunEyeVision_V2</p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><p>采集来源：D:/MyWork/SunEyeVision_V2/tools/SunEyeVision.Tool.Subroutine/SubroutineTool.cs:662–669 · SHA256 d466151c621cd2eeed17278a04b2d612f4508540a4535edc73e41afe631221c9</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9a08fb5fd2b815a7e408ffecdda972cb37e52817c109a368d47e21fb9c845f11" href="../../证据/9a08fb5fd2b815a7e408ffecdda972cb37e52817c109a368d47e21fb9c845f11.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9a08fb5fd2b8</small></a></details><details><summary>Post-iteration internal comparison source</summary><p>SunEyeVision_V2</p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><p>采集来源：D:/MyWork/SunEyeVision_V2/tools/SunEyeVision.Tool.Subroutine/SubroutineTool.cs:699–720 · SHA256 d466151c621cd2eeed17278a04b2d612f4508540a4535edc73e41afe631221c9</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c546533af448eccc3261ca79782026f801e7dff03b09396d2e71a05e271244d3" href="../../证据/c546533af448eccc3261ca79782026f801e7dff03b09396d2e71a05e271244d3.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c546533af448</small></a></details><details><summary>Parent comparison target</summary><p>SunEyeVision_V2</p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><p>采集来源：D:/MyWork/SunEyeVision_V2/tools/SunEyeVision.Tool.Subroutine/SubroutineTool.cs:730–748 · SHA256 d466151c621cd2eeed17278a04b2d612f4508540a4535edc73e41afe631221c9</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="5e309ac20863134af43c04922b517a7aebbc858b9354236d55f70c49a24d2135" href="../../证据/5e309ac20863134af43c04922b517a7aebbc858b9354236d55f70c49a24d2135.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>5e309ac20863</small></a></details><details><summary>Double-only comparison implementation</summary><p>SunEyeVision_V2</p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><p>采集来源：D:/MyWork/SunEyeVision_V2/tools/SunEyeVision.Tool.Subroutine/SubroutineTool.cs:757–771 · SHA256 d466151c621cd2eeed17278a04b2d612f4508540a4535edc73e41afe631221c9</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ee6d71ea8f82e1062e9d5cfcd9741a4cea0e9a6cad75fb4b8d4d5162444e8534" href="../../证据/ee6d71ea8f82e1062e9d5cfcd9741a4cea0e9a6cad75fb4b8d4d5162444e8534.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ee6d71ea8f82</small></a></details><details><summary>Accumulation and image rejection</summary><p>SunEyeVision_V2</p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><p>采集来源：D:/MyWork/SunEyeVision_V2/tools/SunEyeVision.Tool.Subroutine/SubroutineTool.cs:597–630 · SHA256 d466151c621cd2eeed17278a04b2d612f4508540a4535edc73e41afe631221c9</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e4468cbcb9e9d0ac311dc260c5c152bbc26418dee5c77dd76bac5c91431ddf16" href="../../证据/e4468cbcb9e9d0ac311dc260c5c152bbc26418dee5c77dd76bac5c91431ddf16.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e4468cbcb9e9</small></a></details><details><summary>Typed flattened array construction</summary><p>SunEyeVision_V2</p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><p>采集来源：D:/MyWork/SunEyeVision_V2/tools/SunEyeVision.Tool.Subroutine/SubroutineTool.cs:635–658 · SHA256 d466151c621cd2eeed17278a04b2d612f4508540a4535edc73e41afe631221c9</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="010a0b8385d5ee64000a68ba615062ee15a1587d009bd555f9cb8d2a51c03d35" href="../../证据/010a0b8385d5ee64000a68ba615062ee15a1587d009bd555f9cb8d2a51c03d35.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>010a0b8385d5</small></a></details><details><summary>Configured loop type vocabulary</summary><p>SunEyeVision_V2</p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><p>采集来源：D:/MyWork/SunEyeVision_V2/tools/SunEyeVision.Tool.Subroutine/ViewModels/SubroutineParameterDialogViewModel.cs:64–64 · SHA256 6377ffc87d505ff93ddde99de7fd224afdccae7f52c8faee31e45e517217c16e</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f8c7b1ace1cd72d10f2801daa76aa2928d49d3d9aeda40852a85f6f12088077f" href="../../证据/f8c7b1ace1cd72d10f2801daa76aa2928d49d3d9aeda40852a85f6f12088077f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f8c7b1ace1cd</small></a></details><details><summary>ExecutionResult success field default and constructor</summary><p>SunEyeVision_V2</p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><p>采集来源：D:/MyWork/SunEyeVision_V2/src/Plugin.SDK/Execution/Results/ExecutionResult.cs:8–28 · SHA256 623234c64f7ff6be67b7e6ded4c1503733c68139b9db8e548a1b629c94e48a1c</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="5c54e6b07916db24cd1fd742c82a520fdd923e880d5d9fad72993b95a1a6ed10" href="../../证据/5c54e6b07916db24cd1fd742c82a520fdd923e880d5d9fad72993b95a1a6ed10.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>5c54e6b07916</small></a></details><details><summary>Merged node/value references and status</summary><p>SunEyeVision_V2</p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><p>采集来源：D:/MyWork/SunEyeVision_V2/src/Plugin.SDK/Execution/Results/ExecutionResult.cs:54–67 · SHA256 623234c64f7ff6be67b7e6ded4c1503733c68139b9db8e548a1b629c94e48a1c</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d5b9493d06fe8d50703862c6aff1d924fb1a4c984d799562eb45b5f3590534d6" href="../../证据/d5b9493d06fe8d50703862c6aff1d924fb1a4c984d799562eb45b5f3590534d6.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d5b9493d06fe</small></a></details><details><summary>Run final success/errors gate</summary><p>SunEyeVision_V2</p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><p>采集来源：D:/MyWork/SunEyeVision_V2/tools/SunEyeVision.Tool.Subroutine/SubroutineTool.cs:150–163 · SHA256 d466151c621cd2eeed17278a04b2d612f4508540a4535edc73e41afe631221c9</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="7499c7939bd1afe54895e4a2e07279242a1af0d9e60c16485833842722bae420" href="../../证据/7499c7939bd1afe54895e4a2e07279242a1af0d9e60c16485833842722bae420.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>7499c7939bd1</small></a></details><p>待核：仅确认CurrentIteration属性赋值，未证它像REA GroupLoopIndex一样成为内部节点可绑定来源；不要把两个名称视为同一合同。</p><p>待核：ExecutionResult默认Success=false，Merge使用Success &amp;&amp; other.Success；Run最终又按Success与Errors组合分支判状态。完整循环成功/零轮/取消状态的主机效果未运行，不能仅按方法名或注释推定。</p><p>待核：循环间Task.Delay未在所选行传取消令牌；工具入口和下层执行是否及时响应取消需分段验证。</p><p>当前片段明确未支持：所选EvaluateBreakCondition没有独立字符串比较分支：非数值文本在double.TryParse失败后返回false；即使LoopConfig.DataType可配置string，也不能称已实现字符串运算。</p><p>当前片段明确未支持：所选for循环固定i++，没有在此体消费可配置LoopStep或降序范围。</p></article></div></details><details data-group-capability="copy-save"><summary>复制、粘贴与保存载入</summary><p>复制一个Group会共享内部图吗？保存的是自研结构还是原版文件？</p><div data-group-capability-columns="true"><article data-group-capability-side="original"><h4>原版VM · Group</h4><p>见逐关系分类</p><p>原导入/导出含版本检查、SDK调用和文件属性缓存；UI保护与文件密码分列，native容器算法未闭合。</p><details data-group-capability-relation="GEO24"><summary>GEO24 · DoPaste / OnPasteItems → PasteItemsCommand</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>DoPaste 产生 DiagramEventArgs.Point 并发事件，XAML 将该事件交 PasteItemsCommand；命令先 CheckRunning、登记 CopyModule RootOperation，再 ProcedurePaste。</p><p>仅按保留的类型/成员/资源和逐关系源码解释，不把节点相邻补成同一运行对象。</p><p>此正式关系未单列完整缓存合同；不能据入口/配置存在推断结果保留策略。</p><p>此正式关系未单列所有退出/异常资源释放；按原record的unknowns保留边界。</p><details><summary>ItemsPage.DoPaste</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="6ffb71979148020abf437348e14403067b0b5dbf1a4284d0e44ab73f72da4a21" href="../../证据/6ffb71979148020abf437348e14403067b0b5dbf1a4284d0e44ab73f72da4a21.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>6ffb71979148</small></a></details><details><summary>DiagramPage paste binding</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="966252cac1bee6f62a0ae6caf8e72e4ac852cef1d1d9f792ed7e69ef4f816a51" href="../../证据/966252cac1bee6f62a0ae6caf8e72e4ac852cef1d1d9f792ed7e69ef4f816a51.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>966252cac1be</small></a></details><details><summary>VmModuleBaseDecorator.PasteItemsCommandExecute</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="243cf2590142b46d9209060a0f9ba1c55fcb598585044b30220b39bc714a5cb5" href="../../证据/243cf2590142b46d9209060a0f9ba1c55fcb598585044b30220b39bc714a5cb5.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>243cf2590142</small></a></details></details><details data-group-capability-relation="GEO25"><summary>GEO25 · DecoratorBase.ImportGroup → 运行门/路径 → LoadGroup(moduleSet,path,null)</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>先CheckRunning，远程/普通分别选择路径并记录目录；text非null才调LoadGroup，未提供文件密码参数。成功创建VmModuleDecorator并写导入位置。框架LoadGroup仍允许API调用者显式传strPassword，不能把菜单默认值等同所有入口。</p><p>仅按保留的类型/成员/资源和逐关系源码解释，不把节点相邻补成同一运行对象。</p><p>此正式关系未单列完整缓存合同；不能据入口/配置存在推断结果保留策略。</p><p>此正式关系未单列所有退出/异常资源释放；按原record的unknowns保留边界。</p><p>待核：CheckRunning全部状态、其它API生产者、可空路径与宿主坐标投递未全覆盖。</p><details><summary>VMControls.WPF.DataForUI.DecoratorBase::ImportGroup</summary><p></p><p>99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9b8689f3f9a1ad0c9c3910cb837c4c3c0b96fa460bff17d265038e0fefea3c61" href="../../证据/9b8689f3f9a1ad0c9c3910cb837c4c3c0b96fa460bff17d265038e0fefea3c61.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9b8689f3f9a1</small></a></details><details><summary>VM.Core.VmSolution::LoadGroup</summary><p></p><p>936763f6c8a1bf9fcf59f22acebca8feb09b5f3d5701ae77c82bdc81e626190d / MVID 290025bc-e040-4cd5-94dd-cd49b9af9c99</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ffedc772daf927f50860d4dc1ea486aab01ab6567a8f54b15d980a6ef97cf530" href="../../证据/ffedc772daf927f50860d4dc1ea486aab01ab6567a8f54b15d980a6ef97cf530.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ffedc772daf9</small></a></details></details><details data-group-capability-relation="GEO26"><summary>GEO26 · internalImportGroup导入与回调 → strPassword??空 → SDK → 文件属性缓存</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>父为Group传Root.ID/自身ID，流程传自身ID/0；SDK导入使用strPassword??&quot;&quot;。调用后才置结束旗标false再Wait；回调完成与对象构造见原加载图。返回对象记录ModuleFilePath及原strPassword，缓存null与实际SDK空串分列。</p><p>仅按保留的类型/成员/资源和逐关系源码解释，不把节点相邻补成同一运行对象。</p><p>此正式关系未单列完整缓存合同；不能据入口/配置存在推断结果保留策略。</p><p>此正式关系未单列所有退出/异常资源释放；按原record的unknowns保留边界。</p><p>待核：native回调生产/早回调、异常后importGroupModuleSet、同步等待与文件真正导入完成仍未知。</p><details><summary>VM.Core.VmSolution::internalImportGroup</summary><p></p><p>936763f6c8a1bf9fcf59f22acebca8feb09b5f3d5701ae77c82bdc81e626190d / MVID 290025bc-e040-4cd5-94dd-cd49b9af9c99</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d74e20eeda284aa06fefd225bc3d3b4be92774c0908ce2fa034091fe27f73d9c" href="../../证据/d74e20eeda284aa06fefd225bc3d3b4be92774c0908ce2fa034091fe27f73d9c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d74e20eeda28</small></a></details><details><summary>VM.Core.VmSolution::MModuleManager_OnImportGroupEndCallBack</summary><p></p><p>936763f6c8a1bf9fcf59f22acebca8feb09b5f3d5701ae77c82bdc81e626190d / MVID 290025bc-e040-4cd5-94dd-cd49b9af9c99</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="52d35f8615f949f6e85b9b5f0b09096d4527f82a0ca82ce04537b4fcdc91b29f" href="../../证据/52d35f8615f949f6e85b9b5f0b09096d4527f82a0ca82ce04537b4fcdc91b29f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>52d35f8615f9</small></a></details></details><details data-group-capability-relation="GEO27"><summary>GEO27 · IMVSGroup.ExportFile → ModuleFilePassword回退 / GetDeepLevel固定0 / 首次缓存</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>显式password非null时使用它；null才用非null ModuleFilePassword，否则空串。路径null才按isExportAs/已有ModuleFilePath决定对话框或复用。ExportGroup传GetDeepLevel，原件此函数固定0，不能按名字补递归深度。成功仅原ModuleFilePath为空时更新文件路径/密码缓存，已有路径的另存不自动改缓存。</p><p>仅按保留的类型/成员/资源和逐关系源码解释，不把节点相邻补成同一运行对象。</p><p>此正式关系未单列完整缓存合同；不能据入口/配置存在推断结果保留策略。</p><p>此正式关系未单列所有退出/异常资源释放；按原record的unknowns保留边界。</p><p>待核：特定错误码-536870093提示后返回null，其它VmException重抛；实际文件加密、缓存寿命与失败回滚未验。</p><details><summary>VM.Core.IMVSGroup::ExportFile</summary><p></p><p>936763f6c8a1bf9fcf59f22acebca8feb09b5f3d5701ae77c82bdc81e626190d / MVID 290025bc-e040-4cd5-94dd-cd49b9af9c99</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="fb1b1d43cb19c052dd620860851e56e6c6326938a2e509832aaa3add4d95d67a" href="../../证据/fb1b1d43cb19c052dd620860851e56e6c6326938a2e509832aaa3add4d95d67a.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>fb1b1d43cb19</small></a></details><details><summary>VM.Core.IMVSGroup::GetDeepLevel</summary><p></p><p>936763f6c8a1bf9fcf59f22acebca8feb09b5f3d5701ae77c82bdc81e626190d / MVID 290025bc-e040-4cd5-94dd-cd49b9af9c99</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="8cfd1236b9e5041552b613e9767f9b2fe4a0773b2db00e21508a12e1e30da5e5" href="../../证据/8cfd1236b9e5041552b613e9767f9b2fe4a0773b2db00e21508a12e1e30da5e5.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>8cfd1236b9e5</small></a></details><details><summary>VM.Core.VmModule::get_ModuleFilePassword</summary><p></p><p>936763f6c8a1bf9fcf59f22acebca8feb09b5f3d5701ae77c82bdc81e626190d / MVID 290025bc-e040-4cd5-94dd-cd49b9af9c99</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9ac7712e7ea4bcc407d40dbe590833fe28091fa92eef14bd1c46b85d02898282" href="../../证据/9ac7712e7ea4bcc407d40dbe590833fe28091fa92eef14bd1c46b85d02898282.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9ac7712e7ea4</small></a></details></details><details data-group-capability-relation="GEO28"><summary>GEO28 · PasswordA/UI保护 与 ModuleFilePassword/文件载荷 → 两个状态通道分开</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>前者来自Group.UserData和校验窗，后者是VmModule的独立自动属性，导入记录或首次文件导出时更新。本页选中导出路径没有把PasswordA传作文件密码；未据此断言两者在全程序任何位置都不会关联。</p><p>仅按保留的类型/成员/资源和逐关系源码解释，不把节点相邻补成同一运行对象。</p><p>此正式关系未单列完整缓存合同；不能据入口/配置存在推断结果保留策略。</p><p>此正式关系未单列所有退出/异常资源释放；按原record的unknowns保留边界。</p><p>待核：跨模块所有赋值者、其它导出/复制/升级入口和native存储关联仍待逐链核查。</p><details><summary>VM.Core.VmModule::set_ModuleFilePassword</summary><p></p><p>936763f6c8a1bf9fcf59f22acebca8feb09b5f3d5701ae77c82bdc81e626190d / MVID 290025bc-e040-4cd5-94dd-cd49b9af9c99</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a6f7f6920d5d1b182f1f2d6a7c52bc6a5bb61560993fe4f73dbff8e9e7c56221" href="../../证据/a6f7f6920d5d1b182f1f2d6a7c52bc6a5bb61560993fe4f73dbff8e9e7c56221.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a6f7f6920d5d</small></a></details><details><summary>Group PasswordA UI bytes</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b1cc6146bd3b6264b87e23acc10ef3ac8139488ce6a4a624ac8b79745c1c5925" href="../../证据/b1cc6146bd3b6264b87e23acc10ef3ac8139488ce6a4a624ac8b79745c1c5925.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b1cc6146bd3b</small></a></details></details><p>待核：原ProcedurePaste接收体、.gro/.sol容器/密码算法、失败清理与原机往返未闭合。</p></article><article data-group-capability-side="current"><h4>REA当前恢复 · owned Group</h4><p>independent-implementation</p><p>当前剪贴板递归生成独立owned图，保存载入走自研方案模型；不能把“都叫保存Group”当格式兼容。</p><details data-group-capability-relation="GEC13"><summary>GEC13 · CopyNodes/PasteNodes → CloneClipboardGroups → 递归克隆owned body与重映射ID</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>CopyNodes保留来源solution/procedure/path与OwnedProcedures，粘贴先ResolveClipboardSources检查来源方案ID与图路径，并从当前source快照重新取仍存在且同名节点；PasteNodes为复制节点生成新ID，克隆参数/ROI与Call。CloneClipboardGroups递归给每个body及内部节点新Guid，写新的(parent,node) owner，并重映射内部配置/连接/执行边/GroupBreak，拒无owner与递归环。Edit再统一CloneOwnedCopies/PruneOwnedGroups，不能简单把旧body指针交给两个owner共享。</p><p>复制内部图结构及其ID映射；PortValue运行session不在GraphFragment复制合同里。</p><p>不是系统剪贴板已经存全部原native对象；来源已变时可能拒绝或回空片段。</p><p>事务后失去owner的body由PruneOwnedGroups递归移除，真正工具state清理由scope Retain/Remove生命周期另证。</p><p>待核：原ProcedurePaste的native对象/链接复制/回滚不以当前Guid重映射代替。</p><details><summary>CopyNodes/PasteNodes</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0d5c0be14a2256dca531850f2fc29c693ef62522ece50ba990bdabbd48f1966e" href="../../证据/0d5c0be14a2256dca531850f2fc29c693ef62522ece50ba990bdabbd48f1966e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0d5c0be14a22</small></a></details><details><summary>ResolveClipboardSources</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="318bc4df1af26f4295e00e67f0fba096a839717789f0bb8c4403206e324b4189" href="../../证据/318bc4df1af26f4295e00e67f0fba096a839717789f0bb8c4403206e324b4189.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>318bc4df1af2</small></a></details><details><summary>CloneClipboardGroups</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="09115ace792b85219bc145b62802215cba7c6b1e347644868e9fccc845d1cdf1" href="../../证据/09115ace792b85219bc145b62802215cba7c6b1e347644868e9fccc845d1cdf1.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>09115ace792b</small></a></details><details><summary>PruneOwnedGroups</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="1522536b8247234cd176980d38eff258226c564f8ea04582b3a2cd332869e6a0" href="../../证据/1522536b8247234cd176980d38eff258226c564f8ea04582b3a2cd332869e6a0.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>1522536b8247</small></a></details></details><details data-group-capability-relation="GEC14"><summary>GEC14 · GraphEditorDocument.Load / Save → 独立SolutionStore文件及提交时序</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>Load用SolutionStore.Load，Separate/Copy并经过PrepareLoad，再ValidateStructure后才替换document、文件路径与基目录、增加solutionGeneration、清history并发SolutionReplaced/Changed。Save先PrepareSave(Copy(document))、Rebase，SolutionStore.Save成功后才更新document/路径/Dirty/Revision。保存对象包含owned Procedures/GroupOwner/Call等当前模型，不能宣称读取或生成原.gro/.sol同格式。</p><p>当前JSON方案结构；group接口/owner与节点记录持久化，不代表保存每轮运行图像或session。</p><p>失败未到编辑状态提交点；资源插件PrepareSave及atomic写入另有明确合同。</p><p>Load替换事件供宿主重置显示/执行scope；仅Save不等于关闭执行资源。</p><p>待核：原Group文件密码ModuleFilePassword与UI PasswordA是两个通道；当前没有据这些JSON路径恢复原容器/加密算法。</p><details><summary>Load / Save</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="195dc5d1c17b26c38959489d071a8a63ff2c97f6d1fbf04895cc1efc54339d60" href="../../证据/195dc5d1c17b26c38959489d071a8a63ff2c97f6d1fbf04895cc1efc54339d60.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>195dc5d1c17b</small></a></details><details><summary>SolutionStore.Save</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0e09f57524ef1fddbe588cec4977d39679ca328ab0b45154c8f2022ab56b1d33" href="../../证据/0e09f57524ef1fddbe588cec4977d39679ca328ab0b45154c8f2022ab56b1d33.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0e09f57524ef</small></a></details></details><p>待核：当前尚未从本矩阵证明所有外部资源重定位/密码保护与原文件兼容。</p></article><article data-group-capability-side="self"><h4>SunEyeVision_V2 · 自研Subroutine</h4><p>source-confirmed</p><p>方案JSON保存与绑定配置快照已能定位；运行委托及CurrentIteration被排除序列化，复制子程序实体和引用重映射需另查。</p><p>Solution.Save用WorkflowSerializationOptions序列化整方案并调用AtomicJsonFile.Write；Load按同选项反序列化。BindingConfigurationStore.Copy保留工作流/节点身份与SubroutineId、IsSubroutine并复制参数/绑定和连接；ToolParameterSnapshot.Create委托统一参数复制器。SubroutineParameters的ExecuteSubWorkflowAsync、CurrentIteration标JsonIgnore。另一个Workflow.Clone生成新工作流ID，调用node.Clone并生成连接ID；它与保留身份的配置快照不是同一种操作。</p><p>Solution.Save / Load → WorkflowSerializationOptions → JSON / AtomicJsonFile</p><p>BindingConfigurationStore.Copy → SubroutineId / IsSubroutine保留 → ToolParameterSnapshot.Create</p><p>Workflow.Clone新工作流ID的复制路线与配置快照分列</p><details><summary>Solution.Save JSON and atomic writer</summary><p>SunEyeVision_V2</p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><p>采集来源：D:/MyWork/SunEyeVision_V2/src/Workflow/Solution.cs:120–142 · SHA256 fbde35ebd0669619af5998ee637c8a1f479e1aa5f0709d7ec157b63846ad42af</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ab6e69577d2e4a89f21e1221e2b9418719b79612da11813acd70103662fc1529" href="../../证据/ab6e69577d2e4a89f21e1221e2b9418719b79612da11813acd70103662fc1529.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ab6e69577d2e</small></a></details><details><summary>Solution.Load deserialization</summary><p>SunEyeVision_V2</p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><p>采集来源：D:/MyWork/SunEyeVision_V2/src/Workflow/Solution.cs:146–159 · SHA256 fbde35ebd0669619af5998ee637c8a1f479e1aa5f0709d7ec157b63846ad42af</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="7b0dd6e305c4059014df8ccbf5db6880d45b20d2ed1dda437aa0b7a737997fa7" href="../../证据/7b0dd6e305c4059014df8ccbf5db6880d45b20d2ed1dda437aa0b7a737997fa7.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>7b0dd6e305c4</small></a></details><details><summary>Stable identity configuration copy</summary><p>SunEyeVision_V2</p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><p>采集来源：D:/MyWork/SunEyeVision_V2/src/Workflow/BindingConfigurationStore.cs:227–248 · SHA256 bd981fce29d62c5390e6f6e0dda62313fef127e03b38450d24b7efcb30b9ae78</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e7168b9913f169fa2f65ab6dbc04a0bca06b9382ec8214d63524f8a6a90ff7c4" href="../../证据/e7168b9913f169fa2f65ab6dbc04a0bca06b9382ec8214d63524f8a6a90ff7c4.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e7168b9913f1</small></a></details><details><summary>Tool parameter snapshot copy entry</summary><p>SunEyeVision_V2</p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><p>采集来源：D:/MyWork/SunEyeVision_V2/src/Workflow/ToolParameterSnapshot.cs:15–21 · SHA256 09ecfaeb7bbad5f7cc6a6bd3333a01bf4089fc365092382257f35a475770b696</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="79536a97b377718aa3cf5884ded7c6ec567d2ac058c7d5ca683165bef8b6804e" href="../../证据/79536a97b377718aa3cf5884ded7c6ec567d2ac058c7d5ca683165bef8b6804e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>79536a97b377</small></a></details><details><summary>Runtime delegate excluded from serialization</summary><p>SunEyeVision_V2</p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><p>采集来源：D:/MyWork/SunEyeVision_V2/src/Plugin.SDK/Execution/Parameters/SubroutineParameters.cs:19–20 · SHA256 16886788c678530a973f1410303ff360aa65d8b59a04836186582e0487bd7e2c</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c489c25edd8d4948631138365c0afcedf73a3518d909db5eacef5325eca41ac9" href="../../证据/c489c25edd8d4948631138365c0afcedf73a3518d909db5eacef5325eca41ac9.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c489c25edd8d</small></a></details><details><summary>CurrentIteration runtime property</summary><p>SunEyeVision_V2</p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><p>采集来源：D:/MyWork/SunEyeVision_V2/src/Plugin.SDK/Execution/Parameters/SubroutineParameters.cs:27–28 · SHA256 16886788c678530a973f1410303ff360aa65d8b59a04836186582e0487bd7e2c</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="235b8ced5445c7d8ac0820575e12f6ac2806371f5a9cc76b0fe2529bd714021c" href="../../证据/235b8ced5445c7d8ac0820575e12f6ac2806371f5a9cc76b0fe2529bd714021c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>235b8ced5445</small></a></details><details><summary>New workflow clone route</summary><p>SunEyeVision_V2</p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><p>采集来源：D:/MyWork/SunEyeVision_V2/src/Workflow/Workflow.cs:92–121 · SHA256 5f386e3617a3a78ecbaa08d788a8f2161dc4b145dbf5d9823767ee2efc3d8f46</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="27434a7dabc0c372682406531e09c96b28ec9698d12a8a0fe4d792bf3865fc1d" href="../../证据/27434a7dabc0c372682406531e09c96b28ec9698d12a8a0fe4d792bf3865fc1d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>27434a7dabc0</small></a></details><p>待核：Snapshot.Copy只保留SubroutineId不等于“复制子程序节点后独立克隆整个子流程”。未追到剪贴板/粘贴入口与递归ID、绑定路径重映射验收；此能力保持未知。</p><p>待核：参数多态序列化、全部运行态排除项、历史Undo/Redo和资源文件迁移未穷举；未做保存重开运行验证。</p></article></div></details><details data-group-capability="exit-retire"><summary>退出、删除与资源释放</summary><p>返回上层、关闭参数窗、删除Group和换方案各释放什么？</p><div data-group-capability-columns="true"><article data-group-capability-side="original"><h4>原版VM · Group</h4><p>见逐关系分类</p><p>原native本次描述链及shared局部持有有正常退役分支；原显示集合替换后的decorator释放与最后结果读者仍未知。</p><details data-group-capability-relation="GEO29"><summary>GEO29 · DoWork正常退出的本次描述链表 → 退役临时节点与shared持有，结果最后读者仍未知</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>DoWork收尾把本次输出链表头复位，逐节点调用a77a0(节点+0xa8)与a03a0(节点+0x18)，operator delete节点，最后delete链表头。a77a0与a03a0对各shared控制块真实LOCK递减强计数，仅强归零调用虚槽0，再递减弱计数，弱归零调用虚槽+8；a77a0还清文本。节点及符合capacity条件的临时文本有直接delete证据，不能把局部shared撤销写成所有结果payload立即释放。</p><p>本次输出订阅描述、shared控制块、typed目标/源载荷、仍可被模块仓或消费者持有的结果分别退役。</p><p>本次列表清除只撤销列表持有；前轮累积结果与其它仓库缓存可能仍存。</p><p>节点/链表头直接delete已证；具体shared动态析构接收者和结果最后读者未在本专题定位，不冒全局无泄漏。</p><p>待核：typed结果载荷最终free、异常栈展开与并发最后读者未知；正常收尾不是所有异常必清理证明。</p><details><summary>1800a0930</summary><p></p><p>SHA256 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="75f8e47f35dc63ec56e84756956ee86d13a3fd16cc43fc3d869d2870181052ca" href="../../证据/75f8e47f35dc63ec56e84756956ee86d13a3fd16cc43fc3d869d2870181052ca.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>75f8e47f35dc</small></a></details><details><summary>1800a77a0</summary><p></p><p>SHA256 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="bd68d4d6a93f45c1b1ca2912b9a8190c910203d1bc2a79d672ccdc2d0af0feaf" href="../../证据/bd68d4d6a93f45c1b1ca2912b9a8190c910203d1bc2a79d672ccdc2d0af0feaf.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>bd68d4d6a93f</small></a></details><details><summary>1800a03a0</summary><p></p><p>SHA256 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="33cf62369a4f895f25e059b46bcd795670bd78ef0fa28c05c03af1f93cf4f860" href="../../证据/33cf62369a4f895f25e059b46bcd795670bd78ef0fa28c05c03af1f93cf4f860.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>33cf62369a4f</small></a></details><details><summary>1800a77a0</summary><p></p><p>SHA256 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d14caefb25811d640ab3c33d95a7f7966275c7cae0671aa2c843de3ee10a48b0" href="../../证据/d14caefb25811d640ab3c33d95a7f7966275c7cae0671aa2c843de3ee10a48b0.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d14caefb2581</small></a></details></details><details data-group-capability-relation="GEO30"><summary>GEO30 · 完整输入 / 状态 / 持久化生命周期 → Group 显示上下文的全部分支</summary><p>unknown</p><p>本页已核双击/返回/显示目标，但搜索跳转、树导航、密码事件副作用、集合替换后的 decorator 释放和原机操作仍不完整。</p><p>仅按保留的类型/成员/资源和逐关系源码解释，不把节点相邻补成同一运行对象。</p><p>此正式关系未单列完整缓存合同；不能据入口/配置存在推断结果保留策略。</p><p>此正式关系未单列所有退出/异常资源释放；按原record的unknowns保留边界。</p><p>待核：后续必须追精确命令/事件/持久化成员；不从截图补规格。</p></details><details data-group-capability-relation="GEO32"><summary>GEO32 · VmModule.Dispose → InnerDispose / CommonDispose → 集合移除、IO退役与IMVSGroup.CloseModuleInterface → DeleteGroupModule</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>现有托管原体中Dispose交InnerDispose：先IsOnDispose=true，已disposedValue则return；Group先收变量绑定范围再ClearVarBindResultRelation，按Undo服务可能Export。VmModuleSet.DeleteInnerModules只递归从AllModules移除子模块记录，所选方法没有逐child.Dispose调用，不能写成已逐层析构全部子payload。随后退前驱NextModules链接、删参数绑定、CommonDispose，再从父Modules及AllModules移除本对象，CloseModuleInterface后才disposedValue=true。IMVSGroup override CloseModuleInterface明确交DeleteGroupModule(ID)。CommonDispose清NextModules、解内部订阅并逐Inputs/Outputs.Dispose。整个InnerDispose异常catch仅恢复IsOnDispose=false并包装重抛，不等于finally补完剩余清理。</p><p>从模型索引移除、IO对象Dispose、native DeleteGroupModule请求是独立动作；不把TryRemove等同native free。</p><p>Undo Export可能额外持有删除前对象信息；已disposed与异常后的字段不同。</p><p>托管正常顺序可证；DeleteGroupModule最终native资源释放、child最后持有者和异常后未执行部分仍未知。</p><p>待核：明确下一缺口是ModuleManager.DeleteGroupModule的实际SDK/native接收体及原Group子模块最终payload退役，不能以字典移除补足。</p><p>待核：所选已有反编译体未新做CIL逐指令或原版运行验证。</p><details><summary>VmModule.Dispose/InnerDispose</summary><p></p><p>retained VM.Core SHA256 936763f6c8a1bf9fcf59f22acebca8feb09b5f3d5701ae77c82bdc81e626190d / MVID 290025bc-e040-4cd5-94dd-cd49b9af9c99; original bytes rehashed, no fresh member CIL capture in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f009b0ea8e6d43b3380c4a1cdaa9b0804a01f90360dab051f794e890e6fb41ed" href="../../证据/f009b0ea8e6d43b3380c4a1cdaa9b0804a01f90360dab051f794e890e6fb41ed.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f009b0ea8e6d</small></a></details><details><summary>VmModule.CommonDispose</summary><p></p><p>retained VM.Core SHA256 936763f6c8a1bf9fcf59f22acebca8feb09b5f3d5701ae77c82bdc81e626190d / MVID 290025bc-e040-4cd5-94dd-cd49b9af9c99; original bytes rehashed, no fresh member CIL capture in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="27d7f9566aa03e7395a14e95cda2e2d91c6332fc20d91a6d324c3302679ad650" href="../../证据/27d7f9566aa03e7395a14e95cda2e2d91c6332fc20d91a6d324c3302679ad650.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>27d7f9566aa0</small></a></details><details><summary>VmModuleSet.DeleteInnerModules</summary><p></p><p>retained VM.Core SHA256 936763f6c8a1bf9fcf59f22acebca8feb09b5f3d5701ae77c82bdc81e626190d / MVID 290025bc-e040-4cd5-94dd-cd49b9af9c99; original bytes rehashed, no fresh member CIL capture in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ae457c340a234692725b5712c0becb47139f29c711588cc0592cff30c8877cb2" href="../../证据/ae457c340a234692725b5712c0becb47139f29c711588cc0592cff30c8877cb2.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ae457c340a23</small></a></details><details><summary>IMVSGroup.CloseModuleInterface</summary><p></p><p>retained VM.Core SHA256 936763f6c8a1bf9fcf59f22acebca8feb09b5f3d5701ae77c82bdc81e626190d / MVID 290025bc-e040-4cd5-94dd-cd49b9af9c99; original bytes rehashed, no fresh member CIL capture in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b65b1b4772b019ac35a1483d89b7970df9c0261d972d135c1d30285554810966" href="../../证据/b65b1b4772b019ac35a1483d89b7970df9c0261d972d135c1d30285554810966.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b65b1b4772b0</small></a></details></details><details data-group-capability-relation="OG07"><summary>OG07 · DoWork正常退出的本次描述链表 → 退役临时节点与shared持有，结果最后读者仍未知</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>DoWork收尾把本次输出链表头复位，逐节点调用a77a0(节点+0xa8)与a03a0(节点+0x18)，operator delete节点，最后delete链表头。a77a0与a03a0对各shared控制块真实LOCK递减强计数，仅强归零调用虚槽0，再递减弱计数，弱归零调用虚槽+8；a77a0还清文本。节点及符合capacity条件的临时文本有直接delete证据，不能把局部shared撤销写成所有结果payload立即释放。</p><p>本次输出订阅描述、shared控制块、typed目标/源载荷、仍可被模块仓或消费者持有的结果分别退役。</p><p>本次列表清除只撤销列表持有；前轮累积结果与其它仓库缓存可能仍存。</p><p>节点/链表头直接delete已证；具体shared动态析构接收者和结果最后读者未在本专题定位，不冒全局无泄漏。</p><p>待核：typed结果载荷最终free、异常栈展开与并发最后读者未知；正常收尾不是所有异常必清理证明。</p><details><summary>1800a0930</summary><p></p><p>SHA256 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="75f8e47f35dc63ec56e84756956ee86d13a3fd16cc43fc3d869d2870181052ca" href="../../证据/75f8e47f35dc63ec56e84756956ee86d13a3fd16cc43fc3d869d2870181052ca.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>75f8e47f35dc</small></a></details><details><summary>1800a77a0</summary><p></p><p>SHA256 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="bd68d4d6a93f45c1b1ca2912b9a8190c910203d1bc2a79d672ccdc2d0af0feaf" href="../../证据/bd68d4d6a93f45c1b1ca2912b9a8190c910203d1bc2a79d672ccdc2d0af0feaf.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>bd68d4d6a93f</small></a></details><details><summary>1800a03a0</summary><p></p><p>SHA256 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="33cf62369a4f895f25e059b46bcd795670bd78ef0fa28c05c03af1f93cf4f860" href="../../证据/33cf62369a4f895f25e059b46bcd795670bd78ef0fa28c05c03af1f93cf4f860.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>33cf62369a4f</small></a></details><details><summary>1800a77a0</summary><p></p><p>SHA256 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d14caefb25811d640ab3c33d95a7f7966275c7cae0671aa2c843de3ee10a48b0" href="../../证据/d14caefb25811d640ab3c33d95a7f7966275c7cae0671aa2c843de3ee10a48b0.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d14caefb2581</small></a></details></details><p>待核：托管Dispose/CloseModuleInterface调用已补，但DeleteGroupModule的SDK/native接收体、child payload与结果最后读者仍缺，不能用正常描述链退役替代。</p></article><article data-group-capability-side="current"><h4>REA当前恢复 · owned Group</h4><p>independent-implementation</p><p>当前明确区分返回、关窗、结构删除与换方案；租约使root释放延后，不把UI导航当内存释放。</p><details data-group-capability-relation="GEC15"><summary>GEC15 · 窗口关闭、solution替换与宿主scope换代 → 配置窗停止关闭、清导航/结果引用、root scope关闭</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>ToolEditorHost.OnClosing先base，尚有tool/group配置会话且未closeReady时取消本次Close、Cancel activeRun，逐GroupWindow StopAndCloseAsync，再DisposeAsync工具debug会话，最后Clear并BeginInvoke(Close)。ReplaceExecutionScope先epoch.Invalidate/Detach，清配置/debug/session/results等仓，Cancel activeRun，再executionScope.Dispose，创建新scope并Attach。SolutionReplaced的画布回调ClearDisplayedWorkflows及视口缓存。返回上层只LeaveGroup；删节点通过统一Edit递归PruneOwnedGroups删结构，两者不同。</p><p>窗口会话、导航ID、运行session、root scope state是四种持有；同名Group不合并释放阶段。</p><p>先使旧execution owner失效，再清result/cache；迟到结果仍需owner gate，不由清字典推回调已排空。</p><p>scope.Dispose可能等活跃租约退出，具体IDisposable state释放/cleanup异常保留见GEC16；不是立即free全部像素。</p><p>待核：关闭流程取消/等待存在的完整race、所有配置window的异常收尾与scope state最后外部读者不由本静态矩阵证明。</p><details><summary>OnClosing group/tool debug cleanup</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ebdcab4ff1baf20deecca2c203de648035ae68a7f1c6b423ee18ba3bd31d1a5b" href="../../证据/ebdcab4ff1baf20deecca2c203de648035ae68a7f1c6b423ee18ba3bd31d1a5b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ebdcab4ff1ba</small></a></details><details><summary>ReplaceExecutionScope</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="059edbdec78959762068e303ec96ee8bd8b5949dbf1185a4cdc704bd690f8403" href="../../证据/059edbdec78959762068e303ec96ee8bd8b5949dbf1185a4cdc704bd690f8403.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>059edbdec789</small></a></details><details><summary>SolutionReplaced navigation/cache cleanup</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ad9d8285caf1ed1fe33e6d602f39e87350d9effb97dfbb7c9c1998feedc9f45e" href="../../证据/ad9d8285caf1ed1fe33e6d602f39e87350d9effb97dfbb7c9c1998feedc9f45e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ad9d8285caf1</small></a></details><details><summary>PruneOwnedGroups</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0ed94453292db8fc359fdb338f12cfb570e7e1af5260a4ca500dde46ed7299c7" href="../../证据/0ed94453292db8fc359fdb338f12cfb570e7e1af5260a4ca500dde46ed7299c7.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0ed94453292d</small></a></details></details><details data-group-capability-relation="GEC16"><summary>GEC16 · 每轮scope.Enter/ForProcedure与solution关闭 → 跨轮state/有效参数持有，closing后等租约再释放</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>GraphExecutor每次RunAsync using scope.Enter；body与父run沿用同root scope。模块context的Scope为ForProcedure(p.Id)借用view，State缓存键为(procedure,module,node)，因此同body多轮同键复用state而非每轮Dispose。RememberExecutionParameters在模块入口前对seed/applied逐JsonElement.Clone，覆写该键缓存。scope.Dispose对借用view无动作；root先closing=true并Cancel stopping，取消完成且leases==0才TryRelease，最后Exit也可触发。Release先快照distinct states+ownedServices，再清states/effectiveParameters/services/ownedServices，再逐IDisposable.Dispose，异常记录并保留failedResources。</p><p>运行租约、跨轮node state、参数JSON克隆缓存和结果session payload分别持有；非owned服务只从字典移除，不由Release列入dispose值。</p><p>结束一次Group只退出它的Graph租约，不自动关闭solution root或清node state；RemoveNode另按procedure键移除state与参数，并在锁外Dispose该state。</p><p>root释放是IDisposable路径，不await IAsyncDisposable-only state；清字典不证明外部引用消失，cleanup失败对象被failedResources继续持有。Lease.Interlocked.Exchange保证一次Exit。</p><p>待核：谁创建/最终Dispose宿主root scope需在具体solution lifecycle入口另追；本页不把局部Group结束等同应用关窗。</p><p>待核：当前源码的参数缓存不是native SDK SetParam已确认值；cleanup异常、外部state引用和具体图像原生资源由实现另证。</p><details><summary>ModuleExecutionScope.ForProcedure</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9af9ceff47aa44aa1272f50a0c6141d393421d9080eb4221f686ec047ef1f97d" href="../../证据/9af9ceff47aa44aa1272f50a0c6141d393421d9080eb4221f686ec047ef1f97d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9af9ceff47aa</small></a></details><details><summary>ModuleExecutionScope.State</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="6c184da6a57b1f218ca68b00c299b6e8a487c33579743524352128ab5f808079" href="../../证据/6c184da6a57b1f218ca68b00c299b6e8a487c33579743524352128ab5f808079.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>6c184da6a57b</small></a></details><details><summary>ModuleExecutionScope.Enter/RemoveNode</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2d2aa75a13a11f96d567a726c3dc19f09863614b03860b3192f988721cf584ad" href="../../证据/2d2aa75a13a11f96d567a726c3dc19f09863614b03860b3192f988721cf584ad.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2d2aa75a13a1</small></a></details><details><summary>ModuleExecutionScope.Dispose/Release</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="206c284184397f7482d9015dd87c058f439853706abb2c23bd10f797116460c1" href="../../证据/206c284184397f7482d9015dd87c058f439853706abb2c23bd10f797116460c1.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>206c28418439</small></a></details><details><summary>ModuleExecutionScope.RecordCleanupFailure</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="667d84c52f018741334ebe41c9094af0e41b74238b795cd1b7c240d6bab018be" href="../../证据/667d84c52f018741334ebe41c9094af0e41b74238b795cd1b7c240d6bab018be.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>667d84c52f01</small></a></details><details><summary>ModuleExecutionScope.RememberExecutionParameters</summary><p></p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f55a4239d8e741832eb40876a2a3c32072d77c28d481f5e8352b1a91663b4298" href="../../证据/f55a4239d8e741832eb40876a2a3c32072d77c28d481f5e8352b1a91663b4298.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f55a4239d8e7</small></a></details></details><p>待核：仅当前源码，不作GC时间、native图像最后释放或手工验收结论。</p></article><article data-group-capability-side="self"><h4>SunEyeVision_V2 · 自研Subroutine</h4><p>source-confirmed</p><p>设置控件卸载时解除事件订阅；根执行结束解除活动会话并Dispose取消源。返回结果和上下文中的图像/内部结果另有持有者，不能据此说已释放全部载荷。</p><p>SubroutineDebugControl.Unloaded调用ViewModel.Dispose，后者幂等取消Outputs.CollectionChanged与每个输出的PropertyChanged订阅。WorkflowExecutionEngine根入口finally在持有者仍是本会话时把_activeSession置null，再session.Dispose；WorkflowRunSession.Dispose体仅Dispose CancellationTokenSource。该对象同时有Scopes字典与RootContext，子结果被转发到RootContext；SubroutineResults还保有NodeOutputs/ResolvedOutputValues，GetDisplayImages返回同一IVisionImage对象。因此所选退出体不是全部图像/结果的统一析构。</p><p>SubroutineDebugControl.Unloaded → SubroutineParameterDialogViewModel.Dispose → 解除配置事件订阅</p><p>WorkflowExecutionEngine.ExecuteWorkflowAsync finally → _activeSession=null → WorkflowRunSession.Dispose</p><p>SubroutineResults字典 / RootContext / scopes.Context → 与取消源退役分开的对象持有者</p><details><summary>Unloaded removes editor event subscriptions</summary><p>SunEyeVision_V2</p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><p>采集来源：D:/MyWork/SunEyeVision_V2/tools/SunEyeVision.Tool.Subroutine/Views/SubroutineDebugControl.xaml.cs:36–36 · SHA256 5f356512fe720973711120886de7ae5c4ae1b2da63100fc1b2f01f6eb8a0a7fe</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="591ab17caf26d96eb89d7924a2c8a86e25fc4fa8a4a6e5fe9d2bfc8aa82c35fb" href="../../证据/591ab17caf26d96eb89d7924a2c8a86e25fc4fa8a4a6e5fe9d2bfc8aa82c35fb.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>591ab17caf26</small></a></details><details><summary>Editor ViewModel Dispose</summary><p>SunEyeVision_V2</p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><p>采集来源：D:/MyWork/SunEyeVision_V2/tools/SunEyeVision.Tool.Subroutine/ViewModels/SubroutineParameterDialogViewModel.cs:122–130 · SHA256 6377ffc87d505ff93ddde99de7fd224afdccae7f52c8faee31e45e517217c16e</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e66c2f97cb4f36a2167537179d91873c7cae8e424934594e737362a45343345f" href="../../证据/e66c2f97cb4f36a2167537179d91873c7cae8e424934594e737362a45343345f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e66c2f97cb4f</small></a></details><details><summary>Root active-session cleanup</summary><p>SunEyeVision_V2</p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><p>采集来源：D:/MyWork/SunEyeVision_V2/src/Workflow/WorkflowExecutionEngine.cs:1217–1221 · SHA256 4afdc12717c26f142cdc325d4ebac68a4d32f7cf31f1e5d137552c32419b07db</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="dbf8751b6e0d16904ad53e09634a0b52b29ee15e9fee1d035c3bbbc0bcbea6f7" href="../../证据/dbf8751b6e0d16904ad53e09634a0b52b29ee15e9fee1d035c3bbbc0bcbea6f7.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>dbf8751b6e0d</small></a></details><details><summary>Session dictionary and cancellation holder</summary><p>SunEyeVision_V2</p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><p>采集来源：D:/MyWork/SunEyeVision_V2/src/Workflow/WorkflowRunSession.cs:21–23 · SHA256 81a4538d84dd800b91f6380ffbb8bc8fee2b59d0284e5f1c2194a2c97f4587c0</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d70ba675a807d4e28eeee84d7be016ca8b9c7eaf6a5849f438e5d27a9d0e70a7" href="../../证据/d70ba675a807d4e28eeee84d7be016ca8b9c7eaf6a5849f438e5d27a9d0e70a7.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d70ba675a807</small></a></details><details><summary>RootContext result holder</summary><p>SunEyeVision_V2</p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><p>采集来源：D:/MyWork/SunEyeVision_V2/src/Workflow/WorkflowRunSession.cs:58–58 · SHA256 81a4538d84dd800b91f6380ffbb8bc8fee2b59d0284e5f1c2194a2c97f4587c0</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="81ba9aadfef8911dcc74ac306dfa3d37b9a26b1e7dd0f0ecb543b91177b97095" href="../../证据/81ba9aadfef8911dcc74ac306dfa3d37b9a26b1e7dd0f0ecb543b91177b97095.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>81ba9aadfef8</small></a></details><details><summary>Session Dispose only cancellation source</summary><p>SunEyeVision_V2</p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><p>采集来源：D:/MyWork/SunEyeVision_V2/src/Workflow/WorkflowRunSession.cs:146–146 · SHA256 81a4538d84dd800b91f6380ffbb8bc8fee2b59d0284e5f1c2194a2c97f4587c0</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="95555c75a0c5d1208a283003374a7cbeb8c9e4c7f602ebfce5363a156b640a5d" href="../../证据/95555c75a0c5d1208a283003374a7cbeb8c9e4c7f602ebfce5363a156b640a5d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>95555c75a0c5</small></a></details><details><summary>Per-scope context holder</summary><p>SunEyeVision_V2</p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><p>采集来源：D:/MyWork/SunEyeVision_V2/src/Workflow/WorkflowRunScope.cs:32–32 · SHA256 7af02a86b5d6b2e5ce7e8c5d0f6bfbdb4d3b1448ada6ef13831d571f4b5bc789</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="83e255af1617280fa84ea91bb93653dd7055f60d5ac2b75298e04b4a66fe23d0" href="../../证据/83e255af1617280fa84ea91bb93653dd7055f60d5ac2b75298e04b4a66fe23d0.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>83e255af1617</small></a></details><details><summary>Display image returns existing instance</summary><p>SunEyeVision_V2</p><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><p>采集来源：D:/MyWork/SunEyeVision_V2/src/Plugin.SDK/Execution/Results/SubroutineResults.cs:35–36 · SHA256 d47bfd82203b63b13fdb876ad78c5c0313b10c96c8490b6ab989bfae7cd757a9</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a3836171011df4fbbe928bf395b27b905d7bcddc26fc028e4ea133632203dc07" href="../../证据/a3836171011df4fbbe928bf395b27b905d7bcddc26fc028e4ea133632203dc07.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a3836171011d</small></a></details><p>待核：未追完子程序节点删除、方案切换/关闭、历史结果容器、图像适配器Dispose与最后读者；本行不做最后引用/GC/原生像素释放断言。</p><p>待核：这次只读静态源码，没有运行设置窗口关闭、根会话停止或真实图像对象释放测试。</p></article></div></details><p>范围边界：八行是完整能力调查范围，不表示每一格已经全部恢复；每侧保留具体未知目标。</p><p>范围边界：原版关系沿正式record逐条保留，当前owner/ID/JSON/租约设计明确为独立实现，不建立对象或native布局一一对应。</p><p>范围边界：运行模式仍待分析；本切片未新增native检索、原版/SDK/设备/WPF执行。</p><p>范围边界：{&quot;row&quot;:&quot;create&quot;,&quot;question&quot;:&quot;这段创建体未建立与REA GroupOwner相同的独占所有权合同；跨父节点复用/递归环/删除子工作流的全部门未在本切片追完。&quot;}</p><p>范围边界：{&quot;row&quot;:&quot;create&quot;,&quot;question&quot;:&quot;SyncWorkflowToSolution更深持久化调用者与实际主机状态未运行验证。&quot;}</p><p>范围边界：{&quot;row&quot;:&quot;enter-return&quot;,&quot;question&quot;:&quot;导航状态与执行调用栈是不同数据；未运行双击、返回、焦点/缩放恢复或多层宿主验收。&quot;}</p><p>范围边界：{&quot;row&quot;:&quot;enter-return&quot;,&quot;question&quot;:&quot;NodeOpenDecisionChain之前的完整鼠标路由及所有返回按钮模板不在本有限源码切片内。&quot;}</p><p>范围边界：{&quot;row&quot;:&quot;interfaces&quot;,&quot;question&quot;:&quot;这些字典赋值没有深复制图像/任意对象；不能从新建字典推导像素所有权已转移。ParameterResolver和IVisionImage实现内的克隆/租约需另追。&quot;}</p><p>范围边界：{&quot;row&quot;:&quot;interfaces&quot;,&quot;question&quot;:&quot;SDK对象类型、FieldId与当前REA PortValue/WorkflowInterfaceItem不是相同二进制或序列化合同，不声明自动兼容。&quot;}</p><p>范围边界：{&quot;row&quot;:&quot;internal-edit&quot;,&quot;question&quot;:&quot;这里证到配置编辑与通知调用，没有执行UI，也未沿ApplySubroutineOutputChange逐个核显示树/图像下拉消费者。&quot;}</p><p>范围边界：{&quot;row&quot;:&quot;internal-edit&quot;,&quot;question&quot;:&quot;撤销、取消窗口是否恢复编辑前值及全部画布编辑命令未穷举；不得用“参数框存在”冒称这些行为已实现或已验收。&quot;}</p><p>范围边界：{&quot;row&quot;:&quot;call-nesting&quot;,&quot;question&quot;:&quot;只证普通嵌套调用合同与共享取消来源；最大深度、递归环、并行嵌套及所有取消/错误传播尚未完整追踪或运行。&quot;}</p><p>范围边界：{&quot;row&quot;:&quot;call-nesting&quot;,&quot;question&quot;:&quot;ctx字典复制不复制其中IVisionImage/任意对象；不据此声称每层图像深复制或独占所有权。&quot;}</p><p>范围边界：{&quot;row&quot;:&quot;loop-break&quot;,&quot;question&quot;:&quot;仅确认CurrentIteration属性赋值，未证它像REA GroupLoopIndex一样成为内部节点可绑定来源；不要把两个名称视为同一合同。&quot;}</p><p>范围边界：{&quot;row&quot;:&quot;loop-break&quot;,&quot;question&quot;:&quot;ExecutionResult默认Success=false，Merge使用Success &amp;&amp; other.Success；Run最终又按Success与Errors组合分支判状态。完整循环成功/零轮/取消状态的主机效果未运行，不能仅按方法名或注释推定。&quot;}</p><p>范围边界：{&quot;row&quot;:&quot;loop-break&quot;,&quot;question&quot;:&quot;循环间Task.Delay未在所选行传取消令牌；工具入口和下层执行是否及时响应取消需分段验证。&quot;}</p><p>范围边界：{&quot;row&quot;:&quot;copy-save&quot;,&quot;question&quot;:&quot;Snapshot.Copy只保留SubroutineId不等于“复制子程序节点后独立克隆整个子流程”。未追到剪贴板/粘贴入口与递归ID、绑定路径重映射验收；此能力保持未知。&quot;}</p><p>范围边界：{&quot;row&quot;:&quot;copy-save&quot;,&quot;question&quot;:&quot;参数多态序列化、全部运行态排除项、历史Undo/Redo和资源文件迁移未穷举；未做保存重开运行验证。&quot;}</p><p>范围边界：{&quot;row&quot;:&quot;exit-retire&quot;,&quot;question&quot;:&quot;未追完子程序节点删除、方案切换/关闭、历史结果容器、图像适配器Dispose与最后读者；本行不做最后引用/GC/原生像素释放断言。&quot;}</p><p>范围边界：{&quot;row&quot;:&quot;exit-retire&quot;,&quot;question&quot;:&quot;这次只读静态源码，没有运行设置窗口关闭、根会话停止或真实图像对象释放测试。&quot;}</p></section><article><h4>进来的是一份配置，还是每轮重新读取？</h4><p>当前SolutionExecutor先复制方案和节点参数；父节点解析输入后，多轮复用本次调用的输入值。每轮建立新的GraphExecutor和WorkflowRunContext，scope里的跨轮状态另有自己的持有关系。</p></article><article><h4>前一轮、累积结果和最后一轮是三份不同的视图</h4><p>当前last只指最后一次执行返回的session；累积仓收集成功轮的PortValue引用。Finish新建汇总容器，里面的值、图像是否复制，要按具体工厂和类型判断。</p></article><article><h4>中断、失败、取消要分开看</h4><p>当前break在执行本轮之前判断；失败轮已执行并计入completed，但不加入成功累积。取消可能在轮前或间隔抛出，绕过通常的Group汇总返回，不能统一当成“已清理并发布最后结果”。</p></article><article><h4>模块结束后，结果仍可能持有数据</h4><p>当前普通模块在GraphExecutor的finally退役；返回的session、Group累积、scope状态和显示投影分别保留引用。Dispose模块不是已经释放全部图像或最后读者的证明。</p></article><h4>五步看清：进来什么 → 轮前读什么 → 本轮执行 → 保留什么 → 谁退出</h4><div class="dd-table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>阶段</th><th>原版已恢复片段</th><th>当前独立实现</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr data-group-stage="prepare"><th>准备：确认Group属于谁，冻结本次参数</th><td><p>循环前准备一次输入与本次输出描述；值复制合同按具体helper保留边界。</p><a href="group-data-pipeline.html#OG01">OG01</a></td><td><p>独占body身份、solution结构/JSON快照、父输入解析与break外部操作数捕获；容器复制和payload共享分别说明。</p><a href="group-data-pipeline.html#CG01">CG01</a> / <a href="group-data-pipeline.html#CG02">CG02</a> / <a href="group-data-pipeline.html#CG04">CG04</a></td></tr><tr data-group-stage="round"><th>轮次：先判断是否中断，再执行本轮</th><td><p>Start/End/LoopIndex写第0项，break门先于执行。</p><a href="group-data-pipeline.html#OG02">OG02</a> / <a href="group-data-pipeline.html#OG03">OG03</a></td><td><p>索引/范围/间隔与独立资源门；内部比较读前轮，self读累计片段；输入值在本次Group调用内复用。</p><a href="group-data-pipeline.html#CG03">CG03</a> / <a href="group-data-pipeline.html#CG05">CG05</a></td></tr><tr data-group-stage="execute"><th>执行：每轮新上下文，失败按分支传回</th><td><p>只连已核虚调用和输出处理实参，不能补成完整子调度器。</p><a href="group-data-pipeline.html#OG04">OG04</a> / <a href="group-data-pipeline.html#OG06">OG06</a></td><td><p>本轮records/变量和输入容器独立，PortValue引用传递；非Success、取消和超时分别按实际门控。</p><a href="group-data-pipeline.html#CG06">CG06</a> / <a href="group-data-pipeline.html#CG09">CG09</a></td></tr><tr data-group-stage="retain"><th>保留：成功轮累积，图像显示按条件替换</th><td><p>类型分派、前置虚槽与按索引追加分开；图像及全部数组保留未知。</p><a href="group-data-pipeline.html#OG04">OG04</a> / <a href="group-data-pipeline.html#OG05">OG05</a> / <a href="group-data-pipeline.html#OG06">OG06</a></td><td><p>先留PortValue片段，结束JoinArray才复制数组；GrayImage列表替换仅移引用，非像素free。</p><a href="group-data-pipeline.html#CG07">CG07</a> / <a href="group-data-pipeline.html#CG08">CG08</a></td></tr><tr data-group-stage="retire"><th>退役：模块结束、租约退出、solution关闭分开</th><td><p>节点delete与shared条件退役已见，结果最后读者未闭合。</p><a href="group-data-pipeline.html#OG07">OG07</a></td><td><p>module.Dispose不清session；Group结束退出本轮租约，root scope关闭后等全部租约再清state并Dispose。</p><a href="group-data-pipeline.html#CG09">CG09</a> / <a href="group-data-pipeline.html#CG10">CG10</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div><details open data-group-runtime><summary>当前合成流程实测：先看每轮与最后保留什么</summary><p>使用真实SolutionExecutor运行合成模块；这是框架数据行为观察，未运行原版或实际工具算法。逐场景展开实际结果，原版语义另看下方证据。</p><div class="dd-table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>当前合成场景</th><th>实际执行与中断</th><th>子Group保留的数据</th><th>父调用看到什么</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr data-group-summary="two-success-then-break"><th>两轮成功后在下一轮前中断</th><td>执行索引 [0,1]；完成计数 2；中断索引 2</td><td>累计Trail=[0,1]；替换Latest=1；GrayImage显示项数=1<p>Group self output element is unavailable.</p></td><td>子Group=Success；父节点=Success / 无错误</td></tr><tr data-group-summary="second-iteration-fails"><th>第二轮失败并保留此前累积</th><td>执行索引 [0,1]；完成计数 2；中断索引 无</td><td>累计Trail=[0]；替换Latest=缺失；GrayImage显示项数=1<p></p></td><td>子Group=Failed；父节点=Failed / SubprogramFailed</td></tr><tr data-group-summary="zero-range"><th>零轮与父调用必需输出校验</th><td>执行索引 []；完成计数 0；中断索引 无</td><td>累计Trail=[]；替换Latest=缺失；GrayImage显示项数=0<p></p></td><td>子Group=Success；父节点=Failed / InvalidOutput</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>主例第一轮后self[1]尚不存在，当前实现留下诊断并继续；第二轮后索引1已有值，返回的中断位置才是2。表中的中断位置是实际返回元数据，没有把第三轮工具画成已执行。</p><details data-group-scenario="two-success-then-break"><summary>两轮成功后在下一轮前中断</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="eb117e2bfeedbbb8e4662fdb41613a4953670473f898754173393b6645aa5f1b" href="../../证据/eb117e2bfeedbbb8e4662fdb41613a4953670473f898754173393b6645aa5f1b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>eb117e2bfeed</small></a></details><details data-group-scenario="second-iteration-fails"><summary>第二轮失败并保留此前累积</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="7925044195ba6ac120d90aeb2eff41226c13092f2713057546ddbead2a7bd3a0" href="../../证据/7925044195ba6ac120d90aeb2eff41226c13092f2713057546ddbead2a7bd3a0.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>7925044195ba</small></a></details><details data-group-scenario="zero-range"><summary>零轮与父调用必需输出校验</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ea5c6800600169bc6a395cd8a1258b17324598aa07dbfc58243a727d8e297467" href="../../证据/ea5c6800600169bc6a395cd8a1258b17324598aa07dbfc58243a727d8e297467.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ea5c68006001</small></a></details><details data-group-probe-case><summary>Real GraphExecutor finally disposes every created synthetic module</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9647560981bf63e09bc4a2e13ed52fa1777b3970ffbb8537af47eb9f7a6ee342" href="../../证据/9647560981bf63e09bc4a2e13ed52fa1777b3970ffbb8537af47eb9f7a6ee342.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9647560981bf</small></a></details><details data-group-probe-case><summary>CompletedGroupIterations counts attempted completed child sessions</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c07a6348154452506571452dd399b787c837994c85c1563cf902e48b992cd7e4" href="../../证据/c07a6348154452506571452dd399b787c837994c85c1563cf902e48b992cd7e4.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c07a63481544</small></a></details><details data-group-probe-case><summary>Two successes, then a break recorded at index2 without executing a third worker</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="8909f0966fddcb56d8b6e87fdb87ec59d03885a37725b6bc77cba069ed2748b1" href="../../证据/8909f0966fddcb56d8b6e87fdb87ec59d03885a37725b6bc77cba069ed2748b1.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>8909f0966fdd</small></a></details><details data-group-probe-case><summary>Private Group index is forwarded as ordinary helper input; last Group session index stays1</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="742e019fb8e590a6c6fec0fe374042b9a5e2d4ef7cfde5879278fd64a829816d" href="../../证据/742e019fb8e590a6c6fec0fe374042b9a5e2d4ef7cfde5879278fd64a829816d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>742e019fb8e5</small></a></details><details data-group-probe-case><summary>Published dictionary changed after parent recording; both iterations retain the original scalar inputs</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2e2f8c93bb573e1a5631753050fb2846079f269e35a6f3d917eae79f54576da9" href="../../证据/2e2f8c93bb573e1a5631753050fb2846079f269e35a6f3d917eae79f54576da9.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2e2f8c93bb57</small></a></details><details data-group-probe-case><summary>Container snapshots preserve original PortValue/string/image references across both call layers</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c0d4a2faf6c303b26fb6500544de8c707426ab58336d92ce0ba981dad886288f" href="../../证据/c0d4a2faf6c303b26fb6500544de8c707426ab58336d92ce0ba981dad886288f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c0d4a2faf6c3</small></a></details><details data-group-probe-case><summary>Accumulated integer output joins both rounds; replacement output comes from the last round</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4d39c5489625dfb585040ac1bbfe2d179e0a1ba2ed018f7a0dfcd298855157d8" href="../../证据/4d39c5489625dfb585040ac1bbfe2d179e0a1ba2ed018f7a0dfcd298855157d8.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4d39c5489625</small></a></details><details data-group-probe-case><summary>Accumulated text creates an array while preserving each echoed string object</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c4dba0e8af10e71ad8f62dd70663e55d5a5da31c0898292755fb38a81eaa90d4" href="../../证据/c4dba0e8af10e71ad8f62dd70663e55d5a5da31c0898292755fb38a81eaa90d4.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c4dba0e8af10</small></a></details><details data-group-probe-case><summary>GrayImage Accumulate metadata retains only the latest image in output and display</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f202812fd682c5afe39e5cd92b5752dabeb7fa6b1b38ab131f772c69dc2bbcab" href="../../证据/f202812fd682c5afe39e5cd92b5752dabeb7fa6b1b38ab131f772c69dc2bbcab.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f202812fd682</small></a></details><details data-group-probe-case><summary>Primitive displays accumulate or replace independently, and the last scalar keeps its original PortValue</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="eca38fd2b0de9ab11945421e736fac34d90795a26ae21cc14f8e8e3ca0e28eac" href="../../证据/eca38fd2b0de9ab11945421e736fac34d90795a26ae21cc14f8e8e3ca0e28eac.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>eca38fd2b0de</small></a></details><details data-group-probe-case><summary>Returned Nodes/Calls belong to the last completed iteration, while joined outputs retain earlier values</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="719832f91349901e8d6a86dd773a443e49443da58a50c27d2296d9ddbf5a9063" href="../../证据/719832f91349901e8d6a86dd773a443e49443da58a50c27d2296d9ddbf5a9063.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>719832f91349</small></a></details><details data-group-probe-case><summary>Synthetic module private fields are cleared by Dispose; returned result references remain readable</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="5a0919e35495620ffdbafd03fa856a59f502f316f9e6b8108080d36f535e9ff6" href="../../证据/5a0919e35495620ffdbafd03fa856a59f502f316f9e6b8108080d36f535e9ff6.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>5a0919e35495</small></a></details><details data-group-probe-case><summary>Real GraphExecutor finally disposes every created synthetic module</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9647560981bf63e09bc4a2e13ed52fa1777b3970ffbb8537af47eb9f7a6ee342" href="../../证据/9647560981bf63e09bc4a2e13ed52fa1777b3970ffbb8537af47eb9f7a6ee342.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9647560981bf</small></a></details><details data-group-probe-case><summary>CompletedGroupIterations counts attempted completed child sessions</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c07a6348154452506571452dd399b787c837994c85c1563cf902e48b992cd7e4" href="../../证据/c07a6348154452506571452dd399b787c837994c85c1563cf902e48b992cd7e4.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c07a63481544</small></a></details><details data-group-probe-case><summary>Failed second child session is the last session; attempted count includes that failure</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="527717d1023f071a2650c1e843bb11389b1c8c2b25059bcde8b1dcbfa00ee095" href="../../证据/527717d1023f071a2650c1e843bb11389b1c8c2b25059bcde8b1dcbfa00ee095.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>527717d1023f</small></a></details><details data-group-probe-case><summary>Accumulator retains only the first successful round when the last session fails</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b8995c04bad6b15dc012c4e6f8219d1eef28f4bf822d5299baaf74f837ce2ea4" href="../../证据/b8995c04bad6b15dc012c4e6f8219d1eef28f4bf822d5299baaf74f837ce2ea4.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b8995c04bad6</small></a></details><details data-group-probe-case><summary>Failed Group output is filtered at its caller while the failed child Calls tree remains available</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b781a08fa2f552b53334f8caef448e73cf6238a1d4d3ea5c54c51177b059c773" href="../../证据/b781a08fa2f552b53334f8caef448e73cf6238a1d4d3ea5c54c51177b059c773.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b781a08fa2f5</small></a></details><details data-group-probe-case><summary>Real GraphExecutor finally disposes every created synthetic module</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="1cb578e0f38904e95efa09af9a350bf97d65902a54f320c3b07e3883b41eebed" href="../../证据/1cb578e0f38904e95efa09af9a350bf97d65902a54f320c3b07e3883b41eebed.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>1cb578e0f389</small></a></details><details data-group-probe-case><summary>CompletedGroupIterations counts attempted completed child sessions</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c320dfec02507e89f4280f3118c0957a0990fb467ff22f5fde248f7fa1dd9b62" href="../../证据/c320dfec02507e89f4280f3118c0957a0990fb467ff22f5fde248f7fa1dd9b62.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c320dfec0250</small></a></details><details data-group-probe-case><summary>Zero range creates no body/helper session or worker</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="8bc3304c08e510b3292ce6cd397e7e26bdbd62664ae927bdd9325ca9f5afea9b" href="../../证据/8bc3304c08e510b3292ce6cd397e7e26bdbd62664ae927bdd9325ca9f5afea9b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>8bc3304c08e5</small></a></details><details data-group-probe-case><summary>Empty accumulated arrays exist but required replacement outputs are absent, so the parent node fails validation</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="49e4730b4384713e2137561fff64e3650f5771e283ab4ae9262e753d0447c097" href="../../证据/49e4730b4384713e2137561fff64e3650f5771e283ab4ae9262e753d0447c097.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>49e4730b4384</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">Three synthetic scenarios execute the real current SolutionExecutor/GraphExecutor/GroupBreak/GroupOutputAccumulator and normal helper calls; no vendor/native runtime, real tool algorithm, WPF, device or numerical parity test.</p><p class="dd-gap">Synthetic Parent/Worker implement only data production, identity forwarding, intentional failure and observed IDisposable callbacks. They do not replace the Group/graph implementation.</p><p class="dd-gap">Tracker deliberately retains source PortValues, emitted frames and input references to compare identity; readability after module Dispose is not a measurement of last-owner release, GC, native memory, caches outside this runner or memory peaks.</p><p class="dd-gap">The returned last-session tree is observed. No unavailable prior session tree or unexecuted third iteration is synthesized.</p><p class="dd-gap">The finite zero-range required-output failure is this current configuration's real result; it is not a claim about all Group zero-range configurations or original-program parity.</p><p class="dd-gap">Compiler PDB checksums bind every compiled source document to current files, but do not establish original-program equivalence.</p><details><summary>本批实际程序集、PDB与编译源码身份</summary><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="49994c232041608095404016402c8e9ddc47c98a48e8903bdda00ed2368e2ad2" href="../../证据/49994c232041608095404016402c8e9ddc47c98a48e8903bdda00ed2368e2ad2.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>49994c232041</small></a></details></details><div class="dd-stage-columns"><article><h4>原版：循环、订阅、输出与原生缓冲</h4><details data-evidence-fact="OG01" id="OG01"><summary>OG01 · 原DoWork进入循环前 → 一次准备输入与输出描述列表</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>DoWork先调用a4a00，再调用a74c0(this,this+0x180,&amp;本次输出列表)，二者位于逐轮循环之前。a4a00构造原字符串input并交a4a90(this,this+0x170,input)；后者按类型分派输入准备helper。a74c0逐个读取配置描述，向12e200传递上下文、类型与名称，只有其返回0才复制名称/模式到临时描述并把描述加入本次列表，失败分支记录日志后继续其它条目。输入配置、临时输出描述和每轮结果不是同一对象。</p><p><strong>具体类型、持有与复制：</strong>this+0x170输入描述容器、this+0x180输出配置容器、DoWork局部链表分别持有；12e200真实第5参数是目标描述指针，a74c0汇编在栈+0x20设置，不能照四参伪码漏掉它。</p><p><strong>跨轮缓存与失效：</strong>所选正常路径显示输入/输出描述在循环前准备一次；不能由此声称每轮所有输入值深快照或冻结。</p><p><strong>退出与释放边界：</strong>a74c0每轮配置准备末尾清临时描述，DoWork退出另退役本次列表；具体共享载荷见OG07边界。</p><details><summary>1800a0930</summary><p>SHA256 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="5bcc7322b7d7b4fa0176bdceb6c3665df6c739e1fb7e5a1c66a164bab1a2ed94" href="../../证据/5bcc7322b7d7b4fa0176bdceb6c3665df6c739e1fb7e5a1c66a164bab1a2ed94.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>5bcc7322b7d7</small></a></details><details><summary>1800a0930</summary><p>SHA256 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4d0f8a9b7eb9b992671812df2c6db17539cbc21f15eef4bb9881c15733dc5909" href="../../证据/4d0f8a9b7eb9b992671812df2c6db17539cbc21f15eef4bb9881c15733dc5909.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4d0f8a9b7eb9</small></a></details><details><summary>1800a4a00</summary><p>SHA256 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d7a5047fa729c7267e02861d56f3a9ace7eb6357e75f24f47a5148c84c9ce500" href="../../证据/d7a5047fa729c7267e02861d56f3a9ace7eb6357e75f24f47a5148c84c9ce500.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d7a5047fa729</small></a></details><details><summary>1800a4a90</summary><p>SHA256 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e55cd72f64caeb678beaa2e7de6c571190def4c1977a1de717ee9cba4cf2cf4c" href="../../证据/e55cd72f64caeb678beaa2e7de6c571190def4c1977a1de717ee9cba4cf2cf4c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e55cd72f64ca</small></a></details><details><summary>1800a74c0</summary><p>SHA256 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e01641114be014cf49d3a1a5a9b176ca54a7de4d76ab3a7fbd6e54e8edd31a16" href="../../证据/e01641114be014cf49d3a1a5a9b176ca54a7de4d76ab3a7fbd6e54e8edd31a16.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e01641114be0</small></a></details><details><summary>1800a74c0</summary><p>SHA256 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="76f8a9f90bf7c4d743f884b1218c14741b6ff6b4df1c1026c7e722c02ab62de3" href="../../证据/76f8a9f90bf7c4d743f884b1218c14741b6ff6b4df1c1026c7e722c02ab62de3.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>76f8a9f90bf7</small></a></details><details><summary>18012e200</summary><p>SHA256 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b1e4a59a6266abbfa6537f23625ba47906d4fe332a5e9307c39177e8d8a6e06c" href="../../证据/b1e4a59a6266abbfa6537f23625ba47906d4fe332a5e9307c39177e8d8a6e06c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b1e4a59a6266</small></a></details><details><summary>Original PE selected data strings</summary><p>SHA256 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="509a294aed2e9245b36110f851cda4ce44ec1710a05f6234e5b418adf1f3fd91" href="../../证据/509a294aed2e9245b36110f851cda4ce44ec1710a05f6234e5b418adf1f3fd91.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>509a294aed2e</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">待核：输入typed准备helper10450/10ab0/117a0等未在本切片逐体恢复，输入数据复制/共享不以方法名推定。</p><p class="dd-gap">待核：12e200交12dcb0建立typed目标的具体动态绑定尚未补体；第5参数已核，但不把其载荷与其它专题的活实例直接合并。</p></details><details data-evidence-fact="OG02" id="OG02"><summary>OG02 · DoWork每轮开始 → StartIndex/EndIndex/LoopIndex的第0项写入与严格上界</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>正常DoWork以开始字段+0x21c初始化本轮索引，先作有符号index&lt;end(+0x220)门；每轮写this+0x224，再用RCX=this、EDX=start、R8D=end、R9D=index调用a7190。该体从原PE字符串确认StartIndex/EndIndex/LoopIndex，按当前Group模块键取int共享对象，对三个名字分别调用f3ee0(target,0,value)。f3ee0准备对象后，已有第0项时覆盖该4字节，否则增加一项。轮尾32位ADD后再次有符号JL到循环体，不能把这个静态分支扩成数学整数或溢出安全循环。</p><p><strong>具体类型、持有与复制：</strong>三个输出是Group键下的独立具名int值；内部索引字段与对外LoopIndex数据不是同一个变量存储位置。</p><p><strong>跨轮缓存与失效：</strong>值对象可重复查得并覆写第0项；本体不每轮清除整个模块结果仓。</p><p><strong>退出与释放边界：</strong>a7190释放局部shared持有和临时字符串；覆盖第0项不证明旧结果消费者已释放。</p><details><summary>1800a0930</summary><p>SHA256 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="6440f459f7dfef6c9fa31a03d8ee506d71f7505f642a3214e140ad94145c08f6" href="../../证据/6440f459f7dfef6c9fa31a03d8ee506d71f7505f642a3214e140ad94145c08f6.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>6440f459f7df</small></a></details><details><summary>1800a0930</summary><p>SHA256 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="8a7e152402050936bb2dd1da5cb0e939ecd3ff780c5b34221ad2a10cc22354e9" href="../../证据/8a7e152402050936bb2dd1da5cb0e939ecd3ff780c5b34221ad2a10cc22354e9.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>8a7e15240205</small></a></details><details><summary>1800a0930</summary><p>SHA256 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="37271664e38fb4d2ef533a5b65553042e3607cabac84f6350e23877a21a9c1d3" href="../../证据/37271664e38fb4d2ef533a5b65553042e3607cabac84f6350e23877a21a9c1d3.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>37271664e38f</small></a></details><details><summary>1800a7190</summary><p>SHA256 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="871e81b93aefc2e28d640a8e5152b12d4b838943dc2ec88a59d1b6fdb2729f5b" href="../../证据/871e81b93aefc2e28d640a8e5152b12d4b838943dc2ec88a59d1b6fdb2729f5b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>871e81b93aef</small></a></details><details><summary>1800f3ee0</summary><p>SHA256 45c57bc46f72fd