ce-confirmed</p><p>通过break门后DoWork调用局部执行对象的虚表+8；随后不把相邻指令解释为未知线程池合同，而是保存实际关系：RCX=this、RDX=&amp;本次输出列表、R8=&amp;本轮状态字传入a7830，返回EAX被保存并检查。a7830逐描述按type分派：int/float/string仅mode字段==1时先调用相应目标虚表+8，再调用13450/139f0/13fa0；image及其它所见类型有无条件先调用+8的独立分支。不能把这些类型都画成相同的累积策略。</p><p><strong>具体类型、持有与复制：</strong>输出描述持typed目标、来源状态和模式；执行对象虚调用、输出目标虚调用、typed复制helper是三种不同边。</p><p><strong>跨轮缓存与失效：</strong>mode!=1的三种标量描述不经此处+8前置调用；本轮输出可能保留前轮结果，细节由各typed helper决定。</p><p><strong>退出与释放边界：</strong>本体仅证明虚槽调用条件；12dcb0动态绑定未闭合，不能直接把Group这里+8同一实例等同于VP专题已定位的逻辑清空对象。</p><details><summary>1800a0930</summary><p>SHA256 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="90120cb27f00ecd76068f70c31bba9865fa4fec7e8c6894610674996992d0487" href="../../证据/90120cb27f00ecd76068f70c31bba9865fa4fec7e8c6894610674996992d0487.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>90120cb27f00</small></a></details><details><summary>1800a0930</summary><p>SHA256 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="fe3de2232fa9a2c42fab8d0c86edd410682db6da0ea000b4a62fe8d1019d22ef" href="../../证据/fe3de2232fa9a2c42fab8d0c86edd410682db6da0ea000b4a62fe8d1019d22ef.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>fe3de2232fa9</small></a></details><details><summary>1800a7830</summary><p>SHA256 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="cadf150c97b6f65e72f10471bc2c884f8cc32fa9d754910197c32dc29bbe4ba2" href="../../证据/cadf150c97b6f65e72f10471bc2c884f8cc32fa9d754910197c32dc29bbe4ba2.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>cadf150c97b6</small></a></details><details><summary>1800a7830</summary><p>SHA256 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b0a0a0dfbab09bedcadc087f0d6f7b9dcd51092a5d6ff75b4ffd0df3172da295" href="../../证据/b0a0a0dfbab09bedcadc087f0d6f7b9dcd51092a5d6ff75b4ffd0df3172da295.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b0a0a0dfbab0</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">待核：虚执行对象的具体调度与全部子节点状态传播未在本切片恢复。</p><p class="dd-gap">待核：图像/复合类型累积、载荷租约与虚槽接收者需分别恢复，不从int路径外推。</p></details><details data-evidence-fact="OG05" id="OG05"><summary>OG05 · 三类标量输出helper的正常来源分支 → 按索引读取一个值，追加进目标；文本另有复制</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>13450/139f0/13fa0先检查目标typed指针。来源分类字段+0x98为1或2时使用描述中的字面值；为3时验证来源typed对象，再处理选择模式。普通索引分支先调用132e0取得索引，检查来源payload/count，从int/float各4字节元素或string指针数组取一个值，分别交fc50/fd30/100f0追加目标。string先经006470形成临时文本，再复制交100f0；不是把来源指针数组直接作为目标结果。模式+0x170==1另交fcb0/fe00/101a0处理，不能与单元素分支混称已证完整数组拷贝。</p><p><strong>具体类型、持有与复制：</strong>int来源payload+0x68/count和+0x70/base，float为+0x40/+0x48；string为+0x30/count和+0x38/指针表。目标对象指针位于描述+0x28/+0x38/+0x48；汇编明确float值走XMM1、目标走RCX，string目标走RCX、临时文本地址走RDX，不能按整数寄存器签名吞掉浮点参数。</p><p><strong>跨轮缓存与失效：</strong>目标追加与mode==1前置虚槽共同决定保留/替换，源值按所见分支读取，不能泛称全数组深快照。</p><p><strong>退出与释放边界：</strong>临时string的堆块在对应路径delete；来源shared对象、目标结果与调用临时文本的释放责任分开。</p><details><summary>180013450</summary><p>SHA256 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="1899776b797a2b4485f502f241dd7ba8213800ef563dbb23fb288ec0e51c23e2" href="../../证据/1899776b797a2b4485f502f241dd7ba8213800ef563dbb23fb288ec0e51c23e2.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>1899776b797a</small></a></details><details><summary>180013450</summary><p>SHA256 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="6fb107001ffe852030869a7c18b07d6571a48324b7a3a7fa4686d67cbc8b825b" href="../../证据/6fb107001ffe852030869a7c18b07d6571a48324b7a3a7fa4686d67cbc8b825b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>6fb107001ffe</small></a></details><details><summary>1800139f0</summary><p>SHA256 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ccb7156e146c97f26a3e769f7264bb4158e83d101718ab928b0566ffc40f10cf" href="../../证据/ccb7156e146c97f26a3e769f7264bb4158e83d101718ab928b0566ffc40f10cf.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ccb7156e146c</small></a></details><details><summary>180013fa0</summary><p>SHA256 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b8b4e35a9f0d4383639f3e8ec850114576db0147afb5aa2f7c429d114485bd87" href="../../证据/b8b4e35a9f0d4383639f3e8ec850114576db0147afb5aa2f7c429d114485bd87.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b8b4e35a9f0d</small></a></details><details><summary>1800139f0</summary><p>SHA256 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="82a345a4bd4025efc29db6690f1d6cd4b44282b98f442daefcfe94efd38db65b" href="../../证据/82a345a4bd4025efc29db6690f1d6cd4b44282b98f442daefcfe94efd38db65b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>82a345a4bd40</small></a></details><details><summary>180013fa0</summary><p>SHA256 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="227c1d9a1b9948f926197ec614358b1fa9843b266445bd6a04eae4ce4980e9f5" href="../../证据/227c1d9a1b9948f926197ec614358b1fa9843b266445bd6a04eae4ce4980e9f5.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>227c1d9a1b99</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">待核：132e0完整索引表达式求值、全数组helper与目标append的底层分配/最后读者未在Group专题闭合。</p><p class="dd-gap">待核：空来源、越界、不同失败后的先前累积值与原厂运行结果未做差分。</p></details><details data-evidence-fact="OG06" id="OG06"><summary>OG06 · 输出处理失败与DoWork收尾 → 分开保存处理错误码、状态码和ModuStatus布尔值</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>a7830继续遍历描述；在尚未捕获错误时，来源状态分类为3且来源记录存在、其工作状态不在0x75掩码允许集合时，复制该来源错误码与工作状态到本次错误/状态输出。汇编最终MOV EAX,R13D返回累计错误。DoWork收尾以其最终错误寄存器是否0写ModuStatus(index0)，把错误码写this+0x7c、另一个状态码写this+0x84，清this+0x1b8执行中标记，并另发布ModuRunTime。成功布尔、错误码与状态枚举不是一个字段。</p><p><strong>具体类型、持有与复制：</strong>本次局部错误、本次局部状态、this工作字段及模块输出值分开；返回0不构成所有来源/消费者都成功的证明。</p><p><strong>跨轮缓存与失效：</strong>失败体未见统一回滚前面已追加输出，不能以最终ModuStatus=false画成累积数据全部撤销。</p><p><strong>退出与释放边界：</strong>收尾状态写入不等于结果仓销毁；本次描述节点退役见OG07。</p><details><summary>1800a7830</summary><p>SHA256 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="68b7a76fd18683aa9ab466e4230770588611a9af65b148fb6bcf7ed88e83bcfc" href="../../证据/68b7a76fd18683aa9ab466e4230770588611a9af65b148fb6bcf7ed88e83bcfc.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>68b7a76fd186</small></a></details><details><summary>1800a7830</summary><p>SHA256 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b0a0a0dfbab09bedcadc087f0d6f7b9dcd51092a5d6ff75b4ffd0df3172da295" href="../../证据/b0a0a0dfbab09bedcadc087f0d6f7b9dcd51092a5d6ff75b4ffd0df3172da295.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b0a0a0dfbab0</small></a></details><details><summary>1800a0930</summary><p>SHA256 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="dcd9644ff3996782ec690cfd8e72cfb68a5f7415dcb6221d73836005e4adba39" href="../../证据/dcd9644ff3996782ec690cfd8e72cfb68a5f7415dcb6221d73836005e4adba39.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>dcd9644ff399</small></a></details><details><summary>1800a0930</summary><p>SHA256 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="55346ec12ae49ac0763ac1a0eade9e080f5952331c56f14342b6d1d8f55ca9ad" href="../../证据/55346ec12ae49ac0763ac1a0eade9e080f5952331c56f14342b6d1d8f55ca9ad.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>55346ec12ae4</small></a></details><details><summary>Original PE selected data strings</summary><p>SHA256 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="509a294aed2e9245b36110f851cda4ce44ec1710a05f6234e5b418adf1f3fd91" href="../../证据/509a294aed2e9245b36110f851cda4ce44ec1710a05f6234e5b418adf1f3fd91.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>509a294aed2e</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">待核：所有上游失败映射、mask中每个状态的名称、异常与取消的全路径未枚举；不由数值猜业务枚举语义。</p></details><details data-evidence-fact="OG07" id="OG07"><summary>OG07 · DoWork正常退出的本次描述链表 → 退役临时节点与shared持有，结果最后读者仍未知</summary><p>source-confirmed</p><p>DoWork收尾把本次输出链表头复位，逐节点调用a77a0(节点+0xa8)与a03a0(节点+0x18)，operator delete节点，最后delete链表头。a77a0与a03a0对各shared控制块真实LOCK递减强计数，仅强归零调用虚槽0，再递减弱计数，弱归零调用虚槽+8；a77a0还清文本。节点及符合capacity条件的临时文本有直接delete证据，不能把局部shared撤销写成所有结果payload立即释放。</p><p><strong>具体类型、持有与复制：</strong>本次输出订阅描述、shared控制块、typed目标/源载荷、仍可被模块仓或消费者持有的结果分别退役。</p><p><strong>跨轮缓存与失效：</strong>本次列表清除只撤销列表持有；前轮累积结果与其它仓库缓存可能仍存。</p><p><strong>退出与释放边界：</strong>节点/链表头直接delete已证；具体shared动态析构接收者和结果最后读者未在本专题定位，不冒全局无泄漏。</p><details><summary>1800a0930</summary><p>SHA256 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="75f8e47f35dc63ec56e84756956ee86d13a3fd16cc43fc3d869d2870181052ca" href="../../证据/75f8e47f35dc63ec56e84756956ee86d13a3fd16cc43fc3d869d2870181052ca.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>75f8e47f35dc</small></a></details><details><summary>1800a77a0</summary><p>SHA256 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="bd68d4d6a93f45c1b1ca2912b9a8190c910203d1bc2a79d672ccdc2d0af0feaf" href="../../证据/bd68d4d6a93f45c1b1ca2912b9a8190c910203d1bc2a79d672ccdc2d0af0feaf.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>bd68d4d6a93f</small></a></details><details><summary>1800a03a0</summary><p>SHA256 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="33cf62369a4f895f25e059b46bcd795670bd78ef0fa28c05c03af1f93cf4f860" href="../../证据/33cf62369a4f895f25e059b46bcd795670bd78ef0fa28c05c03af1f93cf4f860.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>33cf62369a4f</small></a></details><details><summary>1800a77a0</summary><p>SHA256 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d14caefb25811d640ab3c33d95a7f7966275c7cae0671aa2c843de3ee10a48b0" href="../../证据/d14caefb25811d640ab3c33d95a7f7966275c7cae0671aa2c843de3ee10a48b0.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d14caefb2581</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">待核：typed结果载荷最终free、异常栈展开与并发最后读者未知；正常收尾不是所有异常必清理证明。</p></details></article><article><h4>当前：独立Group调用与托管数据</h4><details data-evidence-fact="CG01" id="CG01"><summary>CG01 · SolutionExecutor.RunAsync与OwnedGroups.Validate → 独占Group body身份及运行文档快照</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>RunAsync先ValidateStructure，其内调用OwnedGroups.Validate：body.GroupOwner是(parentProcedureId,nodeId)，父节点必须为workflow.subprogram且Call.ProcedureId指回body；全solution只能一个节点引用该owned body，所有权链限制三层并拒循环。随后solution快照复制Resources/Procedures、连接、执行边和节点；参数JsonElement逐项Clone，ROI vertices与Call/GroupBreak及Configuration另建结构容器。owned配置先GroupDisplayLinks.Synchronize再Snapshot，不等于保留原文档所有引用。</p><p><strong>具体类型、持有与复制：</strong>身份是稳定ID记录与当前托管模型；数组/字典/JSON克隆与PortValue运行payload是不同复制层。</p><p><strong>跨轮缓存与失效：</strong>本次RunAsync的局部document持有快照到内部Execute闭包结束；并非每轮重新读取workspace.Document的节点参数。资源有另一个边界：初始验证catalog使用快照resources，但每次GraphExecutor的ResourceCatalog构造实参仍为workspace.Document.Resources；不能把全部资源读取也概括为只访问同一快照。</p><p><strong>退出与释放边界：</strong>无document IDisposable或逐值free；快照引用退出可达范围后由托管GC处理，不推实际回收时刻。</p><p>持有者：RunAsync.document / ProcedureDocument.GroupOwner / parent NodeDocument.Call</p><details><summary>SolutionExecutor.RunAsync</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f57f4223dd2b49e3ffcf7e88735d65a6aaedb292155ded7b3707704f7c22174e" href="../../证据/f57f4223dd2b49e3ffcf7e88735d65a6aaedb292155ded7b3707704f7c22174e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f57f4223dd2b</small></a></details><details><summary>SolutionStore.ValidateStructure</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="336274464fa08539434a3c7d6565beec740947c820dece3527dc2ccfdb40d2dc" href="../../证据/336274464fa08539434a3c7d6565beec740947c820dece3527dc2ccfdb40d2dc.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>336274464fa0</small></a></details><details><summary>SolutionExecutor resources preverification</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="cf707ae3178250cd33df441d3e9aee2949dfb61bef99b09288afb16c9ab2105b" href="../../证据/cf707ae3178250cd33df441d3e9aee2949dfb61bef99b09288afb16c9ab2105b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>cf707ae31782</small></a></details><details><summary>SolutionExecutor per-Execute ResourceCatalog</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="36787a0c958c9b12c86dcaa8bd49987f96ed79d38ef7dc87c6ece7b39ac84380" href="../../证据/36787a0c958c9b12c86dcaa8bd49987f96ed79d38ef7dc87c6ece7b39ac84380.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>36787a0c958c</small></a></details><details><summary>OwnedGroups.Validate</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="159b4bd1e7ae3c81e84d69324c03de16b993a9d7273eb829e9ae3bcfb15fb938" href="../../证据/159b4bd1e7ae3c81e84d69324c03de16b993a9d7273eb829e9ae3bcfb15fb938.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>159b4bd1e7ae</small></a></details><details><summary>WorkflowConfiguration.Snapshot</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="6b6e46569c42e81e0ee499c930e2e8828c0d37e9d8232afd3723c61c7f2853e5" href="../../证据/6b6e46569c42e81e0ee499c930e2e8828c0d37e9d8232afd3723c61c7f2853e5.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>6b6e46569c42</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">待核：本次只核当前托管合同，不证明原版GroupOwner或原native布局一致；线程并发编辑的完整宿主锁域未在这里验证。</p></details><details data-evidence-fact="CG02" id="CG02"><summary>CG02 · 父GraphExecutor的workflow.subprogram节点 → 参数/输入处理后进入owned body Call闭包</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>父GraphExecutor先从本轮records建立nodeInputs，再解析Subscriptions覆盖输入或参数、执行Coerce，之后才创建节点linked token。workflow.subprogram分支不registry.Create普通模块，而把Parameters=本轮参数字典及GroupBreak.Capture所得绑定放入node副本，传只读包装nodeInputs交callProcedure。SolutionExecutor.Call按node.Call.ProcedureId找body；GroupOwner为null直接单次Execute，有owner才进入Task.Run的Group循环。Task.Run包整个循环，不是ReadyQueue或各轮并行。</p><p><strong>具体类型、持有与复制：</strong>ReadOnlyDictionary是对局部nodeInputs字典的只读视图；PortValue对象未在该调用点deep-copy。</p><p><strong>跨轮缓存与失效：</strong>values由父调用闭包在多轮复用，参数使用父运行快照并加本轮订阅覆盖；当前代码没有每轮从编辑器重新capture输入。</p><p><strong>退出与释放边界：</strong>父节点持有child session于calls字典；本分支没有新普通module实例，所以不存在该调用节点的module.Dispose动作。</p><p>持有者：parent GraphExecutor.nodeInputs / Call.values / parent calls[nodeId]</p><details><summary>GraphExecutor.RunAsync parameter/input resolve</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e6c1d30503b035417da7859265ad82500d4bf208eb1bcbf21a6bf43581859123" href="../../证据/e6c1d30503b035417da7859265ad82500d4bf208eb1bcbf21a6bf43581859123.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e6c1d30503b0</small></a></details><details><summary>GraphExecutor.RunAsync subprogram invocation</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d317aea19ef91d5936fda2930148f9d2681564f831764c508254611847c6da66" href="../../证据/d317aea19ef91d5936fda2930148f9d2681564f831764c508254611847c6da66.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d317aea19ef9</small></a></details><details><summary>SolutionExecutor.Execute.Call</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d910d8af7f9bf4f0bfb11414f4a16ee774cb53f37a23e1deb5bf139830099d66" href="../../证据/d910d8af7f9bf4f0bfb11414f4a16ee774cb53f37a23e1deb5bf139830099d66.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d910d8af7f9b</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">待核：父nodeInputs与payload本身是否可变取决于具体PortValue/工具数据类型；只读字典不代表深不可变图像内存。</p></details><details data-evidence-fact="CG03" id="CG03"><summary>CG03 · GroupLoop.Read与SolutionExecutor循环 → 每轮索引、独立context与等待控制</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>Read强制LoopTimeGap在0..10000、LoopStep非0；EnableLoop=false时固定Start=0/End=1/Step=1。实际for条件始终index&lt;End，Increment为Start&lt;End?Step:-Step，不把它改述为完整双向区间循环。每轮先childToken.ThrowIfCancellationRequested，再int32范围与10000已完成轮独立资源门，再Evaluate break；通过后await Execute(body.Id,同values,...,index)，completed++，仅Success累积，非Success退出，Success且IntervalMs>0才Delay。</p><p><strong>具体类型、持有与复制：</strong>index是long循环变量，入body的GroupLoopIndex是已核范围后的int；不是全局变量或上轮输出。</p><p><strong>跨轮缓存与失效：</strong>每个Execute新建procedure WaitTime CancellationTokenSource与linked token，新GraphExecutor；内部Graph按ExecutionOrder串行await。</p><p><strong>退出与释放边界：</strong>每次Execute结束其using wait/linked退役；Interval取消抛出而非自动返回已聚合session。</p><p>持有者：Call.local index/completed/last / per-Execute wait/linked token</p><details><summary>GroupLoop.Increment</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="cc753e5c199815af35b13f62deeec504ac6df08b496881840acfaa0f5030bcc6" href="../../证据/cc753e5c199815af35b13f62deeec504ac6df08b496881840acfaa0f5030bcc6.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>cc753e5c1998</small></a></details><details><summary>GroupLoop.Read</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d64ba204e1826ad826c7e6171601d694b448adf16bb2643b7b2883e7749ef1a1" href="../../证据/d64ba204e1826ad826c7e6171601d694b448adf16bb2643b7b2883e7749ef1a1.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d64ba204e182</small></a></details><details><summary>SolutionExecutor.Execute iteration</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f25c4a17972ad6387e9e94a32a39e0580e6590c8d1d80cdc29cea10694feec26" href="../../证据/f25c4a17972ad6387e9e94a32a39e0580e6590c8d1d80cdc29cea10694feec26.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f25c4a17972a</small></a></details><details><summary>SolutionExecutor.Execute timeout ownership</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ef638a855f9ca25bc8b57b5228ab599b6d558951af0d0ec67e43c0f50ec7c7fb" href="../../证据/ef638a855f9ca25bc8b57b5228ab599b6d558951af0d0ec67e43c0f50ec7c7fb.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ef638a855f9c</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">待核：负步长、Start>=End等组合只按现有代码表达；本切片没有运行差分验证，也不称与原生范围语义等价。</p></details><details data-evidence-fact="CG04" id="CG04"><summary>CG04 · 父GraphExecutor.GroupBreak.Capture → 外部操作数与动态下标先冻结，内部/self保留引用描述</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>Capture先解析IndexSource，要求Integer+Scalar且0..int.MaxValue，写入Index并清IndexSource；外部非Self有Source的操作数立即从父workflow.Resolve取Element，再序列化为Constant JsonElement新记录。Inside/Self则保留源描述，供轮前求值。InvalidDataException转成PreparationError记录，并非在Capture处直接终止父节点。Snapshot对原Constant另Clone；Validate约束Self必须指向当前Group节点输出且非Inside、外部索引必须来自前置scalar int。</p><p><strong>具体类型、持有与复制：</strong>外部值冻结为JSON常量；内部数据引用是ID/端口/索引，而非原生指针或同一可变字典。</p><p><strong>跨轮缓存与失效：</strong>一个Group调用期间外部冻结常量不随body轮次更新；PreparationError随该调用传给Evaluate。</p><p><strong>退出与释放边界：</strong>这些记录无显式Dispose；源PortValue只在读取/序列化时短暂持有，未建立外部对象所有权转移。</p><p>持有者：captured NodeDocument.GroupBreak / GroupOperand.Constant/Index/PreparationError</p><details><summary>GroupBreakBindings.Snapshot</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d6f89a0aa26d1cda87d19bf9567006ec653ac3bdeb016a2ddfbd18d676227d06" href="../../证据/d6f89a0aa26d1cda87d19bf9567006ec653ac3bdeb016a2ddfbd18d676227d06.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d6f89a0aa26d</small></a></details><details><summary>GroupBreak.Validate</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="cef5ebf4c489b2b240db107ac6da454f0039c2984cd57ca6b2d2980172a58a2c" href="../../证据/cef5ebf4c489b2b240db107ac6da454f0039c2984cd57ca6b2d2980172a58a2c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>cef5ebf4c489</small></a></details><details><summary>GroupBreak.Capture</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d3d7fb15d998dce9298d9e09ad55501fcad5300993936eddde6d98e59aa86e29" href="../../证据/d3d7fb15d998dce9298d9e09ad55501fcad5300993936eddde6d98e59aa86e29.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d3d7fb15d998</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">待核：未从此声称Capture是所有类型的通用序列化；Group break当前只支持Integer/Number/Text。</p></details><details data-evidence-fact="CG05" id="CG05"><summary>CG05 · GroupBreak.Evaluate与Resolve → 本轮索引/输入、前轮内部值与累计self分开读取</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>break在本轮Execute前求值。previous=null且操作数为Self或Inside的生产者源时直接false，跳过首次内部比较；其他Inside LoopIndex取即将执行的index，WorkflowInput优先本次values，未绑定局部变量读声明初始值。绑定内部NodeOutput/LocalVariable在previous session读取，只允许相应可用源；Self由accumulator.ReadSelfElement读累计片段或last输出。Resolve失败记录最多32条去重diagnostics并返回false，继续执行，而非把缺值当0或自动break。break=true时记录broke/index，不再执行该轮也不增加completed。</p><p><strong>具体类型、持有与复制：</strong>previous=最后已返回body session；它不是新的WorkflowRunContext内部records。Self累计与普通上一轮输出有两个读取域。</p><p><strong>跨轮缓存与失效：</strong>accumulator对可累积输出按elementCounts和片段查找Element；不先JoinArray，避免每次比较都重建全数组。</p><p><strong>退出与释放边界：</strong>替换last会去除上一轮session的这个局部引用，但累积片段/显示/模块state可能另持有同payload；不能直接认定上轮已释放。</p><p>持有者：Call.last / GroupOutputAccumulator.accumulated/elementCounts / GroupDiagnostics</p><details><summary>GroupBreak.Resolve</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="07c327d82bb4a9767cb2a8463f7e1485fc75e6dbd5cc97a8f7d708b482db53f8" href="../../证据/07c327d82bb4a9767cb2a8463f7e1485fc75e6dbd5cc97a8f7d708b482db53f8.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>07c327d82bb4</small></a></details><details><summary>GroupBreak.Evaluate</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="fed0644f84a9b75ba1d82f346cdcd7ba988e2ff89dbeccb469faedb2cdcf9490" href="../../证据/fed0644f84a9b75ba1d82f346cdcd7ba988e2ff89dbeccb469faedb2cdcf9490.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>fed0644f84a9</small></a></details><details><summary>GroupOutputAccumulator.ReadSelfElement</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="307462e51be2d33e25206aa1036c486b6053dc40a63792c53500c13abe860109" href="../../证据/307462e51be2d33e25206aa1036c486b6053dc40a63792c53500c13abe860109.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>307462e51be2</small></a></details><details><summary>SolutionExecutor loop break ordering</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="fb91a38f1802db0f19ac4e6eaa6a636427f9297d48ab89e20f4007ab13cad036" href="../../证据/fb91a38f1802db0f19ac4e6eaa6a636427f9297d48ab89e20f4007ab13cad036.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>fb91a38f1802</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">待核：运行时不支持/不可用数据仅按具体异常门处理；不从false推断用户配置有效或原版也是同策略。</p></details><details data-evidence-fact="CG06" id="CG06"><summary>CG06 · 每轮GraphExecutor → WorkflowRunContext → 独立records/variables与浅输入字典副本</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>每次GraphExecutor.RunAsync先scope.Enter，再建本轮records/calls/descriptors和WorkflowRunContext。context把inputs字典ToDictionary，保留原PortValue；校验输入名/Kind/Cardinality并初始化无SourceNode变量。本轮Record先写records再workflow.Update：绑定该节点的变量先Remove，只有Node成功或NoMatch且含端口时重置引用，源不可用则保持缺值，不沿用前轮变量。Complete另建WorkflowInputs/Outputs/LocalVariables字典，输出仍指向当前本轮PortValue，显示每项新一元素数组包装。</p><p><strong>具体类型、持有与复制：</strong>每轮新容器；PortValue transport是共享引用。GroupLoopIndex解析产生当前索引Integer PortValue。</p><p><strong>跨轮缓存与失效：</strong>没有把前轮WorkflowRunContext.variables复制到下一轮；有状态工具可经solution scope继续持有state，这是另一个生命周期。</p><p><strong>退出与释放边界：</strong>context本身没有Dispose；session字典使成功导出的值继续可达，模块实例Dispose不清session。</p><p>持有者：per-round WorkflowRunContext.arguments/variables/records / ExecutionSessionResult dictionaries</p><details><summary>GraphExecutor.RunAsync scope and context</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="71ee61656e5525cf101be45640ee45b0e7d216b0bfa4c8dd6e0b0c917d3997e8" href="../../证据/71ee61656e5525cf101be45640ee45b0e7d216b0bfa4c8dd6e0b0c917d3997e8.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>71ee61656e55</small></a></details><details><summary>WorkflowRunContext constructor</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d08a5c060f886e4a14b7554c12bf70b28122df4ec1c9549a0a90a8ac8a59412d" href="../../证据/d08a5c060f886e4a14b7554c12bf70b28122df4ec1c9549a0a90a8ac8a59412d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d08a5c060f88</small></a></details><details><summary>WorkflowRunContext.Update</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="96bc138ba3901932cd29e5117ef935953392d7b04b71bacac8fa0128af0a628c" href="../../证据/96bc138ba3901932cd29e5117ef935953392d7b04b71bacac8fa0128af0a628c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>96bc138ba390</small></a></details><details><summary>WorkflowRunContext.Complete</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="794ab932e15347b2bad619c089309cf2256f84b471107637bcb1b08cfe1a540d" href="../../证据/794ab932e15347b2bad619c089309cf2256f84b471107637bcb1b08cfe1a540d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>794ab932e153</small></a></details><details><summary>WorkflowRunContext.GroupLoopIndex</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="3fc60ee18cbd65281eb288a0572c997366e959ead2bd879f824cf16fbc0ce474" href="../../证据/3fc60ee18cbd65281eb288a0572c997366e959ead2bd879f824cf16fbc0ce474.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>3fc60ee18cbd</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">待核：这不是“所有缓存每轮清空”：root scope的node state/参数缓存跨轮仍存；具体工具payload内部可变性与释放依具体实现另证。</p></details><details data-evidence-fact="CG07" id="CG07"><summary>CG07 · 成功轮GroupOutputAccumulator.Add → 保留PortValue片段 → Finish时新JoinArray容器</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>仅last.Status==Success时Add。对body输出中Accumulate且Accumulatable(Integer/Number/Text/Circle/Point/Fixture)的项，按ElementCount计数、百万元素独立资源门，再list.Add(value)保留原PortValue引用，不立即复制元素。Finish先复制last.WorkflowOutputs字典；每个可累计输出即使未有片段也JoinArray(kind,values)，覆盖该名。JoinArray把Elements扁平ToArray，随后typed工厂再ToArray出新底层容器；string元素仍为原string引用，结构类型按值取出。</p><p><strong>具体类型、持有与复制：</strong>累计阶段持有List&lt;PortValue>片段；完成阶段生成typed数组PortValue。Scalar Element(0)返回原对象，Array Element生成scalar包装。</p><p><strong>跨轮缓存与失效：</strong>未累积输出保留last输出引用，累计输出是所有已成功轮片段的拼接；FinishDisplays和Finish分别创建结果容器。</p><p><strong>退出与释放边界：</strong>accumulator没有Dispose，不遍历free元素；返回后片段列表可离开作用域，新session数组仍持有元素/引用，不保证GC时间或native退役。</p><p>持有者：GroupOutputAccumulator.accumulated / Finish result outputs / JoinArray typed array</p><details><summary>GroupOutputAccumulator.Add</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="cc08425268908129828bd5be7a18430e264ced0e084161069f492fba66c037b7" href="../../证据/cc08425268908129828bd5be7a18430e264ced0e084161069f492fba66c037b7.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>cc0842526890</small></a></details><details><summary>GroupOutputAccumulator.Finish</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="22b479e023cc5f341476b4ea104b8d7561ab04014adbeb62c618373f09d33b0e" href="../../证据/22b479e023cc5f341476b4ea104b8d7561ab04014adbeb62c618373f09d33b0e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>22b479e023cc</small></a></details><details><summary>GroupBreak.Accumulatable</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2c882862087768eb7da7057df82257fac24dd928a32420b0165cb9930eb91f62" href="../../证据/2c882862087768eb7da7057df82257fac24dd928a32420b0165cb9930eb91f62.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2c8828620877</small></a></details><details><summary>PortValue.Element</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b22943d02f0ee533096e0ee015ac7f0b02cd294e776a5d2d08cb919996914cde" href="../../证据/b22943d02f0ee533096e0ee015ac7f0b02cd294e776a5d2d08cb919996914cde.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b22943d02f0e</small></a></details><details><summary>PortValue.JoinArray and typed array copies</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="6ca6f7e8275930046ce9dd3ffc4bdcd1469b7f88e3abb6bee8cf75da04caeb0a" href="../../证据/6ca6f7e8275930046ce9dd3ffc4bdcd1469b7f88e3abb6bee8cf75da04caeb0a.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>6ca6f7e82759</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">待核：Struct元素内部若含引用不等于递归深拷贝；这里没有验证所有复合工具类型或原native累积所有权。</p></details><details data-evidence-fact="CG08" id="CG08"><summary>CG08 · Group显示累积与GroupDisplayLinks → GrayImage每轮替换及返回只读列表容器</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>Add显示先找本轮WorkflowDisplays同名值，list不存在则创建；!spec.Accumulate或spec.Kind==GrayImage时先从displayCount减去旧元素数并frames.Clear，再执行百万元素资源门与AddRange(values)。条件仅精确GrayImage，不能泛称所有Image kind。Clear移除旧PortValue引用而不Dispose payload。FinishDisplays用每个frames.ToArray+Array.AsReadOnly并新字典。自动输出显示只支持GrayImage，LinkedOutputId对应输出稳定ID，同步NodeId/Port/Kind/Cardinality。</p><p><strong>具体类型、持有与复制：</strong>显示列表持有PortValue引用；容器复制不复制图像像素。稳定LinkedOutputId是当前独立身份合同。</p><p><strong>跨轮缓存与失效：</strong>只在成功轮Add；body失败轮的显示未加入该accumulator。返回Group WorkflowDisplays来自累积器，不等于执行了WPF绘制。</p><p><strong>退出与释放边界：</strong>旧帧Clear仅减少此列表持有；last、NodeRunRecord、工具scope state或宿主显示可能仍持有同图像，不能当作像素释放完成。</p><p>持有者：GroupOutputAccumulator.displays / WorkflowDisplays / WorkflowInterfaceItem.LinkedOutputId</p><details><summary>GroupOutputAccumulator.Add displays</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="cc08425268908129828bd5be7a18430e264ced0e084161069f492fba66c037b7" href="../../证据/cc08425268908129828bd5be7a18430e264ced0e084161069f492fba66c037b7.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>cc0842526890</small></a></details><details><summary>GroupOutputAccumulator.FinishDisplays</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d6ae3cc7a07b6ee69d12175b01d77fc3b8769de8e8bdb28869e6f44a6f804e94" href="../../证据/d6ae3cc7a07b6ee69d12175b01d77fc3b8769de8e8bdb28869e6f44a6f804e94.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d6ae3cc7a07b</small></a></details><details><summary>GroupDisplayLinks.Synchronize</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="74f883abca9e9b8d82ce2c558553f50fd33cebbb4203cf8db14c47a7f576dafc" href="../../证据/74f883abca9e9b8d82ce2c558553f50fd33cebbb4203cf8db14c47a7f576dafc.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>74f883abca9e</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">待核：本slice没有运行UI，未证明Group图像帧与宿主renderer同次刷新、最后读者或灰度以外图像Kind的预期语义。</p></details><details data-evidence-fact="CG09" id="CG09"><summary>CG09 · Group正常结束/中断/失败/取消 → 末轮session改写聚合，父调用保留Calls但门控输出</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>正常loop出口返回last或新Success空session，再with覆盖CompletedGroupIterations/GroupBroke/GroupBreakIndex/diagnostics/累积outputs与displays。零轮时last为null，Finish对可累积项产生空typed数组；成功break保留前轮节点记录。body返回非Success后先completed++再break，未Add该轮；返回状态仍取last，非累计输出可来自该last。父Graph收到child先存calls[id]，仅child.Success把WorkflowOutputs作为模块结果，否则输出Empty并SubprogramFailed。轮前Throw或Interval Delay抛取消会绕过Group最终聚合return，由父Graph catch/取消/超时门分类，不能宣称任何取消都保留部分累计结果。</p><p><strong>具体类型、持有与复制：</strong>最终Group session只保留last的Nodes/Calls等未被with覆盖字段；并不保存每轮完整session历史。</p><p><strong>跨轮缓存与失效：</strong>累积片段可包含此前Success轮，失败轮不加；但父调用失败时不向正常节点输出发布这些child值，Calls仍可持child诊断。</p><p><strong>退出与释放边界：</strong>Graph finally对普通module先IAsyncDisposable后IDisposable；Dispose错误留error，之后才Record。scope租约与节点module实例是两种退出动作。</p><p>持有者：Call.last/accumulator / parent calls[id] / parent NodeRunRecord</p><details><summary>SolutionExecutor.Call completion</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d49f783d806a0161143aac26e9b73159b953e534652e6e3fc97b6c4a90e01eb1" href="../../证据/d49f783d806a0161143aac26e9b73159b953e534652e6e3fc97b6c4a90e01eb1.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d49f783d806a</small></a></details><details><summary>SolutionExecutor.Execute timeout mapping</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a442b810fe377268e63dd0475d10bff23be56df51d06cd928fdae1069adccd56" href="../../证据/a442b810fe377268e63dd0475d10bff23be56df51d06cd928fdae1069adccd56.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a442b810fe37</small></a></details><details><summary>GraphExecutor child result and module finally</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="22a3c707ea74cc162c2bf85f694236f53afe9d22ae9bb6120dee9e8e1aaa47d8" href="../../证据/22a3c707ea74cc162c2bf85f694236f53afe9d22ae9bb6120dee9e8e1aaa47d8.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>22a3c707ea74</small></a></details><details><summary>GraphExecutor final cancellation status</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f68913b1df0b35ac68aca5c58ab9b03e7c8a095b5fb0fd382db0189265a8ce1f" href="../../证据/f68913b1df0b35ac68aca5c58ab9b03e7c8a095b5fb0fd382db0189265a8ce1f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f68913b1df0b</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">待核：超时/外部取消/Scope.Stopping涉及不同token，不能从一个分支推出所有race结果；本切片仅静态核顺序，没有新运行探针。</p></details><details data-evidence-fact="CG10" id="CG10"><summary>CG10 · 每轮scope.Enter/ForProcedure与solution关闭 → 跨轮state/有效参数持有，closing后等租约再释放</summary><p>independent-implementation</p><p>GraphExecutor每次RunAsync using scope.Enter；body与父run沿用同root scope。模块context的Scope为ForProcedure(p.Id)借用view，State缓存键为(procedure,module,node)，因此同body多轮同键复用state而非每轮Dispose。RememberExecutionParameters在模块入口前对seed/applied逐JsonElement.Clone，覆写该键缓存。scope.Dispose对借用view无动作；root先closing=true并Cancel stopping，取消完成且leases==0才TryRelease，最后Exit也可触发。Release先快照distinct states+ownedServices，再清states/effectiveParameters/services/ownedServices，再逐IDisposable.Dispose，异常记录并保留failedResources。</p><p><strong>具体类型、持有与复制：</strong>运行租约、跨轮node state、参数JSON克隆缓存和结果session payload分别持有；非owned服务只从字典移除，不由Release列入dispose值。</p><p><strong>跨轮缓存与失效：</strong>结束一次Group只退出它的Graph租约，不自动关闭solution root或清node state；RemoveNode另按procedure键移除state与参数，并在锁外Dispose该state。</p><p><strong>退出与释放边界：</strong>root释放是IDisposable路径，不await IAsyncDisposable-only state；清字典不证明外部引用消失，cleanup失败对象被failedResources继续持有。Lease.Interlocked.Exchange保证一次Exit。</p><p>持有者：ModuleExecutionScope.Root.states/effectiveParameters/services / borrowed procedure view / Lease / failedResources</p><details><summary>ModuleExecutionScope.ForProcedure</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9af9ceff47aa44aa1272f50a0c6141d393421d9080eb4221f686ec047ef1f97d" href="../../证据/9af9ceff47aa44aa1272f50a0c6141d393421d9080eb4221f686ec047ef1f97d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9af9ceff47aa</small></a></details><details><summary>ModuleExecutionScope.State</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b70c7dfc27c1831ec0c54986c719bacb2e6064766684a2425b3188e5d8c7446c" href="../../证据/b70c7dfc27c1831ec0c54986c719bacb2e6064766684a2425b3188e5d8c7446c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b70c7dfc27c1</small></a></details><details><summary>ModuleExecutionScope.Enter/RemoveNode</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="aa03c399d66cebfe3502194eb78736037d9e9e7e16e056127313042974ce1b5f" href="../../证据/aa03c399d66cebfe3502194eb78736037d9e9e7e16e056127313042974ce1b5f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>aa03c399d66c</small></a></details><details><summary>ModuleExecutionScope.Dispose/Release</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="910c59b5c0f05ac2f9036c1c798aa20981750a3b6432f0936cc1b1cc170861a1" href="../../证据/910c59b5c0f05ac2f9036c1c798aa20981750a3b6432f0936cc1b1cc170861a1.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>910c59b5c0f0</small></a></details><details><summary>ModuleExecutionScope.RecordCleanupFailure</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="667d84c52f018741334ebe41c9094af0e41b74238b795cd1b7c240d6bab018be" href="../../证据/667d84c52f018741334ebe41c9094af0e41b74238b795cd1b7c240d6bab018be.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>667d84c52f01</small></a></details><details><summary>ModuleExecutionScope.RememberExecutionParameters</summary><p>not revalidated in this slice</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="99ae484ea03c0a0ea3eb03108afbd15792354aac60604e97f9aec26988e6a925" href="../../证据/99ae484ea03c0a0ea3eb03108afbd15792354aac60604e97f9aec26988e6a925.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>99ae484ea03c</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">待核：谁创建/最终Dispose宿主root scope需在具体solution lifecycle入口另追；本页不把局部Group结束等同应用关窗。</p><p class="dd-gap">待核：当前源码的参数缓存不是native SDK SetParam已确认值；cleanup异常、外部state引用和具体图像原生资源由实现另证。</p></details></article></div><p class="dd-gap">OGU01 · typed input/output target binding and dynamic execution receiver：12dcb0、输入typed helper和虚执行对象具体调度未在本切片补全；不把每轮输入视为深快照。</p><p class="dd-gap">OGU02 · all output families and final payload retirement：普通int/float/string索引复制分支已见；图像/复合、全数组、溢出、异常、取消和最后读者仍未知。</p><p class="dd-gap">CGU01 · original Group semantics and native retirement：当前全部事实是独立托管实现，不替代原版分支/ABI/同轮/最后读者证明。</p><p class="dd-gap">CGU02 · current Group runtime integration：本轮只读源码，未新跑Group probe、原版、SDK、设备或WPF；分支race/宿主scope关闭需独立验证。</p><p class="dd-gap">CGU03 · payload final lifetime：List.Clear/字典移除/局部last替换是引用变更；像素native所有者、外部session持有和GC最终时刻不能由容器动作推断。</p><p class="dd-gap">当前合成流程观察不验证原版、真实插件算法、主窗显示、所有Group类型或最终native读者。</p></section></div></main><footer class="site-footer"><nav><a href="../index.html">首页／界面入口</a><a href="../主题/主界面入口.html">主界面</a><a href="../工具/index.html">工具窗口</a><a href="../数据/index.html">数据与 Owner</a><a href="../主题/执行与状态.html">执行与结果</a><a href="../清单/交付与兼容.html">范围／兼容</a></nav><p class="site-progress">文档分页不增加产品实施完成数。主框架口径：41/96＝42.71%；本批实施增量 0。</p></footer><script src="../公共资源/routes.js"></script><script src="../公共资源/site.js"></script></body></html>